<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Bible Kiyaka</book>
  <para style="h">MATHAYI</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mathayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mth</para>
  <para style="toc1">Musamu wa Bukheti kasonika Mathayi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Musamu kásonika Mathayi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mathayi</para>
  <para style="imt">Khotidi ya mukanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wa Bukheti wa Mathayi wubati zonzila Bakidisitu babana benina Bayuta. Bawu bazayi mboti mboti mikanda mya Bulunda bwa Khulu. Mathayi kabati muzonzila Yesu hanga wuna wisi lungisa mana bázonzila muna mikanda meni mina. Kisi zonzilamya kosu tangwa. Tangwa kabati sonika Mathayi, bakidisitu babana ba kisina kya Bayuta bábakukwasa mu nzu za bisambu za Bayuta. Hanga bayidiki mangumba kikuma kya kuyambilaka batu babana bakondi kala Bayuta.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kikuma kya Mathayi, Yesu kenina "Mulongi" wuna wenina yi hamu dya kuzimbula mambu mana kisi lomba Nzambi kwena bakwikidi. Mulongi meni wuna kabati songila phila ya pha ya kubakisila mitsiku mina myátuka ku Bulunda bwa Khulu. Yesu kenina "Kidisitu" ho loni "Masiya" wuna bisi hingila Bayuta. Mu kuzonzila Kipfumu kya mazilu, kabati zonza bwabu: Nzambi kenina Kyamvu, amana kipfumu kyandi kisi monika kedi ha tsi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wa Bukheti wa Mathayi wisi landa nzila ya mikanda mitatu mya theti mya bulunda bwa pha.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muna kati dya nzila meni yina, Mathayi wákhokika ndinga za Yesu mu mazimbu matanu: Dya theti: yandika khaphu ya tanu yi kuna tsambwadi, ho loni zimbu hana thandu ya mongu, mwamuna bazonzidi mutsiku wumosi kikuma kya luzingu lwa balonguki ba Yesu. Mutsiku wuna wutadidi hika luzingu mu kati dya batu, bawu yi bawu, mu kati dya batu yi Nzambi. Zimbu dya khaphu ya kumi dibati senda yi kuhana malongi kwena bana bisi kwenda mwanga Musamu wa Bukheti. Zimbu dya khaphu ya kumi yi tatu dibati wongika bingana bina kisi ta Yesu kikuma kya kuzayikisa mana misi luta yuka ni Nzambi kakala kyamvu. Zimbu dya khaphu ya kumi yi nana dibati tendula abweti bufwani kuzingila mu kimosi ha kati dya baphangi ba bayakala yi baphangi ba bakhetu muna kimvuka kya bakidisitu. Zimbu dya khaphu ya makumodi yi ya yi dina dya khaphu ya makumodi yi tanu dibati zimbula buna bafwani balonguki kuhingila kinunga kya tsuka kya Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ku thwala yi ku manima ma mazimbu mamana, mameni mabati tendula abweti Yesu kisi belula bambefu, kisi hana madya kwena milumba-lumba mya batu, kisi ta bingana bina byisi tuma mu kuyindula, kisi finda phaka yi bapfumu ba bayuta.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ku luyandiku lwa Musamu wa Bukheti, Mathayi kabati zonzila lubutuku yi kileki kya Yesu, kyamvu wa Bayuta (khaphu ya 1 yi 2). Ku tsuka ya mukanda, Yesu, kyamvu wa bayuta, bamuzengidi lufwa ndangu bamukhoka ha kitakani (khaphu ya 27). Kaasi Nzambi wámufutumuna ku bafwa. Yesu wádimonikisa kwena balonguki bandi. Wubalombi kusamuna Musamu wa Bukheti kwena batu boosu ba tsi (khaphu ya 28).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ku thwala lubutuku lwandi, Yesu bisi mutela "Manwedi", disongidila: «Nzambi ha kimosi yi betu.» (1:23) Musamu wa Bukheti wa Mathayi wumanisini yi lusilu lwalu lwa Yesu: «Amana meni yenina yi benu bilumbu byosu tii yi kuna tsuka ya tsi.» (28:20) Yesu kenina Nzambi mu kati dya batu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Bakhaka ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Tala ndala ya Yesu Kidisitu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhowu wawu "Kidisitu" wubati hana kifwanisu kya kyamvu yi muhuludi wuna kasila Nzambi mu kutuma.</char></note>, mwana wa Tavidi<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu khama tsambwadi za mvula, ku thwala Yesu, Nzambi wasila ni Masiya mwana wa kyamvu Tavidi kakala. (Yes 9:6-7; 11:1-5; Yel 23:5) </char></note> yi mwana wa Bulahami.<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Bulahami kábuta Yizaki amana Yizaki kábuta Yakobi; Yakobi kábuta Yuta yi baphangi bandi ba bayakala; <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Yuta kábuta Fwalesi yi Zala, ngudi wa bawu Thamadi; Fwalesi kábuta Hesiloni; Hesiloni kábuta Alami; <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Alami kábuta Aminatabi; Aminatabi wábuta Nasoni; Nasoni kábuta Salamani; <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>amana Salamani kábuta Bowasi, ngudi wandi Lahabi; Bowasi kábuta Yobedi ngudi wandi Luti; Yobedi kábuta Yese <verse eid="MAT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Yese kábuta Tavidi wuna wákituka kyamvu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Tavidi Kábuta Solumoni, yi mukhetu wa Wudiye; <verse eid="MAT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Solumoni kábuta Lobuwami; Lobuwami kábuta Abiya; Abiya kábuta Azafu; <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Azafu kábuta Yosafati; Yosafati kábuta Yolami; Yolami kábuta Ozyasi; <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Ozyasi kábuta Yowatami; Yowatami kábuta Akhazi; Akhazi kábuta Ezekyasi; <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Ezekyasi kábuta Manase; Manase kábuta Amosi; Amosi kábuta Yozyasi; <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>Yozyasi kábuta Yekonya yi baphangi bandi ba bayakala; mu tangwa bákala mu tsi ya kinzenza ku Babiloni.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Amana kunima dya kukota mu kinzenza ku Babiloni, Yekonya kábuta Salasyedi; Salasyedi kábuta Zolubabedi; <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Zolubabedi kábuta Abiwudi, Abiwudi kábuta Edyakimi; Edyakimi kábuta Azolu, <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Azolu kábuta Satoki; Satoki kábuta Akimi; Akimi kábuta Ediwudi; <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Ediwudi kábuta Eleyazadi; Eleyazadi kábuta Matani; Matani kábuta Yakobi; <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Yakobi kábuta Yozefu, yakala dya Madiya, kwena Madiya kwábutuka Yesu, wuna bisi tela Kidisitu.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Disongidila, makula kumi yi maya máhita, tukidila Bulahami tii yi kuna Tavidi, amana makula kumi yi maya hika máhyoka, tukidila Tavidi tii yi kuna kinzenza kya ku Babiloni, amana makula kumi yi maya máhyoka tukidila mu kinzenza kya ku Babiloni tii yi kuna Kidisitu.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubutuku lwa Yesu Kidisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Amana tala buna lwákadila lubutuku lwa Yesu Kidisitu. Madiya, ngudi wandi, kákala mbayi wa Yozefu; ku thwala ya kikhunda kya lutu lwa bawu, wádimona ku vumu mu ngolu za Kitembu kyatoma. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Amana Yozefu, yakala dyandi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yozefu kabanza ni mbongi kata mukhetu wandi. Disongidila, kazolaku hika kumukwela. </char></note>, kakala wabukheti yi wasungama amana kátondaku kumuyukisa tsoni ha mbasi, kahanga, wubongi dibanza dya kumuyambula mu kitsweki. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Bwosu kákalabwa banza, hanga wanzyo wa Pfumu wumulubwakidi mu ndosi amana wuzimbudi: «Yozefu, mwana wa Tavidi, kalaku yi bweya bwa kutambula, Madiya, hanga mukhetu waku, mukuma kifundu kya mwana wuna kayimiti, kwena Kitembu Kyatoma kitukini. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Amana kabúta mwana mosi wa yakala, amana wamutediki mu khumbu ya Yesu<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Disongidila dya khumbu ya Yesu «Nzambi kisi hulula». </char></note>, mukuma yandi wahúlula kikanda kyandi ku masumu mandi.»<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Moosu mana máhangama ndangu malungila mana kázimbula Pfumu mu nzila ya mbikudi:<verse eid="MAT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>«Ndumba wakonda kedi zaya yakala, kayímita vumu amana kabúta mwana mosi wa yakala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">amana bamútediki mu khumbu ya Manwedi.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:23">Disongidila: «Nzambi kenina ha kimosi yi betu.»<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Mu kutokama kwandi, Yozefu wáhanga buna kámulongikila wanzyo wa Pfumu, amana wátambula mukhetu wandi. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Kaasi kámuzayaku lutu tii yi kuna kabutila mwana mosi wa yakala, wuna káheka yandi khumbu ya Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Banganga ba bathetimbwa bisi tala Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Amana kunima lubutuku lwa Yesu, ku Betelemi dya Yuteya, mu tangwa dya kyamvu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyamvu: khumbu yina básonika mu mikanda mya kisina yibati zonzila "Thotila", kaasi ndinga ya betu bisiya yala kwena "bapfumu". Yi kikuma kina tuzodi kubalumuna khumbu ya "thotila" ha kifulu kya "kyamvu".</char></note> Eloti, hanga banganga ba bathetimbwa bátuka ku Kola, bisa tula ku Yelusalemi; <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>amana bázimbula: «Akweti kenina kyamvu wa Bayuta wuna wubutukini? Mukuma tumonikini katumbwa kandi kuna Kola, amana thwisi fukama ku thwala ya yandi.» <verse eid="MAT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Amana mu kuyuka musamu wuna, kyamvu Eloti wákituka yangalakanu, yi Yelusalemi dyosu kumosi yi yandi. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Amana wákhokisa bambuta ba banganga Nzambi boosu yi balongi ba mitsiku mya kanda, mu kubahyula keti kubiki kafwani kubutwakila Kidisitu? <verse eid="MAT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Amana bawu bámuzimbwala: «Ku Betelemi dya Yuteya, mukuma tala mana másonama kwena mbikudi:»<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>"Amana ngeyi, Betelemi, mulambu wa Yuteya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">mu kyedika, weku wa khunda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">muna kati dya mbanza za mbuta za Yuteya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">mukuma mwena ngeyi mwalúbwakila mutwadisi mosi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">wuna wakála muhungudi wa Kiseledi, kanda dyama".<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>«Hanga Eloti wutedisi banganga ba bathetimbwa ku phengu amana wázikisa kwena bawu tangwa dya kumonika kwa katumbwa.» <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Amana buna kábatuma ku Betelemi wuzimbudi: «Ndenu lwenda zikisa tsikiningi ya mambu kikuma kya mwana, amana, tangwa lwamúsengumuna, alwisa nzayisa, ndangu meni phi yisa fukama ku thwala yandi.»<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Amana kunima dya kuyuka kyamvu, bénda. Kinga katumbwa kana bámona ku Kola wábatekidila kuna thwala; buna katula hana thandu ya homa hana kákala mwana, hanga wutelami. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Amana buna bámona katumbwa, báyuka kyesi kya lawu. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Bákota muna nzu, bámona mwana yi Madiya ngudi wandi, bábwa muna malu mandi, kikuma kya kufukama ku thwala yandi, kunima bákangula mafuka ma bawu amana bámulambwala makabu: wolu, pfwabidi yi mila<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wolu dyenina hanga tadi dya thalu ya lawu. Bisi sadiladya hanga mbongu yi kuyidikila bilunga. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Pfwabidi yena kisi dya thalu ya lawu yina bisi yoka kikuma kya kulubula tsudi ya kitoku. Bisi yidikaya yi budimbu bwa miti myafwanakana. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Mila mena mananasi ma thalu ya lawu bisi yidikama yi budimbu bwa miti wumosi. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Kunima, Nzambi wábalwengisa mu ndosi ni bavutwakilaku hika kwena Eloti; hanga, bávutwakila ku nzila ya hika ku tsi ya bawu.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutina ku Ngiphiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Kunima kukwenda kwa bawu, wanzyo wa Pfumu wámonika kwena Yozefu, mu ndosi amana wámuzimbwala: «Telama, bonga mwana yi ngudi wandi, amana tina ku Ngiphiti, zakala kwakuna tii yi kuna yikúzimbwala mu kuvutwakisa. Mukuma ka thama ku, Eloti kasánda mwana mu kumuhondisa.» <verse eid="MAT 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Yozefu wátelama, wábonga muna phipha mwana yi ngudi wandi, watina ku Ngiphiti. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>Hanga wuzakadini kwakuna tii yi kuna lufwa lwa Eloti. Mambu mana másalama ndangu malungila mana kázimbula Pfumu mwena mbikudi: «Yimútela mwana wama kalubuka ku Ngiphiti<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oze 11:1</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuhonda kwa bana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Tangwa kádimona Eloti ni bamuhuni kwena banganga ba bathetimbwa, nganzi zandi zátombuka lawu. Wátuma bahonda bana ba bayakala boosu, yandikila mvula zodi yi kuna banda, bana bákala ku Betelemi yi kuna milambu myandi; bwosu tangwa dina kádizikisila kwena banganga ba bathetimbwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Kinga bwabuna málungila mana mázonzama kwena mbikudi Yelemiya:<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>«Ndinga mosi yibati yukalakana ku hata dya Lama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">bidilu yi makana ma lawu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Lakhedi wuna wubati dila bana bandi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">katondiku ni bamuhomba kikuma bafini<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yel 31:15 </char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvutuka ku Ngiphiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Kunima lufwa lwa Eloti, hanga, wanzyo wa Pfumu wámonika mu ndosi kwena Yozefu, muna Ngiphiti. <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>Wámuzibwala: «Telama<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhowu wawu "telama" wusongidi hika: "tokama", "vumbuka" amana ndawenda. </char></note>, bonga mwana yi ngudi wandi, amana vutuka muna tsi ya Kiseledi, mukuma babana bakala sanda moya wa mwana, bamani fwa.» <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Amana Yozefu wátelama, wábonga mwana yi ngudi wandi wávutuka ku tsi ya Kiseledi. <verse eid="MAT 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Kaasi, ha káyuka ni Alakelawusu wuyadi ku Yuteya ha kifulu kya Eloti tata wandi; wáyuka bweya mu kuvutukakwa; bámulwengisa hika mu ndosi amana wáyombuka ku milambu mya Ngadidi. <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>Hanga, wisa kala muna mbanza mosi bisi tela, Nazaleti, ndangu malungila mana mázonzama mwena bambikudi: «bamútediki Mwisi Nazaleti.»<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Malongi ma Yowani Mubotiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-18">Mlk 1:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Ywn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Kunima mvula za lawu, wátula Yowani Mubotiki, kakala samuna muna nganga ya Yuteya amana wekina zimbula: <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>«Balumunenu mbundu, mukuma Kipfumu kya mazilu kibwesukini<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kubalumuna kwa mbundu kubati songila kuluta «kuyanana» holo «kubalumuna mabanza»; nzonzidi yina yibati zonzila mbikutulu zina za bulunda bwa khulu, tangwa bakala mutela Kiseledi mu «kuvutuka kwena Nzambi», mu kuyambula mutwa wa ngolu ndangu kakala yi bulemvu bwosu buna bwálomba bulunda. Kubalumuna kwa mbundu kwisa mupfunu wa lawu ku mwini wa kukwisa kwa Kipfumu kya mazilu. </char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Kinga yandu kenina wuna kázonzila mbikudi Yesaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">«Ndinga mosi yibati kalunga muna nganga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">Yidikenu nzila ya Pfumu<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yayi yena phila ya kufwanikisa. Mathayi kazonzila Yesaya mu kuzimbula ni batu bafwana kuyilama ndangu Pfumu kisa. Bakala yi mupfunu wa kubalumuna mbundu yi kuyidika mbundu za bawu yi luzingu lwa bawu mu ngisilu yandi. Yesaya káfwanikisa mambu mamana yi kuyidika kwa nzila kikuma kya kuyambila Pfumu. </char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">sungikenu mikinda myandi.»<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Yandi Yowani kákala yi muledi wa mwika mya kamela<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kamela kena mbisi mosi wa mbuta wa mu hata, kisi tikula batu yi bifunda mu nganga. </char></note> amana kakala vwata mukaba wa tsibu muna mbunda; kakala dya baphasu yi bwiki bwa mu tseki<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbandu ya luzingu yi miledi mya Yowani myakala songila kwena batu ba bilumbu byabi ni yandi mbikudi kakala. Kakala fwanakana yi mbikudi Diya (2Th 1:8).</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Bisi Yelusalemi yi bisi Yuteya yi bisi mulambu wuna wosu wa kinzunga kya Yolutani, bakala kwenda kwena yandi. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Amana bakala babotika muna nzadi Yolutani bwabuna bákala funguna masumu ma bawu.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Amana bwosu kámona lawu dya Bafwadisi<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bafwadisi bakala dingumba dimosi dya basadi basambidi bana bakala lunda mitsiku mya bakhaka ba bawu. Bakala landila mboti-mboti mitsiku mya kuwakana kwa khulu yi kuyika mitsiku mya hika. Bakala mu dingumba dimosi dina dyakala dimonikisa lawu ku thwala ya Bayuta bahika amana bakala bazitisa phi lawu kwena Bayuta bahika. </char></note> yi Basadise<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Basadise bakala dingumba dya basadi ba Nzambi bana bakala lunda mitsiku mya bakhaka ba Bayuta. Bawu bakala zitisa lwesi mitsiku mya bulunda bwa khulu kikuma bakosikila keti mutsiku mosi. Kaasi bakalaku kwikila mu mambu matadidi banzyo keti bitembu, keti mu lufutumuku lwa bafwa. Bawu phi batambwasa mabanza mahika ma baphani. Bakala kibuka kya khunda kaasi bakala yi ngolu mu mambu ma leta. Bawu bakala kaka bamvwama. </char></note> bakala kwisa ku mbotika ya yandi, kikuma kya kubotama; amana wubazimbwadini: «Mbandu ya masawa! Nati wululongisidi mu kutina kyana, khabu za Nzambi zazi zakwísa? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Songilenu mu bibundu bya bukheti ni lusobini bikalulu byenu; <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>amana lubanzaku mu kudizonzilaka: "Thwenina yi tata wetu Bulahami<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzambi kámusola Bulahami kikuma kya kuyandika kanda dimosi dya batu bandi básolama. Kinga, mu tangwa dya Yowani, Bayuta balawu bazola ni, bwosu básolama kwena Nzambi, bakala kwikila ni batu ba masonga benina ku thwala ya Nzambi. Bakala banza ni Nzambi kabahekaku ndola ku pfundusu ya tsuka. </char></note>". Mukuma, mbati luzimbwala ni Nzambi wufwani, muna matadi mama, kukitula bana ba Bulahami! <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/><note caller="i" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yowani kakala zimbula ni bwosu kenina mutu wosu bela-bela mu kuzenga miti wosu wuna wisiku buta bibundu bya bukheti, Nzambi kenina bela-bela mu kuhana ndola kwena batu bana bisiku hanga mihangu mya mboti mina mibati songila ni babalumuni mbundu. </char></note>Amana kisoka kya kusikula kedi kyenina hana sina dya miti: disongidila miti wosu wuna wisiku ha kibundu kya bukheti bakwángawa amana balósawa ku mbawu. <verse eid="MAT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>Meni, mbati lubotika mu mamba, mu kusongila ni lubalumuni mbundu; kaasi wuna wisi kwisa ku manima ma meni, wunduti meni mu ngolu, <note caller="k" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuvwata tsabatu zandi: kyakala kisalu kimosi muna bisalu bya bahika. </char></note>yeku walunga mu kumuwomuna tsabatu zandi, kalúbotika mu Kitembu kyatoma yi mu mbawu. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Kenina yi muyungulu hana koku dyandi kikuma kya kuhambula ngenza yi tswala; kasóla ngenza za bukheti, wulumbikiza muna khila, kaasi kayóka tswala mu mbawu yina yisiku zima<note caller="l" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu bakala mufwanikisa yi mukwa mahata. Musadi wa bilanga kisi hambula ngenza yi tswala. Kisi sweka ngenza amana wuyoki tswala. Buna kakwísa Yesu, kahámbula batu bana básoba bikalulu bya bawu mboti-mboti yi bana bakonda soba bikalulu bya bawu. Katámbula, muna Kipfumu kya Nzambi, boosu bana básoba bikalulu kaasi kazánga bana bakonda soba bikalulu. </char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbotika ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mlk 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Hanga Yesu wutuki ku Ngadidi yi kuna nzadi Yolutani; wenda kwena Yowani ndangu bamubotika kwena yandi. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Yowani wábwisabwa amana wámuzimbwala: «Meni yenina yi mupfunu wa kubotama kwena ngeyi amana ngeyi wisi kwena meni!» <verse eid="MAT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Kaasi Yesu wámuvutwala: «Yambula bwahangama bwabuna mu tangwa dyadi. Mukuma muna phila meni yayina twalúngisila mambu moosu mana kabati lomba Nzambi.» Hanga yandi wutambwasi. <verse eid="MAT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Amana buna kábotama Yesu, wálubuka mu mamba. Muna tangwa meni dyadina, mazilu mákanguka: wámona Kitembu wa Nzambi kukulumuka hanga yembi amana wisi hana thandu ya yandi. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Ndinga mosi yátuka ku zilu yizonzi: «Yandu kenina <note caller="m" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzambi kenina Tata wa Yesu Mwana mu phila yina yifwanakaniku yi yina ya batu, batata yi bana ba bawu. Bibila dibati sadila muhowu wa Mwana mu kusongila ni Yesu kena phila mosi yi Nzambi amana phi kwena Nzambi katuka.</char></note>Mwana wa meni watondama; mwena yandi tsidini kyesi kyama.»<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Kuhukumuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mlk 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Hanga Yesu bamunatisi, kwena Kitembu, muna nganga, ndangu bamuhukumuna kwena kiphidi-mutu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kiphidi-mutu kenina pfumu wa bitembu bya mbi byosu. Kakala theti wanzyo mosi ku zilu, kaasi kahanga wusi lulendu ku thwala ya Nzambi. Nzambi wamukukwasa ku zilu amana buthwena kisi hukumuna batu ha tsi. Tala khumbu zandi za hika Satana zina zenina mu Bibila: «Belezebula»: «mbeni» yi «muhukumuni». </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Amana kunima kuzila kudya bilumbu makumaya bya mwini yi phipha makumaya, wáyuka nzala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Amana muhukumuni<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhowu wawu muhukumuni wubati fwanakana yi kiphidi-mutu, pfumu wa bitembu bya mbi. Kulemvula batu kwena mosi wa mihangu myandi. Kosu tangwa, kisi meka kusumuna batu. </char></note> wisa bwesuka, wámuzimbwala: «Yukani <note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzambi tata kenina Tata wa mwana wandi, Yesu Kidisitu, bweku phila mosi yi mutu wuna wena tata wa bana bandi. Bibila dibati muheka Yesu khumbu ya Mwana (Mwana wa yakala) wa Nzambi mu kusongila ni Yesu phila mosi kenina yi Tata wandi. </char></note>Mwana wa Nzambi wenina, zimbula kwena matadi mama, makituka mapha.» <verse eid="MAT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Amana, yandi wámuvutwala: «Tala mana másonama: "Mutu kazingilaku mu madya lwesi, kaasi mu ndinga yosu yina yisi lubuka mu munwa wa Nzambi".»<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Hanga Kiphidi-Mutu wumunati ku Yelusalemi, mbanza yatoma, wumunenginiki hana kisoka kya mudilu wa nzu ya Nzambi, <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>amana wumuzimbwadi: «Yukani Mwana wa Nzambi wenina, tsutsuka ha tsi, mukuma tala mana masonama:»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">"Kahana kwena banzyo bandi miswa kikuma kya ngeyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">amana bakwisa kuyaka muna moku ma bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">ndangu kitambi kyaku kidikhukulaku ku tadi dimosi."<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Yesu wumuvutwadi: «Tala mana másonama hika: "Wamekaku Pfumu, Nzambi waku."»<verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Kiphidi-mutu wámunata hika ha mongu wa kaleyi lawu, wámusongila bipfumu byosu bya tsi yi khembu ya byawu, <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>amana wumuzimbwadi: «Yikuheka bima bina byosu, yuka ni wabwa mu bitambi byama mu kufukama ku thwala meni.» <verse eid="MAT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Hanga Yesu wumuzimbwadi: «Katuka Satana! Mukuma tala mana másonama: "Ku thwala Pfumu, Nzambi waku, lwesi wafúkama amana yandi lwesi wasámbila."» <verse eid="MAT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Hanga kiphidi-mutu wumusisi. Amana banzyo bábwesuka amana bekina musadila.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuyandikini kisalu kyandi ku Ngadidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mlk 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Amana buna káyuka ni Yowani bamulambudi, hanga wáyombuka ku Ngadidi. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Amana wákatuka ku Nazaleti, wenda kala ku Kafadinawumu, ku mukinda wa yanga dya mbuta, muna milambu mya Zabuloni yi Nefutadi. <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Ndangu dyalungila dyambu dina bázimbula mwena mbikudi Yesaya:<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>«Tsi ya Zabuloni, tsi ya Nefutadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">mukinda wa nzadi, yi kuna sambwa dya Yolutani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">Ngadidi ya makanda ma batu!<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>Kanda dina dyákala mu phipha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">dimoni mutemu wa lawu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Yi kwena bana bázakala mu kinzunga yi mu kivula kya lufwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">mutemu wumosi wumoniki kwena bawu!»<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Tuka tangwa meni dina, Yesu wáyandika kusamuna yi kulonga: «Balumunenu mbundu zenu mukuma Kipfumu kya mazilu kibwesukini!»<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balonguki baya batheti ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mlk 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Amana Yesu buna kakala kangala muna mukinda wa yanga dya Ngadidi, wámona baphangi bodi, Simoni, wuna bisi tela Phetelu, yi Andele myaki wandi; bakala losa wanda dimosi muna yanga dya mbuta, mukuma balobi bákala. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Hanga wubazimbwadi: «Alwisa ndanda, amana yilukitula balobi ba batu.» <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Amana bawu, muna mbala mosi, básisa mawanda, benda mulanda. <verse eid="MAT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Amana buna kaphusana, wámona baphangi bahika bodi, Zyaki mwana wa Zebeteya yi Yowani, phangi wandi, bákala muna mudimba yi tata wa bawu Zebeteya, bakala yilulula mawanda ma bawu. Yesu wabatela; <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Amana bawu muna mbala mosi básisa mudimba yi tata wa bawu, amana bámulanda.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kisi longa amana kisi belula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Amana kakala kwenda muna Ngadidi yosu; mu kulonga muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta za bawu yi kusamuna Musamu wa Bukheti wa Kipfumu kya mazilu, amana kakala belula maladi moosu yi bimbefu byosu mu kati dya batu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Amana khululuka ya yandi yámwangana mu mulambu wosu wa Sidiya. Amana bakala munatina batu boosu babana bákala bela, babana bákala yi makhasi ma mutindu yi mutindu yi miyangu mya bitembu bya mbi yi bakwa kikhoni, yi khonzu, amana wubabeludi. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Milumba-lumba mya batu bakala mulanda; tuka mu Ngadidi yi kuna mulambu wa Mbanza Kumi yi ku Yelusalemi yi ku Yuteya yi ku sambwa dikwawu dya Yolutani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Malongi hana thandu ya mongu</para>
  <para style="s1">(Mth 5-7)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Amana tangwa kámona milumba-lumba mya batu, wátombuka ku mongu, amana buna kázakala, balonguki bandi bábwesuka kwena yandi <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>amana mu kukangula munwa wandi, wáyandika kubalonga bwabu:<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mamboti ma kyedika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>«Kyesi kwena bana bena baphutu mu kitembu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:3">mukuma Kipfumu kya mazilu kyenina kwena bawu!<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>Kyesi kwena bana bisi dila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:4">mukuma bakwisa bahomba!<verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>Kyesi kwena bana benina balembama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:5">mukuma bavwáya tsi.<verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>Kyesi kwena bana benina yi nzala yi kihwinya kya masonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:6">mukuma bawu bayúkuta!<verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Kyesi kwena bana bisi yukila bakwawu kyadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:7">mukuma Nzambi kyadi kabáyukila!<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>Kyesi kwena bana benina yi mbundu ya hedila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:8">mukuma bawu bamóna Nzambi!<verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Kyesi kwena bana bisi yadisa ngemba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:9">mukuma bawu babátela bana ba Nzambi!<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>Kyesi kwena bana bisi nyokuna kikuma kya masonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:10">mukuma Kipfumu kya mazilu kyenina kwena bawu!<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>Kyesi lwenina kyawu mu tangwa bisi lutukwana amana bisi lunyokuna amana bisi luhunina misamu mya mutindu yi mutindu kikuma kya meni. <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Sangwalenu, amana kalenu mu kyesi, mukuma lufutu lwenu lwa lawu lwenina mu mazilu, mukuma, yi bwabuna phi bábanyokuna bambikudi bana balutekidila.»<verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mungwa yi Kyesesi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mlk 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>«Benu lwenina mungwa wa tsi. Kaasi yukani mungwa wekina laku-laku, yi biki balenda vutwalawa mutomu? Wa phamba, weku hika mupfunu, ho kakulosawoku ku nzila batu badyatikisawa<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mungwa wisi yidika bima. Wawu wisi hana mutomu wa kitoku ku bisaka amana wisi sadisa ndangu bisaka bizanganaku. Phila mosi, bakwikidi bisi yidika tsi yi batu bana bisi zingilamwa, mu kuzinga bwosu kalombibwa Nzambi. Bisi sadisa phi batu ndangu bazanganaku. </char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>«Benu lwenina kyesesi kya tsi. Mbanza mosi bátunga ha thandu ya mongu yifwaniku kuswamana<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu kabafwanikisa balonguki bandi yi mwini. Kyesesi kimosi kyisi twa kikuma kya bana benina mu phipha yi kubasongila nzila ya bawu. Phila mosi, balonguki ba Yesu bafwana kusongila nzila yina yisi nata kwena Nzambi kikuma kya batu bana bena mu phipha ya kitembu. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Amana bisiku lemisa mwinda ndangu bafidingawa ku tsya nzungu ya tuma; kaasi bisiwa sya ha muzanga, amana wulemi ndangu wayinika boosu bana benina mu nzu. <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Bwabuna kyakenzudiki kyesesi kyenu ku thwala batu, ndangu bamona miza myenu mya bukheti amana bamuzatulaka Tata wenu wuna wenina mu mazilu.»<verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi matadidi mitsiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>«Lubanzaku ni meni yisi zanga Mitsiku holo Bambikudi. Yisaku kikuma kya kuzanga, kaasi kulungisa. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Abwabuna, kikuma yiluzimbwadi: yi kuna dyalútila zilu yi tsi, ka kisona ku kimosi kya Mitsiku kyalúta, yi kuna mabwíla mambu moosu. <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Disongidila wuna wakúlula keti mosi wa khunda muna mitsiku myami amana kalonga bwabuna kwena batu, bamútela wa khunda mu Kipfumu kya mazilu, kaasi wuna wazítisamya, walóngamya phi, yandi bamútela wa mbuta mu Kipfumu kya mazilu. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Mukuma, yiluzimbwadi, yuka ni masonga menu malutiku mana ma balongi ba mitsiku yi Bafwadisi, lwakótamwoku mu Kipfumu kya mazilu.»<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi matadidi khabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>«Lwáyuka ni bázimbula bwabu kwena bambuta: "Walendaku honda mvumbi wa khengu; wuna wahonda mvumbi wa khengu, bamunata ku pfundusu". <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Kaasi meni, yiluzimbwadi bwabu: Wosu wuna wáyukila phangi wandi khabu, bulungi bamunata ku pfundusu. Amana wuna wazímbula kwena phangi wandi: "Zoba", bulungi bamunata ku thwala kimvuka kya mbuta<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Kimvuka kya mbuta» kina bisi tela ni Sanedeni, bisikya bongila hanga nganda ya mbuta ya basadi ba Nzambi ba Bayuta. Bapfumu ba bayuta makumi tsambwadi bakalaya tala, kaka banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku yi bambuta ba dibundu bakala muna. Pfumu wa mbuta muna nganda meni kakala mbuta wa banganga Nzambi.</char></note>; amana wuna wázimbula kwena phangi wandi "Kilawu", bulungi bamulosa ku bilungi. <verse eid="MAT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>Kisongidila, yukani wubati kwenda hana kabu dyaku ku mesa ma kimenga, amana kwakuna, yuka wayubuka ni phangi waku kena yi kima kitadi ngeyi, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>sisa hana kabu dyaku, kuna thwala ya mesa ma kimenga, amana wenda theti kuvutula ngemba yi phangi waku, kunima awisa hana kabu dyaku.<verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>«Yidika tswatsu yi mbeni waku, buna lwenina yi yandi mu nzila ya nganda ya bazusi; kondilo, kakúlambula nana kwena zusi, amana zusi kwena phumbulu, amana bakutimbula mu boloku. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Abwabuna yikuzimbwadi: walúbukamwoku kedi yuka wufutiku yi kuna dikuta dya tsuka.»<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi matadidini mbongi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>«Lwayuka ni bazimbula bwabu: "Watáku mbongi." <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Kaasi meni, yiluzimbwadi: Wosu wuna watála mukhetu wa ngani mu phila ya kumukemba, wuti kedi mbongi yi yandi muna mbundu yandi. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/><note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Mu nzila yayi yi yina yilandi, Yesu kasadidi bitini bya lutu bina thwisi sadila tangwa thwisi sumuka. Kasadila koku dya kitata yi disu dya kitata hanga bidimbu mu kusongila mana thwisi sala yi mana thwisi tala. Tangwa kazimbula ni tufwani kukatula koku dyetu dya kitata holo disu dyetu dya kitata, kazola kuzimbula ni twafwana kusya ngolu mu kubwisa masumu. </char></note>Amana yukani disu dyaku dya kitata dyakubwisaka mu masumu, lokuladya amana losadya kyana yi ngeyi! Mukuma bwena mboti kwena ngeyi watotisa lwesi kitini kimosi kya lutu lwaku, kaasi bweku mboti ni balosa lutu lwosu ku bilungi. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Amana yukani koku dyaku dya kitata dyakusumunaka, zengadya, losadya kyana yi ngeyi; mukuma bwena mboti kwena ngeyi watotisa lwesi kitini kimosi kya lutu lwaku, kaasi bweku mboti ni balosa lutu lwaku lwosu ku bilungi.»<verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi matadidi kufwa kwa longu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mth 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mlk 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>«Amana bazimbula bwabu: "Ni wuna wayámbula mukhetu wandi, kamuheka mukanda wa kufwa kwa longu. <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Kaasi meni, yiluzimbwadi: Wosu wuna wayámbula mukhetu wandi, katula kusala kindumba, wumukitudi kita kya mbongi, amana wuna wakwéla mukhetu bayambudi ku longu, yandi phi mbongi kisi ta.»<verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi matadidi ndefi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>«Lwáyuka hika buna bázonza kwena bambuta: "Waléwulaku ndefi yaku, kaasi walúngisa ku thwala Pfumu mana wasila mu ndefi yaku." <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Kaasi meni yiluzimbwadi lwesi ni ludyaku ndefi kyamakulu: keti ku zilu, kikuma kina kyenina kiti kya Kipfumu kya Nzambi; <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>keti ha tsi, kikuma mafu yi kidyatilu kyandi; keti ku Yelusalemi, kikuma yina yenina mbanza ya Kyamvu wa Mbuta. <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Wadyáku ndefi keti mu mutwa waku, mukuma walendaku balumuna lusuki lumosi mu katoki kondilo mu kaphindi. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Amana yambula nzonzidi yenu yakala: yukani "abwabuna", "abwabuna", ho "loni", "loni"; mana bisikwa yika, kwena kiphidi-mutu misi tuka.»<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvutula mbela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>«Lwáyuka ni bázimbula bwabu: "Disu muna disu amana dinu muna dinu<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mambu mama básonikama phi mu bulunda bwa khulu. Yuka watanga mukanda wa Kulonga 19:21</char></note>." <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Kaasi meni, yiluzimbwadi: Luvutulaku mbela kwena mbeni. Honi mutu kakuta mbata ku tama dya kitata, mubalwamina hika dikwawu. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Amana yuka mutu wuzodi kakunatisa mukanu ndangu kalenga tambula kikutu kyaku, muyambula katambula hika muzaka<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Kikutu» wena mbandu ya muledi wa batu bana bafwana kuzengila mukanu. Kuyika kima kubati songila lutondu kwena mutu wambi. </char></note> waku. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Amana yukani mutu kakulundika mu kusala funda dya thambi, ngeyi fwokula mu mbala zodi. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Kwena wuna wusi kulomba, hana, amana kwena wuna wutondi kulefwa kima kwena ngeyi, wuhungaku.»<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tonda dya bambeni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>«Lwáyuka ni bázimbula bwabu: "Watónda khunda waku, amana waménga mbeni waku." <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Kaasi meni, yiluzimbwadi: Tondenu bambeni benu amana lombilenu kikuma kya bana bisi lunyokuna. <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>Bwabuna lwakítwakila bana ba Tata wenu wuna wenina mu mazilu. Kikuma kisi lubula tangwa kikuma kya batu ba mbi yi batu ba mboti, amana kisi nokisa mvula kikuma kya batu ba masonga yi batu bakonda masonga. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Mukuma, yukani lwatondaka lwesi bana bisi lutonda, khi ndandu lwatámbula? Bakalaki ba phaku bisi bwoku hanga bwabuna phila mosi<note caller="i" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bakalaki ka phaku bababwisa kwena banduku ba bawu Bayuta kikuma kya mambu matatu: 1. Matangwa ma lawu bakala bonga makuta hana thandu ya makuta mana bazenga kikuma kya phaku, bakala swekama kikuma kya bawu meni amana bakala kituka bamvwama. 2. Bakala sadila bapfumu ba bisi Loma bana bakala nyokuna batu. 3. Bwosu bakala mu kikhunda yi bisi Loma bana bakonda kala bayuta, bawu phi bakala bamona, mu mitsiku mya bawu, hanga «batu ba mvindu, kikuma bakalaku zitisa mutsiku wa bayuta wuna wa kudisemisa». </char></note>? <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Amana yukani benu lwahanaka mboti kwena baphangi benu lwesi, khi kima lwisi sala kya ngituka? Baphani bawu phi bisi bwoku hanga bwabuna phila mosi? <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Disongidila, lwakala balungila bwosu kenina Tata wenu, wa ku zilu, walungila.»<verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Malongi matadidi lusadisu lwa batsukami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>«Kebenu mu kusadila masonga menu ku thwala ya batu, mu kudimonikisa. Kondilo, lwatámbulaku ndandu kwena Tata wenu wuna wenina mu mazilu. <verse eid="MAT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>Disongidila tangwa wisi hana kabu dya khenda, wutaku kindanda ku thwala ya ngeyi meni, bwosu bisibwa sala bakavungalosi mu nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta yi muna phambu: ndangu babazatula kwena batu. Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadi, bátambula kedi hakana ndandu ya bawu. <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Kaasi tangwa wisi hana kabu dya khenda, koku dyaku dya kimama dizayaku mambu mana dibati sala koku dyaku dya kitata, <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>ndangu kabu dyaku dya khenda dyasalama mu kitsweki; amana Tata waku, wuna wisi mona mu kitsweki, kakuvutwaladya.»<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi matadidi lombilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>«Tangwa lubati lombila, lukalaku hanga bakavungalosi: bana bisi zola kulombila mutendendi muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta yi muna pfumba za mabala-bala ma mbuta, mu kudimonikisa kwena batu. Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi: bátambula kedi hakana lufutu lwa bawu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 18:11</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Kaasi ngeyi, tangwa wubati lombila, kota kuna suku dina dya tsuka, phata mwelu amana lombila Tata waku wuna wena mu kitsweki, wisi mona mu kitsweki, kakuvutwala.»<verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>«Amana mu kulombila, lulutikisakaku ndinga, hanga baphani; bisi banza ni mu kulutikisa ndinga babáyukila kwena banzambi ba bawu. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Disongidila ni lubasokululaku, mukuma Tata wenu wuzayi keti biki lwenina byawu mupfunu ku thwala ya kumulombabya.» <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Disongidila talenu buna lufwani kulombila:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">"Tata wetu wenina muna mazilu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">yambula khumbu yaku batomisaya,<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>Kipfumu kyaku kisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">luzolu lwaku lwahangama ha tsi, hanga ku zilu.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Tuheka lelu madya metu ma kosu kilumbu.<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Amana tulolula mitsoki myetu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:12">bwosu thwisi lolula betu phi kwena bana bisi tukota mbi.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Amana wutuyambulaku ni twabwa mu kimeka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">kaasi tuhulula kwa Mbi."</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">
    <note caller="b" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mu ndambu ya mikanda mya tsukinina lwesi mwenina bisona byabi byenina mu khunga. </char>
    </note>[Mukuma kwena ngeyi kwenina luyalu, ngolu yi khembu, mvula muna mvula, Abwabuna.]<verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>«Amana, yukani lwisi lolula kwenu bakwenu mitsoki mya bawu, Tata wenu wenina ku zilu kalúlolula benu phi. <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/><note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ywn 2:13</char></note>Kaasi yuka lwisiku lolula kwena batu, Tata wenu kalúlolulaku benu phi mitsoki myenu.»<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutindu wa kuzila madya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>«Amana tangwa lwisi zila madya, lukalakaku yi mbunzu ya kiwayi, bwosu bisi hanga bakavungalosi: bisi kasa mbunzu mu kusongila kwena batu ni bawu bazidi madya. Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi, batambudi kedi ndandu ya bawu. <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Kaasi ngeyi, tangwa wubati zila madya, tomisa khambu ku mutwa amana sukula mbunzu, <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>ndangu wumonikisaku kwena batu ni wubati zila madya, kaasi kwena Tata waku wuna wenina hakana mu kitsweki amana Tata waku wisi mona muna kitsweki kakuvutwalakya.»<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bimvwama muna zilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>«Ludilumbikilaku kuvwa ha tsi, henina yi batseledi yi mboku byisi zanga yi befi bisi lungula ndangu bayiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Kaasi dilumbikelenu kuvwa kwenu muna zilu, mwamuna mwakonda kala keti tseledi keti mboku bisi zanga, amana kweku keti befi balenda lungula keti kuyiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Mukuma hana hena kuvwa kwaku, hahana phi hakála mbundu yaku.»<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwinda wa lutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>«Disu dyenina mwinda wa lutu; ho disu dyaku dyakala bukheti, lutu lwaku lwosu lwakála mu mutemu<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu tangwa dya Yesu, batu bakala bongila disu hanga kisina kya myesi. Bakala banza ni disu dyakala kitini kya lutu kina kisi yinika kitembu holo mbundu ya mutu. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Kaasi, yukani disu dyaku dyakala dya mbi, lutu lwaku lwosu lwakála mu phipha! Honi, disongidila, mutemu wuna wenina mwena ngeyi wakala phipha, mu khi mutindu wa phipha wakála!»<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzambi ho mbongu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16:13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>«Ka mutu ku walenda kusadila bapfumu bodi: Holo, kamumenga mosi amana katonda mukwawu; holo, kadinama kwena mosi amana kamubusa mukwawu. Lwalendaku, lwasadila Nzambi yi mbongu.»<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukala yi kivuvu mwena Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luk 12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>«Yi hakana ni yiluzimbwadi bwabu: ludiyangisaku, kikuma kya luzingu lwenu, keti biki lwadya holo keti biki lwanwa, keti kikuma kya lutu lwenu, keti biki lwavwáta. Luzingu luhitiku madya, amana lutu kuluta muledi? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/><note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mupfunu wa Yesu wakala ni balonguki babakisa, Nzambi kabaheka madya mana benina mawu mupfunu. </char></note>Talenu banuni ku zilu, bisiku kuna, bisiku katula mbutu, bisiku sweka kima mu khila; amana Tata wenu wenina ku zilu kisi badisa! Benu lweku mupfunu lawu kuluta bawu? <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Amana nati mu kati dya benu walenda, muna nyengi dyandi, kukosikila keti koma ka tangwa ka luzingu lwandi?<verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>«Amana biki lwisi dinyengina kikuma kya muledi? Talenu abweti bisi mena bithundu bya mu bilanga: bisiku sala, bisiku londa, <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>amana yiluzimbwadi ni keti Solumoni<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Solumoni kakala mvwama wa mbuta ha kati dya bakyamvu boosu ba Kiseledi (1Ba 10:23). Solumoni kázinga mu tangwa dya mvula khama vwa ku thwala tangwa dya Yesu. </char></note>, muna khembu yandi yosu, kavwataku hanga mosi wa byawu. <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Amana yukani Nzambi kisi vwatisa buna mwangu wa bilanga wuna wena hana lelu amana mbasi balosiwa ku mbawu, abweti kalendabwoku sala kuluta, kikuma kya benu, batu ba lukwikilu lwa khunda? <verse eid="MAT 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>Disongidila ni ludinyengaku, mu kuzonzaka: "Biki twadya? Biki twanwa? Holo biki twavwata? <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>Mukuma bima bina byosu, byabina bisi sanda batu ba makanda moosu, konda kulembwa. Mukuma Tata wenu wenina ku zilu wuzayi ni mupfunu luvwibya. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Kaasi sandenu theti Kipfumu kya Nzambi yi masonga mandi, amana bina byosu baluyikabya. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Disongidila ni ludinyengaku kikuma kya mbasi; mukuma mbasi kadínyenga kikuma kya yandi meni. Mu kosu kilumbu kifwanani yi phasi za kyawu.»<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Lufundisaku bakwenu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk 6:37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>«Lufundisaku, ndangu Nzambi kalufundisaku phi. <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>Mukuma muna phila ya pfundusu yina lwisi fundisila bakwenu, mwamuna phi balúfundisila; amana mu kitesu kina lwisi tesila, kyakina phi kalútesila benu. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Amana kikuma kya biki wisi tadila kitswala kyenina mu disu dya phangi waku, kaasi wisiku mona kitini kya miti kyenina mu disu dyaku<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitswala kibati songila disumu dimosi dya khunda holo kifu holo thalu ya khunda ya masumu. Kibuku kya miti kibati songila disumu dya mbuta holo mbi holo thalu ya mbuta ya masumu.</char></note>? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Holo abweti wufwani kuzimbula kwena phangi waku: "Ngyambula yikatula kitswala kyenina muna disu dyaku", kinga ni muna disu dya ngeyi meni kibuku kya miti kyenina muna? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Kavungalosi, katula theti kitini kya miti kyenina muna disu dyaku, amana wamóna phila ya kukatula kitswala kya disu dya phangi waku.<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>«Luhanaku bina byena byatoma kwena bambwa kondilo baluvutwakila mu kululunza amana lulosaku misanga myenu ku thwala ya bangulu, kondilo badyatikisamya.»<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lombenu, sandenu, khokwatilenu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>«Lombenu amana lwatámbula; sandenu, amana lwaséngumuna; khokwatilenu, amana baluyafwadila. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Mukuma wosu wuna wisi lomba, kisi tambula, wuna wisi sanda kisi sengumuna, amana kwena wuna wisi khokutila, mwelu wakuyafulula wakála. <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>Holo nati ha kati dya benu, ho mwana wandi kamulomba dipha, amana kamuheka tadi? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Kondilo, yukani kalomba tsema, amana kamuheka nyoka<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bisi Kiseledi bakala dya batsema kosu tangwa. Mu bikalulu bya Bayuta, kuhana nyoka, kyakala kifu kya mbi kikuma mutsiku wa Bayuta wabwisisabwa. </char></note>? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Yukani benu batu ba mbi, lwazayaka kuhana bima bya bukheti kwena bana benu, kikuma kya biki ni lo, Tata wenu wenina kuna mazilu kakonda sala kuluta mu kuhana bima bya bukheti kwena bana bisibya mulomba!<verse eid="MAT 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>«Mambu mana moosu lwisi tonda ni batu bahangaka kikuma kya benu, benu phi hangakenuma phila mosi kikuma kya bawu: Amamana malongi moosu ma mitsiku yi bambikudi.»<verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwelu wafitakana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>«Kotilenu mu mwelu wafitakana; mukuma mwelu wuna wisi natisa ku bilungi wambuta wenina amana nzila yayalumuka, amana henina yi balawu bisimwa kotila; <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Kaasi wa khunda wenina mwelu amana nzila yina yisi natisa batu ku luzingu, yafitakana yenina, amana bakhunda bena beninamwa.»<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Miti yi bibundu byandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>«Lwengenu kikuma kya bambikudi ba bukamvi. Bisi kwisa kwena benu bavwata miledi mya mikoku, kaasi mu kati bena bambwa-ngongu<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bambwa-ngongu bana bisi vwata mukanda wa mukoku babati songila mambu ma bambikudi ba mbi bana bisi hunikisa kukala bakwikidi ba kyedika. Phila mosi yi bambwa-ngongu bana bavwata mikanda mya mikoku bisi huna amana kosu tangwa kihonza bisi kala, bambikudi ba mbi bisi huna. Malongi ma bawu menina kihonza. </char></note> bisi vukula. <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Muna bibundu<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bibundu byena mihangu mya batu. Buna thwisi mona mihangu mya mutu mosi, tuzayi yuka ni mutu wuna dyambu dimosi dya mboti holo dya mbi kasadi. Hanga buna thwisi mona bibundu muna miti amana tuzayi phi phila ya miti wandi. </char></note> bya bawu lwabázayila. Bibundu bya vinu ha tsaku bisibya hedila? Amana fwani bahela kibundu kya fiki ha kivunza kya tsaku? <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Ihana ni miti woosu wa bukheti wisi ha bibundu bya bukheti, amana miti wuna wambi, wisi ha bibundu bya mbi. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Miti wa bukheti wufwaniku kuha bibundu bya mbi, keti miti mosi wabela mu kuha bibundu bya bukheti. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Miti wosu wuna wisiku ha bibundu bya bukheti, bakwángawa, amana balósawa ku mbawu. <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Disongidila, abwabuna lwabázayila muna bibundu bya bawu.»<verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuzonza yi kusala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>«Heku ni boosu bana bisi nzimbwala: "Pfumu, Pfumu," bakóta mu kipfumu kya mazilu loni, kaasi bana lwesi bisi sala luzolu lwa Tata wama wenina mu mazilu. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Balawu banzímbwala muna kilumbu kina: "Pfumu, Pfumu, keku mu khumbu ya ngeyi twakala bikwala, mu khumbu ya ngeyi twakala kukwasila bitembu bya mbi, amana mu khumbu ya ngeyi twakala sadila biphadi? <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Amana hanga yibazimbwadi: "Yiluzayaku keti mbala mosi, katukenu ku mesu ma meni, benu lwisi sala mbi!"»<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzu zodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>«Disongidila, wosu wuna wuyuki kwena meni ndinga zazi amana kasadilaza kakála hanga mutu wuna wadimuka, wátunga nzu yandi ha thandu ya tadi. <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Amana mvula wánoka, kithombu kyisa, pfunzi yátukula, byenda dita kuna nzu meni yina: yábwaku; kikuma bátungilaya ha thandu ya tadi. <verse eid="MAT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>Kaasi wosu wuna wuyuki kwena meni ndinga zazi, konda kusadilaza, yandi kakala hanga zoba wátunga nzu yandi ha fusyangeni. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Amana mvula wánoka, kithombu kyisa, pfunzi yátukula kuna nzu meni yina, yáwulumuka, amana kubwa kwa yawu kwákala kwa mbuta.»<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hamu dya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:22">Mlk 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:32">Luk 4:32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Amana tangwa kámanisa Yesu mambu mana, milumba-lumba mya batu báyituka lawu mu malongi mandi. <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>Mukuma kakala balonga hanga mutu wenina yi hamu, heku ni hanga balongi ba mitsiku.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wabuka mutu mosi wakala yi bwasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mlk 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Amana buna kákulumuka ku mongu milumba-lumba mya batu bámulanda. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Amana kutala mukwa bwasi mosi wábwesuka, wámufukamina kuna thwala mu kuzimbula: «Pfumu, yuka ni wuzodibwa, fwani watsemisa.» <verse eid="MAT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Amana Yesu wáyuna koku, <note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuta bakala dikenga lawu mu kusimba mutu wena yi maladi ma mutindu wawu, mukuma mawu makala bakitula batu ba mvindu phi. Mu kuhanga bwabuna, Yesu kasongila ni hamu kakala dyawu ha thandu ya mutindu wa maladi mana.</char></note>wámusimba amana wuzimbudini: «Nzodibwa, sema!» Muna tangwa meni dina wásema ku bwasi bwandi. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Kunima Yesu wámuzimbwala: «Keba mu kuzimbulabwa kwena mutu, kaasi ndawenda disongila kwena banganga Nzambi, amana tambika kabu dina kasonika Moyize, kyakála kimbangi kikuma kya bawu.»<verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubeluka kwa musadi mosi wa pfumu wa baphumbulu wa Baloma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:43-54">Ywn 4:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Amana bwosu kákota mu Kaphedinawuma, satudiyoni<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Satudiyoni disongidila ni pfumu wuna wakala twadisa baphumbulu khama ba Loma</char></note> mosi wábwesuka, mu kumulomba <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>amana wumubokwadidi: «Pfumu, musadi wama kena walandalala kuna nzu, wawokumuka amana wabela lawu.» <verse eid="MAT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadi: «Meni, yikwisa mubuka.» <verse eid="MAT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Amana satudiyoni wuvutudi: «Pfumu, yeku walunga mu kukukotisa mu nzu yama; kaasi zonza lwesi ndinga mosi, amana musadi wama kabéluka. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Mukuma yena meni meni mu tsya hamu dya bambuta bama amana yena yi baphumbulu bama bisi ndemvukila; yisi zimbula kwena mosi: "Ndawenda!" Amana wendi, kwena mukwawu: "nzawisa", amana wisi, amana kwena musadi wama: "hanga bwabu", amana wuhangibwa.»<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu kuzimbula bwabuna, pfumu wa baphumbulu khama wákwikila ni Yesu kákala yi hamu yi ngolu za kubuka mu kumutuma. </char></note> <verse eid="MAT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Amana kunima dya kumuyuka, Yesu wáyituka, wázimbula kwena bana bakala mulanda: «Abwabuna, yiluzimbwadi: khaku kedi mbona kwena mutu, mu Kiseledi, yi lukwikilu lwa mbuta bwabu. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Amana yiluzimbwadibwa, lawu bakwísa ku tsosu yi ku ndamba, mu kutambula kizika ha mesa yi Bulahami yi Yizaki yi Yakobi muna Kipfumu kya mazilu<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayakala baba batatu bakala bakhaka batheti ba Bayuta. Nzambi kabaheka lusilu lwandi. Bayuta boosu bakala hingila ni bawu batatu bakota mu phaladisu. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Kaasi bana ba Kipfumu kya Nzambi bábakukwasa ku phipha ya ku phenza; kwakuna kwakála bidilu yi makwenzi.»<verse eid="MAT 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Amana Yesu wázimbula kwena satudiyoni: «Ndawenda, bwosu wukwikidi, yambula bwahangama bwabuna kikuma kya ngeyi.» Amana muna tangwa meni dina musadi wábeluka.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubuki buko wa Phetelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mlk 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Kunima, Yesu wenda ku nzu ya Phetelu. Wumoni mwamuna buko bwa mukhetu walandalala hana thangi; yi kikhafuma kákala kyawu. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Amana wumusimbini kuna koku, kikhafuma kimuhwini, wutelamini, wuyandikini phi kumuheka madya.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Amana masikidika ha mabwa, bisa munatina batu ba lawu bákala yi bitembu bya mbi. Kakala kukwasa bitembu ku ndinga yandi amana wubabuki bambefu bana boosu. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Ndangu malungila mana bázonza mu nzila ya mbikudi Yesaya: «Wátambula bifu byetu bya mu lutu amana wázangula bimbefu byetu.»<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bana batondi kulanda Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Amana, Yesu, buna kamona mulumba-lumba wa batu wumuzingi, hanga wuhani muswa wa kusabuka ku sambwa dikwawu. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Amana mulongi wa mitsiku mosi wisa muzimbwala: «Mulongi, yikulanda kwosu kuna wakwenda.» <verse eid="MAT 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Amana Yesu wumuvutwadi: «Mikengi myenina yi binzenzi, banuni ba zilu benina yi mazamba, kaasi Mwana wa mutu keku yi homa kazenzika mutwa wandi.»<verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Amana mukwawu hika, hana kati dya balonguki, wumuzimbwadi: «Pfumu, pheka nzila, theti, ya kukwenda zika tata wama.» <verse eid="MAT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Kaasi Yesu wumuzimbwadi: «Ndanda amana yambula bamvumbi bazika bamvumbi ba bawu.»<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhowu wa theti «bamvumbi» wubati zonzila batu bana bisiku landa Yesu. Bawu «bamvumbi» ku Kipfumu kya Nzambi. Bafwani kukala yi tangwa dya kuzika bamvumbi. Yesu kasadila nzonzidi yina kikuma kya kuzimbula kwena mutu ni mikuku mya kikanda kyandi, hanga mikuku mitadidi mambu ma khondu, myalendaku kumukandikisa mu kulanda Yesu. </char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wulembiki pfunzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mlk 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Amana buna kázanza mu mudimba, balonguki bandi bámulanda. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Muna kithulumukina, kimbongila kimosi kya ngolu kitukudi hana yanga dyosu, mudimba wáyandika kubasa mamba. Amana yandi, wanimba kákala. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Amana balonguki bábwesuka, bámutokamisa mu kuzimbula: «Pfumu, tuhulula; tukuluki!» <verse eid="MAT 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Amana yandi wubazimbwadi: «Kikuma kya biki lwenina yi bweya, batu ba lukwikilu lwa khunda!» Hanga wutelami, wukayikya kimbongila yi yanga, amana talala dya lawu dyávutuka. <verse eid="MAT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Amana batu báyituka, badizimbwadi: «Khi mutindu wa mutu kenina, yandu, mukuma yi pfunzi yi yanga byisi mulemvukila?»<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubuki batu bodi ba bitembu bya mbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mlk 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Amana buna katula ku sambwa dikwawu, muna kinzunga kya Ngelasoni<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tsi ya bisi Ngelasoni kyenina kinzunga kina bisi zingila baphani kuna banda dya malubwakidi ma tangwa ma yanga dya thibu dya Ngadidi. </char></note>, batu bodi ba bitembu bya mbi balubuka mu mazyamu, bisa kuna thwala ya yandi. Bakala babanga lawu, ka mutu ku wa ngolu wakala luta muna nzila meni yina. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Amana báyandika kukalunga yi kuzonza: «Khi dyambu, yi betu yi ngeyi, Mwana wa Nzambi? Wisa tula haha, ku thwala tangwa<note caller="i" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhowu wawu "tangwa" wubati zonzila tangwa dina kayidika Nzambi mu kuhana ndola kwena bitembu bya mbi. Bitembu bya mbi bazaya ni tangwa dya kuyangisa batu dyakwisa lungila.</char></note>, ndangu watuyangisa betu?»<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Amana kwákala, muna kyana yi bawu, yi kibuka kimosi kya mbuta kya bangulu bakala dya. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Amana bitembu bya mbi byákala mubokwadila yandi mu kuzimbula: «Yuka watukukwasa, tutuma kwetu muna kibuka kina kya bangulu.» <verse eid="MAT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Amana wuzimbwadibya: «Ndalwenda!» Amana byálubuka, byenda kota phi muna bangulu. Kunima kibuka kya bangulu kyosu kidisyetumuni muna beti dya bitadi bya yanga amana báfwa muna mamba. <verse eid="MAT 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Amana bana bakala bahungula bátina; benda menika phi mu mbanza moosu mana máhita yi kikuma kya batu bana bodi ba bitembu bya mbi. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Amana kutala mbanza yosu yilubuki, bendi tundakana yi Yesu; buna bámumona, bámubokwadila kakatuka ku mulambu wa bawu.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubeludi mutu wawokumuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mlk 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Amana bwosu kákota Yesu muna mudimba wumosi, wásabuka yanga amana wénda kuna <note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Mbanza yandi» disongidila ni ku Kaphedinawumi. Kwakuna kakala zingila Yesu muna tangwa meni dina. </char></note>mbanza yandi. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Amana kutala bisi munatina mutu mosi wawokumuka, walandalala hana kiphoyu. Amana mu kumona lukwikilu lwa bawu, Yesu wuzimbudi kwena mutu wawokumuka: «Kala yi kikesa mwana! Masumu maku makulolukini!» <verse eid="MAT 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Kutala, ndambu ya balongi ba mitsiku badizimbwadi: «Yandu kabati lewula Nzambi.» <verse eid="MAT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Amana bwosu kábakula mabanza ma bawu, Yesu wuzimbudi: «Kikuma kya biki lwenina yi mabanza ma mbi muna mbundu zenu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>Biki byakonda phasi mu kuzimbula: "Masumu maku maloluki, ho kuzimbula: "Telama amana kangala!"? <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Amana ndangu lwazaya ni Mwana wa mutu kenina yi hamu ha tsi mu kulolula masumu.»<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu wabelula mutu. Kiphadi kina kyasongila phi ni Yesu kakala yi hamu dya kulolula masumu. </char></note> Hanga wuzimbudi kwena mutu wuna wawokumuka: «Telama, zangula kiphoyu kyaku amana ndawenda ku nzu yaku!» <verse eid="MAT 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Amana buna kátelama, wénda ku nzu yandi. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Amana mu kumona bwabuna, milumba-lumba mya batu, bweya bubakwati amana báyandika kuzatula Nzambi wuna wahana kwena batu hamu dya mutindu wuna.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutedini Mathayi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mlk 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Amana mu kuluta kwakuna, Yesu wámona mutu mosi bakala tela Mathayi, wazakala hana homa hana kakala futisila phaku. Wumuzimbwadi: «Ndanda!» Yandu-yandu wátelama amana wámulanda. <verse eid="MAT 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Amana bwosu kákala ku mesa, muna nzu, kutala lawu dya bakalaki ka phaku yi basumuki bahika bisa zakala ha kimosi yi Yesu yi balonguki bandi. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Mu kumona bwabuna, Bafwadisi bázimbula kwena balonguki bandi: «Kikuma kya biki mulongi wenu kisi dya homa ha mosi yi bakalaki ka phaku yi basumuki?» <verse eid="MAT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Kinga Yesu wáyuka, amana wuzimbudi: «Kabanaku benina bakola mu lutu bisi vwa mupfunu wa munganga, kaasi bambefu<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu kasadila mihowu myami «bakola», «bambefu» yi «munganga» mu phila ya kitembu. Batu bana benina bakola babati zonzila bafwadisi. Bawu bisi banza ni bena «bakola» amana beku yi mupfunu wa lusadisu lumosi lwa kitembu. Batu bana bena «bambefu» disongidila ni bakalaki ka phaku yi basumuki. Bawu bazayi ni bena yi mupfunu wa lusadisu lwa Yesu. «Munganga» kenina Yesu, yandi wufwani kusadisa basumuki mu kukituka batu ba masonga. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Amana mu kukwenda, longukenu disongidila dya: "Yisi tonda khenda kaasi mikhayilu loni." Mukuma yísilaku mu kutela batu ba masonga, kaasi basumuki.»<verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi kuzila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mlk 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Hanga balonguki ba Yowani babwesuki kwena yandi mu kumuhyula: «Kikuma kya biki ni betu yi Bafwadisi thwisi zila kosu tangwa kaasi balonguki ba ngeyi bisiku zila?» <verse eid="MAT 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Amana Yesu wuzimbudi kwena bawu: «Banduku ba kikwedi bafwani kukala mu khondu mu tangwa dina kenina kikwedi ha kimosi yi bawu mu mukinzi wa longu? Kaasi bilumbu byakwísa bina babákatula yandi kikwedi; hahana bazíla<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Balonguki ba Yesu bazilaku kikuma yandi kakala ha kimosi yi bawu. Banduku bafwanaku kukala mu kiwayi ku longu mu tangwa dyosu dina kakala yakala kumosi yi bawu. Ku manima nana bayuka kyadi hahana nana bazíla, tangwa babakatula yandi yakala. Balonguki bafwana kukala mu kyadi yi kuzila mu tangwa dina, bambeni ba Yesu babakatula yandi. </char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>«Amana ka mutu ku wisi londa sengi dya muledi yi kitemba kya muledi wa pha, mukuma kitemba kya pha kyayáta sengi dya muledi amana hundu dyavúla hika.<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu kingana kyaki, Yesu káfwanikisa malongi mandi yi muledi wa pha wuna bakonda sukula kedi kwena mutu. Káfwanikisa mikuku mya Bayuta yi muledi wa khulu. Ka mutu ku wisi sadila kitemba kya pha mu kulondila sengi dya khulu. Phila mosi ni, batu bafwanaku kuyika malongi mandi ku mikuku mya bawu mya khulu. </char></note> <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Amana bisiku longulula vinu dya pha mu bilungu bya khulu; kondilo; bilungu byabúdika, amana vinu dityakani, amana bilungu bizangani. Kaasi vinu dya pha bisidya longulula muna bilungu bya pha, amana bya byodi byalundama bukheti.»<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna kingana meni yina, Yesu wafwanikisa malongi mandi yi vinu dya pha yi bilungu bya pha. Káfwanikisa mikuku mya Bayuta yi bilungu bya khulu. Ka mutu ku wisi longulula vinu dya pha mu bilungu bya khulu. Phila mosi ni batu bafwanaku kuyika malongi mandi ku mikuku mya bawu mya khulu. </char></note><verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukhetu wuna wasimba muledi wa Yesu yi mwana mukhetu wa pfumu wa Bayuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mlk 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Buna kakala bazimbwala bwabuna, pfumu mosi wa nzu ya kimvuka ya bayuta wátula; wáfukama kuna thwala yandi mu kuzimbula: «Mwana wama wa mukhetu wufini buthwena bwabu, kaasi awisa, thetika koku dyaku hana thandu ya yandi, amana kazínga.» <verse eid="MAT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Amana buna kátelama Yesu wámulanda kumosi yi balonguki bandi.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Amana mukhetu mosi, wakala noka menga tukila mvula kumi yi zodi; wisa bwesuka kuna manima amana wasimba nzenzi ya muledi wandi. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Mukuma kakala dizonzila: «Yuka yisimba lwesi muledi wandi, yibéluka.» <verse eid="MAT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Amana Yesu wábaluka, wámumona amana wázimbula: «Kala yi kikesa, mwana wama wa mukhetu! Lukwikilu lwaku lukuhuludini.» Muna tangwa meni dina mukhetu wuna wábeluka.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Amana buna kátula Yesu ku nzu ya pfumu wa bayuta, wumoni basiki ba mahongi yi mulumba-lumba wa batu mu bidilu, <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>wuzimbudi: «Lubukenu, mukuma mwana wa mukhetu kafiku, kaasi wanimba kenina.» Bawu bámuseya<note caller="i" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu kakala zaya ni mwana wa mukhetu wafwa kakala, kaasi yandi lwesi wazaya ni lufwa lwandi lwakalaku kimakulu. Kakala zaya ni, ka thama ku, kamuvutula mu luzingu.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Amana tangwa bálubula ku phenza mulumba-lumba wa batu, buna kákota, wámusimba mwana wa mukhetu kuna koku, amana mwana wa mukhetu wátokama. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Amana khululuka yámwangana ku mulambu wuna wosu.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubeludi baphofu bodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Amana bwosu kakala luta Yesu kwakuna, baphofu bodi bámulanda mu kukalunga mu ndinga ya ngolu: «Tuyukila kyadi, Mwana wa Tavidi!»<note caller="k" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzambi kasila ni mutekulu mosi wa kyamvu Tavidi wakala Masiya (Yes: 9:6-7; 11:1-5; Yel 23:5). Bayuta bakala hingila ni mutu wuna babasila kisa, amana bakala mutela mu khumbu ya «Mwana wa Tavidi». </char></note><verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Amana tangwa kátula mu nzu, baphofu bábwesuka bela-bela yi yandi, amana Yesu wubahyudi: «Lukwikidi ni fwani yisala bwabuna?» Bawu, bamuvutwadini: «Bwabuna, Pfumu.» <verse eid="MAT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Hanga, Yesu wubasimbi kuna mesu, wuzimbudi bwabu: «Bwaluhangamina bwosu lwenina lukwikilu lwenu.» <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Amana mesu ma bawu mátemuka. Yesu wábakebisa, wubazimbwadi phi: «Kebenu! Ka mutu ku kazayabwa!» <verse eid="MAT 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Kaasi, buna bálubuka, bámuzonzila muna mulambu wuna wosu.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubeludi mutu mosi wakala muhunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Amana bwosu bakala kwenda, Yesu yi balonguki bandi, bámunatina mutu mosi wakalaku zonza, wákala yi kitembu kya mbi. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Amana buna kákukwasa kitembu kya mbi, mutu wuna wázonza. Amana milumba-lumba mya batu báyituka, bakala zimbula: «Khaku kedi, dyambu dya bwabu dyasalama mu Kiseledi!» <verse eid="MAT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Kaasi bafwadisi bakala zimbula: «Mu khumbu ya pfumu wa bitembu bya mbi, kisi kukwasila bitembu bya mbi.»<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuyukidi batu kyadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Amana Yesu kákala kwenda kangala mbanza zoosu yi mahata; kákala longa, kwena bawu, muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta, kákala samuna Musamu wa Bukheti wa Kipfumu kya mazilu yi kubelula maladi mosu yi bimbefu byosu. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Amana buna kámona milumba-lumba mya batu, kiwayi kyámukwata, mukuma bakala balembwa, bakonda kikesa, hanga mikoku mikondi kalema. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Hanga wuzimbudi kwena balonguki bandi: «Mbongu ya lawu yenina, kaasi basadi ba khunda benina. <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Disongidila lombenu kwena Mukwa mbongu kahitika basadi mu kukatula mbongu yandi<note caller="l" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kufwanikisa kwaku kwa kingana kubati tusongila ni batu ba lawu bena bela-bela mu kukwikila mwena Yesu, kaasi heku batu ba lawu babanata mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi. Yesu kazimbula kwena balonguki bandi ni balombilaka ndangu Nzambi kahitika batu ba lawu bana bakwenda basadisa mu kukala yi kivuvu mwena yandi.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Bathumwa kumi yi bodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mlk 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Yesu wátela balonguki bandi kumi yi bodi, wábaheka hamu dya kukukwasa bitembu bya mbi yi kubelula maladi moosu yi bimbefu byosu. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Amana tala khumbu za bathumwa bana kumi yi bodi: Watheti Simoni, wuna bisi tela ni Phetelu, yi myaki wandi Andele; Zyaki yi myaki wandi Yowani, bana ba Zebeteya; <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Fidiphu yi Batolomi; Tomasi yi Mathayi kalaki ka phaku; Zyaki mwana wa Alufwe yi Thati; <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Simoni wuna wákala mu kibuka kya batu bana bakala wila diphanda yi Yutasi Sikadyoti, wuna wálambula Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kituma kya bathumwa kumi yi bodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mlk 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Yesu wátuma ba kumi yi bodi mu kisalu, amana wábaheka milongi myami: "Lwendaku mu milambu mya baphani, amana lukotaku phi mu mbanza mosi ya bisi Samadiya, <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>kaasi ndenu lwenda kwena mikoku mina myátota mya kanda dya Kiseledi<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bisi Samadiya babutuka ku ndambu mosi mu kimvuka kya Bayuta, ndambu yikwawu ya makanda ma kinzenza. Balandaku dingumba dimosi yi Bayuta. Bayuta bakala babongila hanga kibuka kimosi kya batu bana bakonda fwanana bawu amana bakala menga. Yesu wisa tuma ku nima balonguki mu bimvuka byosu bya batu (28:19), kaasi kakala zola ni balonguki bandi bayandikila mu kulonga kwena biwutu bya bawu Bayuta. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Amana muna nzila, longakenu mu kuzimbula: Kipfumu kya mazilu kibwesuki!" <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Belulenu bambefu, futumunenu bamvumbi, semisenu bakwa bwasi, kukwasenu bitembu bya mbi. Lwátambula bya khatu, hanenu bya khatu. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Lunataku keti wolu, keti fwalanga, keti ndisu muna khola yenu; <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>keti waba kikuma kya mu nzila, keti bikutu byodi, keti tsabatu, keti koka. Mukuma musadi wulungi mu kutambula madya mandi.<verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>Muna mbanza yosu holo hata dyosu dina lwakóta, hyulenu ndangu lwazaya yukani mutu wa bukheti weninamwa, amana nangenu kuna nzu yandi tii yi kuna lwakwendila. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Amana mu kukota mu nzu, hanenu mboti kidimbu kya ngemba. <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Amana yukani nzu yakala yafwana mu kutambula ngemba, ngemba yenu yayála mwamuna; kaasi yuka yeku yafwana, ngemba yenu yaluvutwakila. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Amana wuna wakonda luyamba, kayukiku phi ndinga zenu, mu kulubuka mu nzu yandi, keti mu mbanza yina, khukumunenu fusyangeni dya bitambi byenu<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuta buna bakala zola kusongila ni babwisiha homa, bakala yi kikalulu kya kukhukumuna fusyangeni. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadi: mu kilumbu kya pfundusu, phasi za mulambu wa Sotomu yi Ngomolu<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sotomu yi Ngomolu zenina khumbu za mbanza zoodi. Nzambi wazangaza mbanza zina zawu zoodi yi batu bana bakalamwa zingila kikuma kya lawu dya masumu ma bawu (Kuy 19). </char></note> za khunda zákala kuluta mbanza yina.<verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Minyanga myakwísa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mlk 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>«Talenu! Meni yilutumini hanga mikoku hana kati kya <note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbwa-ngongu kyenina kifwanisu kya dyambu dya kihonza, mukuma bambwa-ngongu bisi kwata mikoku amana badimya. Kulonga Musamu wa Bukheti wa Yesu fwani kwakala kihonza mbala za hika. </char></note>bambwa-ngongu. Disonga, kalenu balwenga hanga banyoka, talala hanga mayembi. <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Amana dikengenu yi batu, mukuma balúlambula ku kimvuka kyambuta<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mth 5:22</char></note> amana balúzyatula mafimbu muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta za bawu. <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Amana balúnatiki, kikuma kya meni, ku thwala bapfumu ba mbanza, yi kwena bakyamvu; kyakála kimbangi kikuma kya bawu yi kikuma kya baphani. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Kaasi tangwa balúlambula, luyananaku keti kikuma kya phila yina lwazónzila, keti mana lwazímbula, kikuma mambu mana lwazímbula Nzambi kalúhekama muna tangwa meni dina, <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>mukuma kabenuku lwazónza, kaasi Kitembu kya Tata wenu kyazónza mwena benu. <verse eid="MAT 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>Amana phangi kalámbula phangi wandi ku lufwa, amana tata kalámbula mwana wandi; bana bakítuka bambeni ba bibuti bya bawu amana babáhondisa. <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Amana balúmenga kwena batu boosu kikuma kya khumbu ya meni; kaasi wuna wakwámina tii yi kuna tsuka kahuluka. <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Amana tangwa balúnyokuna mu mbanza yayi, tinenu mu mbanza yikwawu. Amana mu kyedika yiluzimbwadi, lwamánisaku kedi mu kuluta mu mbanza za Kiseledi ku thwala kukwisa kwa Mwana wa mutu.»<verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>«Mulonguki kalutiku mulongi wandi, keti musadi kalutiku pfumu wandi. <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Bulungi kwena mulonguki kakituka hanga mulongi wandi, amana kwena musadi kukituka hanga pfumu wandi. Yukani bamutela mukwa nzu ni <note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"Belezebula yena khumbu yina bakala sadila Bayuta, mbala za hika, mu kuzonzila Satana konda kumuzitisa ata batumbudi khumbu yandi.</char></note>Belezebula, amana abweti bahanga kwena batu bena mu nzu yandi<note caller="i" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna kingana kyaki, Yesu kena hanga «pfumu wa nzu» amana balonguki bena hanga «batu bena mu nzu yandi». Phila mosi yi buna bámutukwana Yesu, balonguki phi babátukwana lawu. </char></note>!»<verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wuna bafwani kubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>«Disonga, lubabangaku, mukuma heku kima kyaswamana kyakónda zayakana, ka kima ku kya kitsweki kyakónda tunguluka. <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Mana mbati luzimbwala mu phipha, zimbulenumoku mu kati kya <note caller="k" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muma mwahika, Yesu kasadila muhowu wawu phipha kikuma kya «kingenga» amana muhowu wuna mwini kikuma kya «ha mesu ma thona».</char></note>mwini; amana mana bisi lufwetisa mu kutu, samunenuma hana thandu za <note caller="l" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna tangwa dina, nzu za bayuta zakala yi midilu mya kitsendendi. Batu bakala zanza mbala za lawu hana thandu za midilu meni mina kikuma kya kuta mitangu. </char></note>midilu. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Amana lubangaku bana bisi honda lutu, kaasi balendaku kuhonda moya; kaasi bangenu lwesi wuna wufwani kutotisa yi moya yi lutu ku bilungi. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Luzayibwoku ni banuni ba khunda bodi bisi batekisa mu fwalanga dimosi? Kinga ka mosi ku wa bawu wisi bwa ha tsi konda luzolu lwa Tata wenu. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Amana kwena benu, keti tsuki za mutwa wenu zoosu za kutanga zenina. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Ihana ni lukalaku yi bweya: lwenina yi mupfunu kuluta banuni ba khunda ba lawu<note caller="m" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bwana bubati songila ni Nzambi katala mambu ma kanda dyandi.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutambwasa ho kutuna Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luk 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>«Disonga, wosu mutu wuna wathámbwasa meni ku mesu ma batu, meni phi yimútambwasa ku thwala Tata wama wenina mu mazilu; <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Kaasi yukani mutu kathuna ku thwala batu, meni phi yimútuna ku thwala Tata wama wuna wenina mu mazilu.»<verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ka ngemba ku kaasi mbedi ya phoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>«Lubanzaku ni ngemba yisa nata ha tsi: yisaku nata ngemba, kaasi mbedi ya phoku. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Mukuma ngyengu yisa nata ha kati dya mwana mosi wa yakala yi tata wandi, ha kati dya mwana mosi wa mukhetu yi ngundi wandi, ha kati dya mukhetu mosi wa mwana yakala yi buko bwa mukhetu wandi. <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>Amana bambeni ba mutu bakála biwutu byandi. <verse eid="MAT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>Wuna wisi zola tata wandi holo ngundi wandi kuluta meni, yandi kafwaniku kala nduku wa meni, amana wuna wisi zola mwana wandi wa yakala holo mwana wandi wa mukhetu kuluta meni kafwaniku kala mulonguki wama. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Amana wuna kanatiku kitakani kyandi mu kundanda, keku mulonguki wa meni<note caller="n" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu tangwa dya Yesu, mutu wuna bazengila ni bamukhoka ha kitakani bakala mulundika mu kunata kitakani. Kanatakya tii yi hana bamukhokila. Disongidila, mambu mana kabati zola kuzimbula haha Yesu, mazonzi ni mutu wuna zodi kukala mulonguki wandi kafweti kala wayilama mu kunyokuka yi kufwa kikuma kya kulanda Yesu. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Wuna wasánda kuhulula luzingu lwandi, katótisalwa; kaasi wuna watótisa luzingu lwandi kikuma kya meni katámbulalwa hika.»<verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mlk 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>Wuna walúyamba, wungyambini, amana wuna wungyambini, wuyambini phi wuna wáthuma. <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Wuna wuyambi mbikudi mosi muna khumbu yandi ya kimbikudi katámbula ndandu ya mbikudi, amana wuna wuyambi mutu wa masonga mu khumbu yandi ya mutu wa masonga katambula ndandu yimosi ya mutu wa masonga. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Amana wuna wahána kunwa keti kopha dya mamba ma tsimina kwena mosi wa baleki baba mu khumbu yandi ya mulonguki, mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi, katótisaku ndandu yandi.<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Bambambala ba Yowani Mubotiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Amana tangwa kámanisa Yesu mu kuhana milongi kwena balonguki bandi kumi yi bodi, wákatuka hana, wenda longa yi kusamuna mu mbanza za bawu.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Amana Yowani, muna boloku dyandi, wáyuka kuzonzila mihangu mya Kidisitu. Wátuma balonguki bandi <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>benda muhyula: «Ngeyi wenina wuna walunga kwisa, ho twahingila wahika?»<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mbikutulu zina za bulunda bwa khulu, Bayuta bakala hingila ni Nzambi kahitika mutu mosi wa mbuta wuna fwani kabahulula. Mutu meni wuna bakala mutela «Kidisitu». Mihowu myami «wuna walunga kwisa» mibati zonzila Kidisitu.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Amana Yesu wábavutwala: «Alwenda samuna kwena Yowani mana lubati yuka yi mana lubati mona: <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>Baphofu babati mona, bakwa khonzu babati kangala, bakwa bwasi basemi, tuhuwa tubati yuka, bamvumbi bafutumuki, amana Musamu wa Bukheti basamuniwa kwena batsukami<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mihangu mina bazonzidi mu khaphu ya 11:5 myena mihangu mina kahanga Yesu. Mihangu meni mina mifwanani yi mbikutulu zina za bulunda bwa khulu kikuma kya Kidisitu. Kidisitu kakala mutu wa mupfunu wa lawu wuna bakala hingila Bayuta kwena Nzambi kikuma kya kubahulula. Mihangu meni mina, myasongila ni Yesu wakala mutu meni wuna wa mupfunu wa lawu bakala hingila. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Amana kyesi kwena wuna yikonda kadila kisinza mwena meni!»<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Amana mu kukwenda kwa bawu, Yesu wáyandika kuzonza kwena milumba-lumba mya batu kikuma kya Yowani: «Biki lwendi talaka mu nganga? Muswangina wuna wubati ningana ku muphephi? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Amana biki lwendi talaka? Mutu wuna wuvwatiki miledi mya khembu? Kaasi bana bisi vwata miledi mya khembu, mu nganda za bakyamvu benina. <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Kaasi nati lwendi talaka? Mbikudi mosi? Kyedika, yiluzimbwadibwa, kuluta phi mbikudi mosi. <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>Kikuma kya yandi, tala mana másonama: "Tala, meni thumini, ku thwala ya ngeyi, mbambala wama ndangu kakuyidikila nzila ku thwala ngeyi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mihowu myami mibati tendula ni Yowani kayidika mbundu ya batu mu kukwisa kwa Kidisitu. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Abwabuna yiluzimbwadi: ha kati dya bana bábutuka kwena bakhetu, heku mutu watélama kuluta Yowani Mubotiki. Ihana ni wuna wenina wakhunda mu Kipfumu kya mazilu kenina mbuta kuluta Yowani. <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>Tukidila mu tangwa dya Yowani Mubotiki tii yi kuna lelu dyadi, bakwa kingolu-ngolu bisi nwanisa Kipfumu kya mazilu amana bisi sanda mu kubotulakya. <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Mukuma bambikudi boosu yi mitsiku bábikula tii yi kuna Yowani. <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>Amana yuka luzodi kumuyamba, yandi kenina Diya wuna wálunga mu kukwisa. <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Wuna wenina yi matu, kayuka!<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>«Amana yi banani pfwani kufwanikisa mbandu yayi? Bafwanani yi bana ba khunda benina bazakala ku zandu, babati tamikina bakwawu khunda <verse eid="MAT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>bazimbudi: "Tulusikidi mahongi, amana lukiniku! Tuluyimbididi makana ma kudidila kaasi lusiku khondu!" <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Mukuma Yowani wísa, kakalaku dya keti kunwa, amana bazimbudi: "Kitembu kya mbi kenina kyawu!" <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>Mwana wa mutu wísa, yi kudyaka yi kunwaka, amana bisi zimbula: "Yandu madya-madya yi kinwa-malafu, nduku wa bakalaki ka phaku yi basumuki!" Kaasi nduka zibati monika mu mihangu myandi.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbanza zina babusa kukwikila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Hanga wuyandiki kukaya bisi mbanza zina zámona lawu dya biphadi, mukuma bábalumunaku mbundu za bawu! <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>«Khi kyadi kwena ngeyi, Kolazini! Khi kyadi kwena ngeyi, Betisayita! Mukuma wadi biphadi bina byáhangama theti kwena benu, byáhangamaka ku Tidi yi ku <note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kolazini yi Betisayita zakala mbanza za Bayuta. Tidi yi Sitoni zakala mbanza za baphani. Yesu kakala songila ni baphani bakalaku yi phasi mu kubalumuna mbundu yi kukwikila mwena yandi kuluta Bayuta. </char></note>Sitoni, tuka thama, wadi batu ba bawu, bákala balumuna mbundu za bawu, bávwata tsaki amana bádifuba mu mbombi<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mutsiku wa batu bana muna tangwa meni dina wakala kudifidinga miledi mya mbi yi kudifuka mu mbombi. Bwana bwakala songila ni bayambudi masumu ma bawu.</char></note>! <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Kaasi yiluzimbwadibwa, mu kilumbu kya pfundusu, phasi za Tidi yi Sitoni za khunda zakála kuluta benu. <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Amana ngeyi Kaphedinawuma, wadíthumba yi kuna zilu? Wakúlumuka yi kuna kalunga. Mukuma wadi ni biphadi bina byáhangama kwena ngeyi byáhangamina ku Sotomu, wadi kákala zinga yi lelu dyadi. <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Kaasi, yiluzimbwadibwa, mu kilumbu kya pfundusu, phasi za khunda zakála kikuma kya tsi ya Sotomu kuluta ngeyi.»<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Alwisa kwena meni ndangu lwalembwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, Yesu wábonga ndinga, wázimbula: «Yikukumisi, Tata, Pfumu wa zilu yi tsi, kikuma wásweka mambu mama kwena batu badimuka yi batu ba ngangu, amana wusongidima kwena bana bakhunda. <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Abwabuna, Tata, watya mu weti dyaku.<verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>«Byosu Tata wama wáphekabya. Amana ka mutu ku wuzayi nani kenina Mwana ho ka tata ku, ka mutu ku phi wuzayi nati kenina Tata ho ka Mwana ku yi kwena mutu wuna kazodi Mwana mu kumusongila<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu kikuma kya yandi meni kakala zonzila tangwa kazonzila «Mwana». </char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>«Alwisenu kwena meni benu boosu lwenina balembwa yi zitu, meni, yilúlembwasa. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Zangulenu muteti wuna mbati luheka amana longukenu kwena meni, mukuma meni yenina yi mbundu ya lembama yi yadikulumuna, lwalémbwa<note caller="i" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu kuzonza: Zangula muteti wama. Muteti wenina kidimbu kya luzitu kwena mukwa kima mosi yi kisalu kikuma kya yandi. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Mukuma muteti wama weku phasi mu kunata, amana zitu dyama dyenina hengi-hengi.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi kilumbu kya sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mlk 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, Yesu kakala luta muna bilanga bya ngenza zimosi zenina hanga losu, kyákala kilumbu kya <note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Ngenza zina bisiza tela bule). Muhowu wawu Sabata yenina khumbu ya kilumbu kya tsambwadi yi kya tsuka muna phosa ya Bayuta. Kilumbu kya Sabata kyenina kilumbu kya mupfunu wa lawu kya phosa kina bakala lembwa Bayuta yi kufukamina Nzambi. </char></note>sabata. Balonguki bandi báyuka nzala, báyandika kuhela misambu yi kudyaka ngenza zandi. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Amana Bafwadisi, mu kumona bwabuna, bamuzimbwadini: «Balonguki baku babati hanga mambu mana mafwaniku kuhanga mu kilumbu kya sabata<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzambi wahana muswa kwena batu mu kuhela yi kudya koku dya ngenza muna bilanga bya batu bahika (Klg 23:25). Kaasi bafwadisi bazimbula ni kuhela kuna kwa ngenza kwakala kisalu amana bwáfwanaku kusalama mu kilumbu kya Sabata. </char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Kaasi yandi wubazimbwadini: «Benu lwátangaku mambu kahanga Tavidi, tangwa káyuka nzala, yandi yi batu bana bákala yi yandi? <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>Bwosu kákota mu kikumbu kya Nzambi, badya mapha báhana mikhayilu, mbatanana bizila bizonzi ni ka yandi ku keti kwena batu bana bákala yi yandi, báfwana kudyama kaasi banganga-Nzambi lwesi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu wavutula mvutu ku dyambu dina bamufundila bafwadisi, hanga fwanikisi yi mambu matadidi kyamvu Tavidi. (1Sa 21:1-6). Tavidi yi batu bandi bakala yi nzala mu kutina kyamvu Sawulu. Hanga kuna kikumbu, Tavidi walomba madya kwena banganga Nzambi. Kima kyakala hana lwesi mapha mana ma kusakumuna. Banganga Nzambi lwesi bafwana kudya mapha mana. Kaasi, nganga Nzambi wayuka kyadi amana wámuheka Tavidi mapha mana yi batu bandi. Nzambi kayukaku khabu kikuma kya nganga Nzambi wuna holo Tavidi. Bwosu batendudibwa mu 12:7 kisina kya mitsiku kukala yi kyadi kwena baphutu yi kubasadisa tangwa benina yi mupfunu wa lusadisu. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Holo, lwátangaku kedi mu mitsiku ni mu bilumbu bya sabata, banganga Nzambi bana bisi sala kisalu mu nzu ya Nzambi, bisi kulula kizila kya sabata kaasi ka mutu ku wisi bafundisa? <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Kinga, yiluzimbwadibwa, dyadi dyena haha kuluta nzu ya Nzambi. <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>Wadi lwazaya biki thendula yayi: "Nzodi khenda kuluta mikhayilu, lwakalaku bazengila mukanu batu bana bakonda zaya kima. <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Mukuma Mwana wa mutu yandi wenina pfumu wa kilumbu kya sabata.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutu yi koku dyayumuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mlk 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Bwosu káluta, homa meni, wénda kota mu nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta ya bawu. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Amana tala mutu mosi wákala yi koku dyayumuka. Bafwadisi bamuhyudi, mu kuzimbula: «Mitsiku myetu mihani muswa wa kubelula mu kilumbu kya sabata?» Ndangu bamufunda. <verse eid="MAT 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Amana yandi wubavutwadi: «Khi mutu ha kati dya benu, yuka ni kenina yi mukoku wandi mosi lwesi, amana kabwa mu kati dya dibulu dimosi mu kilumbu kya sabata, wakonda mulubula? <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Kinga mutu kenina yi mupfunu wa lawu kuluta mukoku! Aketi mitsiku myetu mihani nzila mu kusala mboti mu kilumbu kya sabata.» <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Hanga wuzimbudi kwena mutu: «Yuna koku dyaku.» Wuyunidya amana divutukisi dya mboti hanga dina dikwawu. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Amana Bafwadisi bálubuka, bámukasila fwongu mu phila ya kumuhondisila.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musadi wa Nzambi kasola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Amana buna kábakulabwa Yesu, wákatuka homa meni hana. Amana batu balawu bámulanda; wábabuka boosu; <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>amana yandi wábakandisa ni bamenikaku kwena batu keti nati kenina yandi. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Bwásalama bwabuna ndangu yalungila ndinga yina kázonza mbikudi Yesaya:<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>«Tala musadi wa meni wuna yísola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">wuna yisi tonda, mwena yandi yisi monina tsambu yama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Mwena yandi yisya Kitembu kyama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">amana yandi wakwisa samuna masonga kwena makanda ma batu.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Yandi kayúmanikiku, kathútaku ndinga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">amana ka mutu ku wamúyuka ndinga yandi mu mabala-bala ma mbuta.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Katólulaku muswangina wafutama kedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">amana kazímaku musinga wa mwinda wuna wisi lubula<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yenina nzonzidi mu kifwani kya kuzimbula ni musadi wa Nzambi kakala yi tsambu ya bakwawu. Kasadisa bawayi yi bana bakatudi kikesa. </char></note> mwisi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Yi kuna kakwisa nungisina masonga.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Amana makanda ma baphani masya kivuvu kya bawu mu khumbu yandi.»<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu kisi yukana yi bitembu bya mbi?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:22-30">Mlk 3:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Hanga bamunatini mutu mosi wákala yi kitembu kya mbi kyámuhonda kiphofu yi kamama, amana wámubuka mu phila ni mukwa kamama wáyandika kuzonza yi kumona<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu wabelula mutu mu kumulubula ndangu kitembu kyambi kimukwataku hika. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Amana milumba-lumba mya batu boosu báyituka, bekazimbula: «Ka yandi ku wuna Mwana wa Tavidi?» <verse eid="MAT 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Amana tangwa báyukabwa, bafwadisi bázimbula: «Kisi kukwasa bitembu bya mbi mu ngolu za Belezebula, pfumu wa bitembu bya mbi.» <verse eid="MAT 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Bwosu kázaya mabanza ma bawu; wubazimbwadi: «Kipfumu kyosu kina kyadíkabisa kyawu meni, kyazíluka, amana mbanza yosu keti nzu yadíkabisa yawu meni yatélamaku. <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Yuka ni Satana kakukwasaka Satana, wadikabisa kenina yandi meni; amana abwetisi kipfumu kyandi kyazyámina? <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Amana yukani, meni, yisi kukwasa bitembu bya mbi mu hamu dya <note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu kakukwasaku bitembu bya mbi mu hamu dya Satana. Yesu káhyula kyufu kyaki «yuka ni» kikuma kya kusongila ni dibanza dya bafwadisi mbi dyakala. </char></note>Belezebula, bana benu, mu hamu dya nati bisi kukwasibya? Disonga bakála bawu meni, bazusi benu! <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Kaasi yukani mu Kitembu kya Nzambi yisi kukwasila bitembu bya mbi, kisongidila ni Kipfumu kya Nzambi kyisa kedi yi kuna kwena benu.<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>«Holo abweti mutu kalenda kota mu nzu ya yakala phandi ndangu kamuyiba bima byandi, konda kusanda theti ni kamukasa, mu misinga, yakala phandi meni wuna? Amana kunima kalunga tambula byosu mu nzu yandi<note caller="i" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna kingana kina, Satana kenina yakala phandi. Nzu ya yakala phandi kyenina kipfumu kya Satana. Bimvwama bya yakala phandi byena bima bina kisi kengidila Satana. Yesu kenina wuna wisi kota mu kipfumu kya Satana amana wukatudi holo wukutumuni batu bana kisi kengidila. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>Wuna weku yi meni, yandi mutendi wama; amana wuna kisiku khoka yi meni, kisi mwanga. <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Yi hakana ni, yiluzimbwadibwa: disumu dyosu yi ngusi zoosu balólulabya kaasi disumu dya kulewula Kitembu, dyalólukaku. <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Amana wuna waléwula Mwana wa mutu bamúlolula; kaasi wuna waléwula Kitembu kyatoma yandi kalólukaku keti mu tsi yayi, keti mu tangwa dina dyakwísa.»<verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Miti yi bibundu byandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>«Holo yukani miti wa bukheti wenina, kibundu kyandi phi kya bukheti; yuka ni miti wa mbi wenina, kibundu kyandi phi kya mbi kyenina; mukuma miti, bisiwa zayila ku kibundu kyandi. <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Mbandu ya masawa! Abweti lufwani kuzonza bima bya mboti, bwosu lwenina batu bambi? Mukuma mu kulutuka kwa mambu ku mbundu wisi zonzila munwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Mutu wa mboti kisi hola mambu ma mboti mu kimvwama kya bukheti kina kyenina muna fuka dya mbundu yandi; mutu wa mbi, kisi hola mambu ma mbi muna kimvwama kya mbi kina kyenina muna fuka dya mbundu yandi. <verse eid="MAT 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>Amana yiluzimbwadibwa: mu kilumbu kya pfundusu, batu bámenika kikuma kya ndinga zoosu zakonda mupfunu bakala zonza. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Mukuma muna ndinga zaku bakúnungisina, amana muna ndinga zaku bakúbedisila.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulomba kwa kidimbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mlk 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Hanga ndambu ya balongi ba mitsiku yi bafwadisi bazimbudi: «Mulongi, tuzodi kumona kiphadi kimosi kyatuka kwena ngeyi.» <verse eid="MAT 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Hanga yandi wubavutwadi: «Mbandu yayi ya mbi amana beku basiphi kwena Nzambi! Yibati sosa kiphadi; batámbulaku kiphadi kya hika, kaka kyakina kya mbikudi Yonasi. <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Mukuma bwosu kánanga Yonasi bilumbu bitatu yi phipha tatu mu kundu dya tsema wa mbuta, phila mosi Mwana wa mutu kanánga bilumbu bitatu yi phipha tatu mu tsi ya mafu. <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Muna kilumbu kya pfundusu, bisi Ninive bátelama ha kimosi yi batu ba mbandu yayi, amana babábedisa, kikuma bawu bábalumuna mbundu mu malongi ma Yonasi. Kinga dyadi dyenina haha diluti Yonasi! <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Pfumu wa mukhetu wa banda katélama, muna kilumbu kya pfundusu, ha kimosi yi batu ba mbandu yayi, amana kabábedisa, kikuma yandi, mu binzunga bya kyana bya tsi kátuka kikuma kya kuyuka mudimu wa Solumoni. Kinga dyadi dyenina haha, diluti Solumoni!»<verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvutuka kwa kitembu kya mbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>«Tangwa kisi lubuka kitembu kya mbi mu kati dya mutu, kisi luta mu kati dya tseki, kyasánda homa ha kulembwila, amana kimonihoku. <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>Hanga kizimbudini: "Yikwenda vutuka, muna nzu <note caller="k" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitembu kya mbi tangwa kyisi zonzila «nzu yandi», disongidila ni mu kati dya mutu wuna kakala. </char></note>yama, muna yilubuka." Amana ha kyatúla, kiwani nzu yakonda kima, yakukombula bukheti yi yakunenga. <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>Hanga kyendi amana kitambudi bitembu bikwawu tsambwadi bya mbi kuluta kyawu. Amana bikoti mwamuna, bisikidini. Amana khadidi ya mutu wuna yekina hika ya mbi lawu, kuluta yina ya theti. Phila mosi bwakála kikuma kya mbandu yayi ya mbi.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngudi yi baphangi ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mlk 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Bwosu kakala zonza hika kwena milumba-lumba mya batu, ngudi wandi yi baphangi bandi bákala kuna nzila amana bekasanda phila ya kumuzonzisa. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>[Mutu mosi wumuzimbwadi: «Ngudi waku yi baphangi baku ku nzila benina, amana babati sanda phila ya kukuzonzisa.»] <verse eid="MAT 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Kaasi Yesu wávutula bwabu: «Nati wenina ngudi wama? Banani benina baphangi bama?» <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Hanga lambudi koku kwena balonguki bandi amana wuzimbudi: «Tala yandu ngudi wama yi baphangi bama. <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Mukuma wosu wuna wisi hanga luzolu lwa Tata wama wuna wenina mu mazilu, yandi kenina phangi wama wa yakala yi phangi wama wa mukhetu yi ngudi wama.»<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Bingana kya kipfumu kya mazilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mlk 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Muna kilumbu meni kina, Yesu walubuka mu nzu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mlk 2:1</char></note> amana wenda zakala ku kabeta ka yanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Amana milumba-lumba mya batu myenda khokana bela-bela yi yandi, hanga yandi wazanza muna mudimba, wazakala mwamuna. Amana mulumba-lumba wa batu batelama kuna kabeta ka mamba.<verse eid="MAT 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mukuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Amana wábazimbwala mambu ma lawu mu bingana; wubazimbwadini: «Mukuni mosi wálubuka mu kukwenda kuna<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kikalulu kya bayuta kyakala kya kumwanga ngenza muna mafu mana kabundula mukuni. Muna phila meni yina, mukuni wa kilanga kafwana kukuna yi tswalu kyati kya mbuta, ata bweti mbongu yibwini muma mwa phasi. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>Buna kakala mwanga kheni, ndambu yahika yenda bwila mu nzila; banuni bisiya dya. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Amana ya hika yenda bwila muma mwa matadi, muna mwakonda kala mafu ma lawu. Hanga yibufudi tswalu, kikuma mafu mákalaku lawu; <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>kaasi ha kisa bala tangwa, yáyokama amana yáyumuka mukuma yákalaku yi misodi. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Amana yahika yenda bwila mu kati dya tsaku. Tsaku záleya amana zákakidisaya. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Kaasi mbutu yikwawu yibwi mu mafu ma bukheti, yibuti phi bibundu yimosi khama yikwawu makumasambanu, yikwawu hika makumatatu.<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbutu zina bakatula zoosu zakala za bukheti kuluta. Kitesu kya ndambu yina bakala hela batu ku kinzunga kya Ngadidi yi Yuteya muna tangwa meni dina, kyakala kya ngenza kumi muna kosu ngenza yina bakuna. </char></note> <verse eid="MAT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Wuna wenina yi matu ma kuyukila, kayuka!»<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikuma kya biki Yesu kakala zonzila mu bingana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mlk 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Balonguki babwesuka, hanga <note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Balonguki bisa kwena yandi mu kitsweki ku nima kukwenda kwa mulumba-lumba wa batu (Mlk 4:10). </char></note>bamuhyudini: «Kikuma kya biki wisi bazonzila mu bingana?» <verse eid="MAT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Amana yandi wubavutwadi bwabu: «Mukuma yuka lwátambula, benu, mazaya ma bitsweki bya Kipfumu kya mazilu; bawu bátambulamoku. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Mukuma bisi yika kwena mutu wuna wenina kedi yi bima ndangu kakala byawu lawu; kaasi kwena wuna wukondi kima bamutambula keti kina kena kyawu. <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Ihana mbati bazonzila mu bingana, kikuma mu kumona, bisiku mona, amana mu kuyuka, bisiku yuka, bisiku bakula. <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Amana yilungidi, kikuma kya bawu, mbikutulu ya Yesaya yina kazimbula:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">«Lwayuka kwenu mboti-mboti, kaasi lwabakisaku;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">amana lwatala kwenu mboti-mboti kaasi lwalendaku mona.<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>Mukuma mbundu ya batu bana yizitami;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">bakituki bizika matu amana bazibiki mesu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">ndangu bamona nana mu mesu ma bawu, bayuka nana mu matu ma bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">babakisa nana yi mbundu ya bawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">wadi bamvutwakila, yikhana babelula.»<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>«Kaasi kyesi kwena benu, kikuma: mesu menu misi mona, matu menu phi misi yuka! <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadi: mukuma lawu dya bambikudi yi batu ba masonga bátonda kumona mana lubati mona, amana bámonamoku; bátonda kuyuka mana lubati yuka kaasi báyukamoku.»<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubangumuni kingana kya mukuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mlk 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>«Yukenu si thendula ya kingana kya mukuni. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Wosu wuna wayuka ndinga ya Kipfumu kya Nzambi kaasi kabakisiyoku, mbeni wisi, amana wubwotudiya yina bakuni mu mbundu yandi: yandi kenina hanga yina bamwanga mu kati dya nzila. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Amana yina bamwanga muma mwa matadi, yi wuna wayuka Ndinga amana wutambwasiya yi kyesi, <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>kaasi keku yi misodi mwena yandi meni, kisi zyama lwesi mu tangwa dimosi; amana yukani kiwayi holo munyanga wisa kikuma kya Ndinga ya Nzambi, kyekina kisinza kikuma kya yandi. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Amana yina bamwanga mu kati kya tsaku, yi wuna wuyuki Ndinga, kaasi kiwayi kya tsi yi luvunu lwa kimvwama bifitikisiya Ndinga, kaasi konda kubuta keti kibundu. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Amana yina bámwanga mu mafu ma bukheti, yi wuna wisi wuka Ndinga amana wubakisiya; kisi hana kheni, yisi butuka homa khama, homa makumasambanu, ha kwawu yika makumatatu.»<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mbodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Wubatidi hika kingana kikwawu mu kuzimbula: «Kipfumu kya mazilu kifwanakani yi mutu mosi wamwanga mbutu ya bukheti ya ngenza bisi tela bule muna kilanga kyandi. <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Kaasi mu tangwa dina bakala nimba batu, mbeni wisa, wumwangi ngenza za mbodi hana kati dya bule, amana wenda kwandi. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Amana tangwa wamena mwangu wa bule, wubuti phi ngenza, hanga mbodi yawu phi yilubuki. <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Amana buna bábwesuka basadi ba mukwa nzu, bámuzimbwala: "Pfumu, ngeyi wámwangaku mbutu ya bukheti mu kilanga kyaku? Amana ku biki yituki hika mbodi? <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>Yandi wubavutwadi: "Mbeni mosi yana wuhangi bwabuna." Amana basadi bandi bamuzimbwadini: "Wuzodi ni thwendaya vusa?" <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>Amana yandi wubazimbwadi: "Loni, mu kuvusa kwa mbodi, hanga lwavusa nana phi bule. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Yambulenu byakola ha kimosi tii yi kuna kuledika; amana mu tangwa dya kuledika, yizímbula kwena basadi: Vusenu theti mbodi; amana kasenuya mu mikuta kikuma kya kuyokaya; kunima, lumbikenu bule muna khila yama."»<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya kheni ya tidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mlk 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Wubatidi hika kingana kikwawu mu kubazimbwala: «Kipfumu kya mazilu kifwanani yi ngenza ya tidi kabonga <note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kikuma kya Bayuta, ngenza ya tidi yakala kidimbu kya kima kimosi kya khunda. Kaasi ngenza ya tidi yina bakuna mu tsi ya Bayuta yakituka miti mosi wa mbuta wuna wafwana kuleya kitesu kya moku matatu. </char></note>mutu mosi amana wukuniya muna kilanga kyandi. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Yi mbutu yiluti kukeya, mu ngenza zoosu; kaasi tangwa yisi kola, yikituki miti wa mbuta kuluta mikhengedi mina myakala mu kilanga amana banuni ku zilu bisi tunga mazamba ma bawu muna mihandi myandi.»<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu bulunda bwa khulu, Nzambi wafwanikisa bipfumu bya mbuta bya lawu yi miti mya mbuta muna bakala kwisa tungila banuni mazamba. Tangwa kazonzila Yesu Kipfumu kya Nzambi hanga miti wa mbuta banuni yi kuzembilaka muna mihandi myandi, Bayuta babakula tswatsu ni phila mosi phi Kipfumu kya Nzambi kyisi kitukila kya mbuta. </char></note><verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya muvimbu wa mapha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 1:20-21">Luk 1:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Yandi wubatidi hika kingana kimosi: «Kipfumu kya mazilu kifwanani yi muvimbu kabonga, mukhetu mosi, amana wukotisi muna ndambu ya lawu ya pfuba tii yi kuna kyathutumuka kithoba kyosu.»<note caller="i" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Koma ka muvimbu kafwani kumwangana muna kati dya pfuba za lawu. Phila mosi, Kipfumu kya Nzambi kyayandika kya khunda yi ndambu ya balonguki lwesi amana kivudi. Kibati kwenda mwangana mu tsi yosu amana yitambudikya. </char></note><verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikuma kya biki Yesu kakala zonzila mu bingana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mlk 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Byosu bina, Yesu kakala zonzila kwena milumba-lumba mya batu mu bingana; kakalaku bazimbwala kima konda ni kata kingana. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>Ndangu malungila mana básamuna mu nzila ya mbikudi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">«Yitambula ndinga ndangu yizonzila mu bingana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">yisamuna, mu munwa wama, mambu mana maswamana tuka ku luyandiku lwa tsi.»<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubangumuni kingana kya mbodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Hanga wasisa milumba-lumba mya batu amana wavutuka ku nzu. Balonguki bandi babwesuka, mu kumuzimbwala: «Tubangwamina kingana kya mbodi mu kilanga.» <verse eid="MAT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Amana yandi wubavutwadi: «Wuna wisi kuna mbutu ya bukheti, kenina Mwana wa mutu; <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>Amana kilanga, kyenina tsi; mbongu ya bukheti yenina bana ba Kipfumu kya mazilu; mbodi yenina bana ba mbeni; <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>amana mbeni wuna wakunaya kenina kiphidi-mutu; kuledika, kwenina tsuka ya tsi; bakwa kuledika benina banzyo. <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Disongidila, phila mosi yi buna bisi vusa mbodi ndangu balosaya ku mbawu, yi bwabuna phi bwakala mu tsuka ya tsi. <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Mwana wa mutu katuma banzyo bandi, bana bakwisa vusa mu Kipfumu kyandi boosu bana bisi bwisisa bakwawu mu masumu yi bana bisi hanga mbi, <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>amana babatimbula ha ziku dya mbawu; amana kwakala bidilu yi khwekisa za menu. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Hanga batu basungama balema hanga tangwa mu Kipfumu kya Tata wa bawu. Wuna wenina yi matu kayuka!»<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya kimvwama kya kusweka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>«Kipfumu kya mazilu kifwakani yi kimvwama kya kusweka muna kilanga kimosi. Mutu wuna wusengumunikya kahanga wuswekikya hika. Muna kyesi kyandi, kakwenda tekisa kyosu kina kenina kyawu mu kusumba kilanga kina<note caller="k" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kingana kyaki kibati songila ni kima kiluti mupfunu mu luzingu lwa mutu kyenina kukala mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi. Kingana kizimbudiku ni mutu wulungi kasumba nzila yandi mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi. </char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>«Kipfumu kya mazilu kifwanani hika yi muteki mosi wakala sosa misanga mya kitoku. <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>Amana buna kamona musanga wumosi wa thalu ya lawu, wenda tekisa kyosu kina kakala kyawu amana wasumbawa.»<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya wanda dya batsema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>«Kipfumu kya mazilu kifwanani hika yi wanda dina batimbudi mu yanga amana dyakhoka batsema ba phila zoosu. <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>Tangwa dibasi, balubudidya ku tseki, amana bazakadi, bahungudi batsema bana ba bukheti mu kitunga, amana balosi bina byenina bya mbi. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Phila mosi bwakala phi ku tsuka ya tsi: banzyo bakwenda yekula batu ba mbi yi batu ba masonga; <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>amana babalosa ku ziku dya mbawu; kwakuna kwakala bidilu yi khwekisa za menu.»<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bimvwama bya khulu yi bina bya pha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>«Lubakisiki mambu mana mosu?» Bamuvutwadini: «Eeh» <verse eid="MAT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Amana yandi wubazimbwadi: «Ihana ni mulongi wa mitsiku wosu wukituki mulonguki wa Kipfumu kya mazilu, yandi wufwanani yi mukwa nzu mosi wisi lubula muna fuka dyandi bima bya pha yi bima bya khulu.»<note caller="l" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu phila ya kingana, muhowu wawu "pha" wubati songila malongi ma Yesu. Muhowu wuna "khulu" wubati songila malongi ma Bulunda bwa Khulu. Mya myodi mya bukheti myenina. </char></note><verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bisi Nazaleti babusi kukumbwala mwena Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mlk 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Amana tangwa kamanisa, Yesu, bingana bina, wákatuka kuna, <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>amana buna kísa ku mbanza yandi yina kákodila, wuyandiki kulonga muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta za bawu; báyituka lawu, batu bákala dihyula: «Ku biki zibati mutuka nduka zazi yi biphadi? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Ka yandi ku mwana wa musadi wa mabaya? Ngudi wandi ka wuna ku bisi tela Madiya, amana Zyaki, Yozefu, Simoni yi Yuta kabawuku baphangi bandi. <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Amana baphangi bandi ba bakhetu benahoku boosu ha kati dya betu? Amana ku biki si misi mutuka mana mosu?» <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Amana bwabuna bwakala bakandikisa mu kukumbwala mwena yandi. Yesu wubazimbwadi: «Mbikudi bisiku mukanda lukumu, kaasi kisiku lumina mu tsi yandi yi mu kikanda kyandi.» <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Amana kasalakwoku biphadi bya lawu, kikuma kya kukonda kwa lukwikilu lwa bawu.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lwa Yowani Mubotiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mlk 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, wáyuka <note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bwabu bubati songila Eloti Atiphasi, mosi wa bana ba kyamvu wa mbuta (2:1). </char></note>Eloti, wuna wákala mosi wa bakyamvu baya, kuzonzila Yesu; <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>amana wázimbula kwena basadi bandi: «Yandu-yandu kenina Yowani Mubotiki: yandi wufutumuki ku bafwa! Amana kikuma kya bwabuna kenina yi hamu dya kusadila biphadi.»<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Mukuma Eloti wámukwatisa Yowani, wámukasisa mu miyololu amana wámukotisa mu boloku, kikuma kya Elodyadi mukhetu wa Fidiphu phangi wandi. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Kikuma Yowani kakala muzimbwala: «Weku yi muswa wa kumubonga hanga mukhetu waku.»<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Longu meni luna lwakalaku mu ndonga ku thwala mitsiku mya Bayuta (Lev 20:21), mukuma Eloti wakwela Elodyadi kinga phangi wandi Fidiphu hana mu luzingu kakala. </char></note> <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Amana bwosu kázola kumuhondisa, wáyuka bweya bwa mulumba-lumba wa batu, mukuma bakala mumona Yowani hanga mbikudi. <verse eid="MAT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Kinga, kuna mukinzi wa lubutuku lwa Eloti, mwana wa mukhetu wa Elodyadi wákina hana kati dya batu amana wámusephidisa lawu Eloti; <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>Hanga mu kudya ndefi, wábonga lukanu lwa kumuheka kina kámulomba. <verse eid="MAT 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Amana mwana wa mukhetu bámukoma kwena ngudi wandi, wumuzimbudi: «Pheka hakaka, mutwa wa Yowani Mubotiki, ha dilonga!»<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuzenga mutwa kwakala phila mosi bakala sadila, muna tangwa dina, kwena bisi Loma mu kuhonda mutu. Elodyadi kakala zola mutwa hana dilonga ndangu kalenga mona ni Yowani bamuhonda. Hanga mutwa walosama.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Amana kyamvu mu kiwayi, kikuma kya ndefi yina kadya ku thwala ya babana kátedisa, wáhana muswa bamuhekawa. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Amana wátuma kubukuna mutwa wa Yowani muna boloku. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Amana bánata mutwa wandi hana dilonga, báhanawa kwena mwana wa mukhetu, amana yandi wánatawa kwena ngudi wandi. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Amana balonguki bandi bisa bonga mvumbi yandi, bámuzika; buna bisa, básamunabwa kwena Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudisi mafunda matanu ma batu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Ywn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Buna káyuka musamu wuna, Yesu wákatuka hana, wábonga mudimba wumosi ndangu kendila mu nganga ku phungamu; amana buna báyuka milumba-lumba mya batu, bámulanda mu malu, tuka ku mbanza. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Amana buna kálubuka mu mudimba, wámona mulumba-lumba mosi wa batu, wáyuka kyadi kikuma kya bawu amana wábuka bambefu ba bawu. <verse eid="MAT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Buna mábwa masikidika, balonguki bábwesuka kwena yandi, bazimbudini: «Homa thwenina ha tseki, tangwa phi diluti. Sula milumba-lumba mya batu, ndangu benda mu mahata, badisumbila bima bya kudya.» <verse eid="MAT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Kaasi Yesu wubazimbwadi: «Beku yi mupfunu wa kukwenda; bahekenu benu-benu bima bya kudya.» <verse eid="MAT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Kaasi bamuzimbwadini: «Thwenina lwesi haha yi mapha matanu yi batsema bodi!» <verse eid="MAT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Amana yandi wuzimbudi: «Ndatinenubya kwaku.» <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Amana wuhani muswa kwena milumba-lumba mya batu bazakala muna mwangu, buna kátambula mapha mana matanu yi batsema bodi, wusekudi mesu ku zilu, wuvutudi matondu kwena Nzambi, wubukuni mapha amana wuhanibya kwena balonguki; bawu bákabisibya kwena milumba-lumba mya batu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Boosu bádya amana báyukuta. Bánata bitunga kumi yi byodi bya kabasi yi bitini bina byálutuka<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2Th 4:42-44. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Batu bana badya, bákala kitesu kya mafunda matanu ma bayakala, konda kutanga bakhetu yi bana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukangadi ha thandu ya yanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mlk 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Ywn 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Amana buna bámanisa batu, wásenda kwena balonguki mu kukota mu masuwa, bámutekila kuna sambwa dina dikwawu, kithama kina kasudila yandi meni milumba-lumba mya batu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Kunima dya kusula milumba-lumba mya batu, wátombuka ku mongu kikuma kya kulombila ku phungamu; amana ha kwáyila kuma, yandi buhika kákala kwakuna. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Amana masuwa mekina kedi kyana kya lawu yi mafu, makaka makala dibunda kuna masuwa mukuma pfunzi yakala tadisa kuna bakala kwisila bawu. <verse eid="MAT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Amana muna khoku wa theti, Yesu wísa mu kukangala hana thandu ya yanga, kuna bákala bawu. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Amana balonguki buna bámumona yandi ni ha thandu ya yanga kabati kangala, bweya bwábakwata lawu amana bazimbudi: «Kiphedikisa kina!» Bakalunga kikuma kya bweya. <verse eid="MAT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Muna mbala mosi, Yesu wábazimbwala: «Kalenu yi kikesa! Meni yandu, luyukaku bweya!» <verse eid="MAT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Amana Phetelu wumuvutwadi: «Pfumu, yukani ngeyi wuna; pheka muswa ndangu meni phi yisa kwena ngeyi hana mukanda wa mamba.» <verse eid="MAT 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Amana yandi wuvutudi: «Awisa!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Buna kátuluka mu mudimba, Phetelu wákangala hana mukanda wa mamba mu kukwenda kwena Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Kaasi mu kumona muphephi wuna wa ngolu, wáyuka bweya. Amana buna káyandika kutika, wákalunga: «Pfumu, phulula!» <verse eid="MAT 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Amana muna mbala mosi, Yesu wáyuna koku, wámusimba wumuzimbwadi: «Mutu wa lukwikilu lwa khunda! Kikuma kya biki wenina yi keti-keti?» <verse eid="MAT 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Amana bákota mu mudimba, pfunzi yálembama. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Amana bana bákala mu mudimba báfukama kuna thwala yandi, bázimbula phi: «Kyedika ngeyi wenina Mwana wa Nzambi!»<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubeludi bambefu ku mulambu wa Ngenezaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mlk 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Buna básabuka, bátula ku mulambu wa Ngenezaleti<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mlk 6:53. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Amana batu ba mulambu meni wuna bámubakula, báyadingisa phi musamu muna mulambu wuna wosu, amana bámunatina bambefu boosu. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Amana bámubokwadila ni basimba lwesi keti nzenzi ya muledi wandi; amana boosu bana básimbawa, bábeluka.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Malongi mana básisa bakhaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mlk 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Hanga Bafwadisi yi balongi ba mitsiku bana bátuka ku Yelusalemi bisa bwesuka kwena Yesu amana bázimbula: <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>«Kikuma kya biki balonguki ba ngeyi bisi kulula bizila bya bakhaka? Mukuma bisiku sukula moku mu tangwa dya kudya<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 11:38 </char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Yandi wubavutwadi: «Amana benu, kikuma kya biki lwisi kulula mitsiku mya Nzambi, lwazitisaka lwesi mitsiku myásisa bakhaka benu? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Mukuma Nzambi kázimbula: "Zitisa tata waku yi ngudi waku," amana phi "wuna wasínga tata wandi holo ngudi wandi bamuhondisa<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kul 20:12; Klg 5:18 yi Kul 21:17 yi Lev 20:9 </char></note>." <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Kaasi benu, lwisi zimbula: Wuna wazímbula kwena tata wandi kondi lo kwena ngudi wandi: "Kina yikhana kuheka mu kukusadisa kyenina kya kulambula kikuma kya Nzambi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:5</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuta bakala yi kikalulu kya kuhanaka bima kikuma kya kisalu kya Nzambi. Yuka ni balambudi kima kikuma kya kisalu kya Nzambi, bafwanikyoku basadila hika mu mutindu wukwawu. </char></note>!" <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>Mutu wuna keku hika yi mupfunu wa kusadisa tata wandi holo ngudi wandi. Bwabuna lubati lewula Ndinga ya Nzambi kikuma kya bizila byenu!» <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>«Bakavungalosi! Yesaya mboti kábikula mu kuzimbula:»<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>"Kanda dyadi dyisi nzitisa lwesi ha munwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:8">kaasi mbundu yandi yenina kyana yi meni.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Amana mu phamba bisi khumisina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:9">mukuma bawu bisi longa malongi matadidi bizila bya kimutu hanga mitsiku mya Nzambi."<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mambu mana misi sumuna mutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mlk 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Kunima wátela mulumba-lumba wa batu amana wuzimbudi: «Yukenu amana bakisenu! <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Heku ni kima kina kisi kota mu munwa kisi sumuna mutu. Kaasi kima kina kisi lubuka mu munwa kyakina kisi sumuna mutu.» <verse eid="MAT 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Hanga buna bábwesuka balonguki, bamuzimbwadini: «Wuzayi ni ndinga yina, khabu lawu yabaheki Bafwadisi?» <verse eid="MAT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Amana yandi mu kuvutula, wuzimbudi: «Miti wosu wuna kákonda kuna Tata wama wena ku zilu bavúsawa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>Bayambulenu: benina baphofu bisi natisa baphofu! Amana yukani phofu kanatisa phofu mukwawu, bawu boodi babwa mu dibulu.» <verse eid="MAT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Amana Phetelu wumuzimbwadi: «Tubangwamina kingana kina.» <verse eid="MAT 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Yandi wubazimbwadi: «Benu phi, yi buthwena bwabu, lweku yi mbakisilu? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Lwisiku zaya ni kyosu kina kisi kota mu munwa, mu kundu kisi kwenda, kunima kilubukini? <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Kaasi kina kyisi lubuka mu munwa, ku mbundu kyisi tuka, amana kyakina kyisi sumuna mutu. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Mukuma ku mbundu misi tuka mabanza ma mbi, khengu, mbongi, kindumba kya kisaka-saka, bwifi, bukamvi yi ngusi. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Byabina bima byisi sumuna mutu; kaasi kudya konda kusukula moku kwisiku sumuna mutu!»<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukhetu mosi wa nzenza wukwikidi mwena Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mlk 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Buna kálubuka kwakuna, Yesu wénda ku milambu mya tsi ya Tidi yi Sitoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Amana kutala mukhetu mosi, mwisi Kanana, wátuka kuna mulambu meni wuna yi kukalungaka: «Pfumu, Mwana wa Tavidi, ngyukila kyadi! Mwana wama wa mukhetu babati muyangisa kwena kitembu kya mbi!» <verse eid="MAT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Kaasi yandi kámuvutwalaku keti ndinga. Amana buna bábwesuka balonguki bandi, bakala muhyula mu kumuzimbwala: «Mukula, mukuma kabatiku lembwa kukalunga mu kutulanda.» <verse eid="MAT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Amana yandi mu kuvutula wázimbula: «Báthuma lwesi kwena mikoku mina myátota mya kanda dya kiseledi.»<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Kaasi mukhetu wisa fukama kuna thwala ya yandi mu kuzimbula: «Pfumu, awisa tsadisa!» <verse eid="MAT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Amana yandi mu kuvutula, wázimbula: «Ka mboti ku mu kutambula madya ma bana amana batimbulama kwena bana ba bambwa.» <verse eid="MAT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Amana mukhetu wuvutudi: «Kyedika, Pfumu, aketi bana ba bambwa phi bisi dya pfuku-pfuku zina zisi bwa mu tsi ya mesa ma bapfumu ba bawu.» <verse eid="MAT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Hanga Yesu mu kuvutula, wuzimbudi: «Oh mukhetu! Lukwikilu lwaku lwa lawu lwenina! Bwalungila bwosu buna wuzodi.» Amana mwana wandi wa mukhetu wábeluka muna tangwa meni dina.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubeludi bambefu ba lawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Yesu wákatuka hakana, wenda ku kabeta ka yanga dya Ngadidi. Wátombuka ku mongu amana wásikuka kwakuna. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Amana milumba-lumba mya batu mya lawu bisa bwesuka kwena yandi mu kunata bifwa malu yi baphofu yi bikata yi mihunga yi bambefu bahika. Bábasikula bela-bela yi malu ma Yesu amana wábabelula. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Batu báyituka, mu kumona mihunga kuzonza, bikata kubeluka, bifwa malu kukangala yi baphofu kumona amana báyandika kuzatula Nzambi wa Kiseledi.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudisi mafunda maya ma bayakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mlk 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Yesu wátela balonguki bandi wuzimbudi: «Yenina yi kiwayi kikuma kya mulumba-lumba wa batu, mukuma tala bilumbu byekina bitatu bena kumosi yi meni amana beku yi kima kya kudya. Nzodiku ni yibasula yi nzala; hanga balembwa nana mu nzila.» <verse eid="MAT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Hanga balonguki bamuzimbwadini: «Ku biki twawana madya ma lawu ma kudisila mulumba-lumba wa batu babana báyukuta, mu kati kya tseki?» <verse eid="MAT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Amana Yesu wuzimbudi kwena bawu: «Mapha makwa lwenina mawu?» Bawu bazimbudi: «Tsambwadi yi tuma twa batsema.» <verse eid="MAT 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Hanga wusendi kwena mulumba-lumba wa batu ni bazakala muna mafu. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Wábonga mapha mana tsambwadi yi batsema, wávutula matondu kwena Nzambi, wábukununabya amana wáhanabya kwena balonguki, amana balonguki bákabisabya kwena milumba-lumba. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Amana badya boosu, báyukuta phi. Amana bákatula bitunga tsambwadi bya kabasi yi bitini bina byásala. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Amana bana badya bákala mafunda maya ma bayakala, konda kutanga bakhetu yi bana. <verse eid="MAT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Amana buna kásula mulumba-lumba wa batu, wákota mu mudimba, wenda mu milambu mya Makatani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Bafwadisi yi Basadise balombi kiphadi kimosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mlk 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Amana buna bábwesuka, Bafwadisi yi Basadise, mu kumuleya. Bámulomba kiphadi kyatuka ku zilu. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Kaasi yandi mu kuvutula, wázimbula kwena bawu: «Mu masikidika, lwisi zimbula: "Kuma kwasemunuka, mukuma zilu dya kabengi dyenina." <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Amana mu suka, lwisi zimbula: "Lelu kwatómakanaku mukuma zilu dya kaphindi dyenina." Benu luzayi kubangumuna mitindu mya zilu; amana abweti lwisiku lenda kubakula bidimbu bya tangwa dyadi? <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Mbandu ya mbi amana yakonda basiphi yibati sosa kiphadi, yamónaku kiphadi kya hika kaka kyakina kya Yonasi<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fwanikisa yi 12:39-40. </char></note>.» Kunima Yesu wábasisa amana wenda kwandi.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muvimbu wa mapha ma Bafwadisi yi Basadise</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mlk 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Balonguki, mu kukwisa ku sambwa dikwawu, bázimbakana mu kunata mapha. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Amana Yesu wubazimbwadi: «Dikengenu ku muvimbu wa mapha wa Bafwadisi yi Basadise.» <verse eid="MAT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Amana balonguki bakala banza, yi kudiwininaka: «Kikuma tunatiku mapha.» <verse eid="MAT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Yesu wábakulabwa amana wazimbula: «Kikuma kya biki lubati banzila bwabuna, batu ba lukwikilu lwa khunda! Kikuma lukondi mapha? <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Khaku kedi lubakisa? Lubatiku yubuka mapha matanu ma mafunda matanu yi thalu ya bitunga bina lwátonguna? <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Keti mapha tsambwadi ma mafunda maya yi thalu ya bitunga bina lwátonguna? <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Abweti lubatiku bakula ni ka kikuma ku kya mapha yíkala luzonzila? Kaasi dikengenu ku muvimbu wa mapha ma Bafwadisi yi Basadise?»<verse eid="MAT 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Hanga babakudi ni kakala zimbula: badikengaku ku muvimbu wa mapha, kaasi ku malongi ma Bafwadisi yi Basadise.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phetelu wusamuni ni Yesu kenina Kidisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mlk 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Yesu, buna kátula ku mulambu wa Sezale dya Fidiphu, hanga wuyandiki kuhyula kwena balonguki bandi: «Abweti bisi zonza batu kikuma kya Mwana wa mutu?» <verse eid="MAT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Amana bawu bázimbula: «Bahika bisi zimbula ni ngeyi wena Yowani Mubotiki, bakwawu ni Diya, amana bahika ni, Yelemiya holo mosi wa bambikudi.» <verse eid="MAT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Yandi wubazimbwadi: «Amana kikuma kya benu, nati yenina?» <verse eid="MAT 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Amana mu kuvutula, Simoni Phetelu wuzimbudi: «Ngeyi wu Kidisitu, Mwana wa Nzambi wa moyu.» <verse eid="MAT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Amana mu kuvutula, Yesu wámuzimbwala: «Kyesi kwena ngeyi, Simoni, mwana wa Yonasi; mukuma heku ni menga yi musuni bikuzayisima mambu mana, kaasi Tata wama wuna wenina mu mazilu. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Amana meni phi, yikuzimbwadi ni ngeyi wenina Tadi, amana hana thandu ya tadi meni dina yitungila Dibundu<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Efeso 2:20.</char></note> dyama. Amana ngolu za lufwa zahángaku kima kwena dyawu. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Yikuheka tsabi za Kipfumu kya mazilu: amana mana wakása ha tsi, makásama mu mazilu, mana wakútumuna ha tsi makútumuka mu mazilu<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Kukasa» yi «kukutumuna» myenina mihowu mina bisi sadila kwena balongi ba Bayuta mu kuzimbula ni «kukandisa» yi «kuhana nzila». "Kina wukandisi keti kina wuhanini nzila kwena batu ndangu basala ha tsi, Nzambi phi ku zilu kahana tangwa dyandi". </char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Hanga wubabwisisi balonguki bazimbulaku kwena mutu ni yandi Kidisitu kenina.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutekidi samuna lufwa yi lufutumuku lwandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mlk 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Tuka buna, Yesu wáyandika kusongila kwena balonguki bandi: «Bulungi, yenda ku Yelusalemi, kunyokuka lawu mu nzila ya bambuta ba Bayuta yi bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku, baphonda amana kilumbu kya tatu, yifutumuka.» <verse eid="MAT 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Amana Phetelu wumunati ku phungamu, wuyandiki kumukaya, wumuzimbwadi: «Pfumu, Nzambi kakulunda! Mambu mana mafwaniku kukubwila!» <verse eid="MAT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Kaasi yandi buna kábaluka wázimbula kwena Phetelu: «Katuka, awenda ku manima ma meni, Satana! Ngeyi wenina kisinza kikuma kya meni mukuma wisiku banza hanga Nzambi, kaasi hanga batu.»<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Hanga Yesu wuzimbudi kwena balonguki bandi: «Yukani mutu wuzodi kundanda, kadibwisa yandi meni, katikula kitakani kyandi amana kisa ndanda. <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Ihana ni, wosu wuna wazóla kuhulula luzingu lwandi, katótisalwa kaasi wuna watótisa luzingu lwandi kikuma kya meni, katámbulalwa hika. <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Khi mupfunu si kwena mutu kavwa tsi yosu amana katotisa luzingu lwandi? Kondilo, biki kafwani kuhana mutu mu kusobisa yi luzingu lwandi? <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>Mukuma Mwana wa mutu kakwísa mu khembu ya Tata wandi, yi banzyo bandi, amana kafúta kwena mutu wosu bwosu myenina mihangu myandi<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mikunga 62:13; Loma 2:6.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Abwabuna, yiluzimbwadi: bahika mu kati dya baba benina haha, badífwilaku kedi ku thwala kumona Mwana wa mutu kukwisa mu kipfumu kyandi.»<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Kudibalumuna kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mlk 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Kunima bilumbu bisambanu, Yesu wábonga hakimosi yi yandi Phetelu, Zyaki yi Yowani phangi wandi hanga wutombuki yi bawu ku mongu mosi wa kaleyi; mu kingenga. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Yandi wásoba kuna thwala ya bawu; mbunzu yandi yakala kedyamina hanga tangwa, miledi myandi phi mikituki phembi hanga mwini. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Amana kutala Moyize yi Diya bádimonikisa kwena bawu, yi kuyambilaka yi yandi. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Amana mu kuvutula, Phetelu wázimbula kwena Yesu: «Pfumu, bwena mboti twakalenu kwetu kwakuku. Yuka wuzodi, yitunga hahaha masombolu matatu, dimosi kikuma kya ngeyi, dimosi kikuma kya Moyize amana dimosi kikuma kya Diya.» <verse eid="MAT 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Bwana kakala zonza hika, kutala tuti dimosi dya mitsyenzya dyisi bafidinga kuna kininga kyandi, amana ndinga mosi yátuka muna tuti mu kuzonza: «Yandu kenina Mwana wa meni watondama; mwena yandi tsini tsambu yama. Muyukilenu!» <verse eid="MAT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Amana buna báyuka bwabuna, balonguki, bábukama, báyuka bweya bwa lawu. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Kaasi Yesu wábwesuka yi kubasimbaka wuzimbudi: «Telamenu, luyukaku bweya.» <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Amana buna básekula mesu, bámonaku mutu, Yesu lwesi yandi hika. <verse eid="MAT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Mu kukulumuka kwa bawu ku mongu, Yesu wábalongikila mu kuzonza: «Luzonzilaku kwena mutu mbona mesu yayi, yikuna kafútumukina, Mwana wa mutu, ku bafwa.»<verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Amana balonguki bámuyufula: «Kikuma kya biki balongi ba mitsiku bisi zimbwala ni Diya kafweti kwisa theti?» <verse eid="MAT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Amana yandi mu kuvutula, wázimbula: «Mu kyedika ni Diya wisi amana kayílulula bima byosu. <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Kaasi yiluzimbwadi: Diya wisa kedi, kaasi bámubakulaku, bámuhanga bwosu buna bázola. Bwabuna phi bamúnyokuna Mwana wa mutu.» <verse eid="MAT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Hanga balonguki babakudi ni kikuma kya Yowani Mubotiki kakala bazonzila.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubeludi mwana mosi wakala bela kikhoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mlk 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Amana buna bisa kwena mulumba-lumba wa batu, mutu mosi wisa fukama kuna thwala ya yandi <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>yi kuzimbulaka: «Pfumu, muyukila kyadi mwana wa meni. Kikuma mukwa kikhoni kenina amana kisi bela lawu, mukuma matangwa mahika kisi bwa ku mbawu, matangwa mahika phi mu mamba. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Yimunatiki kwena balonguki baku, amana balendikiku mu kumubuka.» <verse eid="MAT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Amana mu kuvutula, Yesu wuzimbudi: «Mbandu yakonda lukwikilu yi yavwalangana! Yi kuna khi tangwa yikádiki yi benu? Yi kuna khi tangwa yilútambwasiki? Mundatinenu kwaku.» <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Yesu wakayakya kitembu kya mbi; amana mwana wa yakala wábeluka muna tangwa meni dina. <verse eid="MAT 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Hanga balonguki babwesuki kwena Yesu mu kingenga bazimbudi: «Kikuma kya biki tufwanikiku kumulubulakya?» <verse eid="MAT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>Amana yandi wuzimbudi kwena bawu: «Kikuma kya lukwikilu lwenu lwa khunda. Kikuma, mu kyedika yiluzimbwadi: Yuka ni lwakala yi lukwikilu hanga ngenza ya tidi, wadi lukhani zimbula kwena mongu wawu: "Katuka haha, wenda hana", amana wendi. Amana heku kima kyakonda lendakana. [<verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>Kaasi mbandu yina yisi lubuka lwesi mu bisambu yi kuzila madya.]»<verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuni hika lufwa yi lufutumuku lwandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mlk 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Kilumbu kimosi bákala bawu ku Ngadidi, Yesu wábazimbwala: «Mwana wa mutu bámulambula ku moku ma batu; <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>amana bámuhonda; kilumbu kya tatu, káfutumuka. Báyuka kiwayi kya lawu.»<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phaku ya nzu ya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Amana buna bisa ku Kaphedinawuma, bana bakala bonga mbongu za nzu ya <note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mukanda wa Kulubuka 30:13 wuzonzi ni phaku ya tsuka mvula bakalaya futisa kwena kosu yakala wa muyuta tukidila mvula makumodi kikuma kya kuyidikila nzu ya Nzambi. </char></note>Nzambi bábwesuka kwena Phetelu, amana bazimbudi: «Mulongi wenu kisiku futa phaku za nzu ya Nzambi?» <verse eid="MAT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Wuzimbudi «eeh!» Amana buna kisa kota mu nzu, Yesu wámukesidila mu kuzimbula: «Simoni, abweti wubati banza? Bakyamvu ba tsi, kwena nati bisi futisa phaku? Kwena bana ba bawu ho kwena banzenza?» <verse eid="MAT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Amana yandi wávutula: «Kwena banzenza», Yesu wámuzimbwala: «Disongidila bana ba kuyekula benina<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna tangwa meni dina, bakyamvu bakala futisa lwesi phaku kwena bakwa tsi yina babotula bawu, kaasi bakwa hata dya bawu loni.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Mukusya ni tukalaku kisinza kwena bawu, ndawenda ku yanga, timbula ndobu amana wakwata tsema watheti wuna wakwísa, amana buna wamúhadikisa munwa wandi: wawána fwalanga dimosi; buna wabóngadya hana kwena bawu kikuma kya ngeyi yi meni.»<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Nati wenina mbuta wa mukwandi mu Kipfumu kya mazilu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mlk 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, balonguki bábwesuka kwena Yesu mu kuzimbula: «Nati si wenina mbuta wa mukwandi mu Kipfumu kya mazilu?» <verse eid="MAT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Hanga wutedi mwana mosi, wámusya hana kati dya bawu, <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>amana wuzimbudi: «Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadi, yukani lusobiku, amana lwakituka hanga bana, lwakótamwoku mu Kipfumu kya mazilu. <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Disongidila, wosu wuna wadíkulumuna hanga mwana yandu, kakála mbuta wa mukwandi mu Kipfumu kya mazilu. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Amana wosu wuna wuyambi mwana mosi mu khumbu ya meni, meni kayambini.<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kebenu mu kusumuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mlk 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>«Amana wuna wuhukumuni mosi wa bana bakhunda baba bisi kwikila mwena meni, bulungi kwena yandi bamuzitikila kalunga tadi hana tsingu amana bamudibula muna dingu dya yanga dya mbuta. <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Khi kyadi kwena tsi kikuma kya bisinza, mu kyedika, bwalendaku salama ni kukalaku mambu mana misi sumuna; kaasi kyadi kwena wuna kyalúbwakila kisinza! <verse eid="MAT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>Amana yukani koku dyaku holo kulu dyaku dyakusumunaka, bukunadya amana losadya ku kyana yi ngeyi; bulungi kwena ngeyi wakota mu luzingu yi koku dimosi holo kulu dimosi, ka mboti ku ni wakala yi malu modi holo moku modi amana bakulosa ku mbawu ya mvula yi mvula. <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Amana yuka ni disu dyaku dyakusumunaka, lokuladya amana losadya ku kyana yi ngeyi; bulungi kwena ngeyi wakota mu luzingu lwakonda tsuka yi disu dimosi, ka mboti ku ni wakala kwaku yi mesu modi amana bakulosa ku bilungi.»<verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mukoku watota amana wamonika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>«Talenu, lulewulaku mosi wa bana bakhunda baba; mukuma yiluzimbwadi ni banzyo ba bawu muna mazilu bisi tala kosu tangwa mbunzu ya Tata wama wuna wenina mu mazilu. <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>[Mukuma Mwana wa mutu kisa hulula bana bátota.]<verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>«Abweti lwisi banza? Yukani mutu mosi kavwa mikoku khama, amana mosi muna kati dya myawu katota, kasísaku makumi vwa yi vwa muna mongu ndangu kenda sanda wuna wátota? <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Amana yuka ni kasengumunawa, mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi, kasángwala kikuma kya wawu kuluta makumi vwa yi vwa ma mina myakonda tota. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Phila mosi, lweku luzolu lwa Tata wenu wuna wenina muna mazilu, ni mosi mu kati dya baleki baba katota.»<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Buna phangi mosi kakuhanga mbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>«Yukani phangi waku kasumuka [kwena ngeyi], ndawenda, mumona, kalenu benu boodi lwesi. Yukani kakuyukila, wumunungini phangi waku. <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Kaasi yukani kayukiku, bonga hika mutu mosi kondilo boodi ha kimosi yi ngeyi, ndangu mu ndinga ya bambangi boodi kondilo batatu dyambu dyosu dyayilama." <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>Kaasi yukani kabwisa kubayukila, zimbula ku Dibundu; amana yuka ni kabwisa phi kuyukila Dibundu, kakala kikuma kya ngeyi hanga muphakanu yi kalaki ka phaku.<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>«Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi, moosu mana lwakása ha tsi makásama ku zilu, amana moosu mana lwakútumuna ha tsi makútumuka ku zilu.<verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>«Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi hika ni yuka boodi ha kati dya benu bayukana, ha tsi haha, mu kulomba kyosu kima, kyakina kabáheka Tata wama wenina mu mazilu. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Mukuma hana henina bodi holo batatu bakhundakana mu khumbu yama, meni yenina hana kati dya bawu.»<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya musadi mosi wisiku zola kulolula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Hanga buna kábwesuka Phetelu wumuzimbwadi: «Pfumu, mbala kwa pfwani kulolula kwena phangi wama yandu wuphangi mbi, amana yimúlolula tii yi kuna mbala tsambwadi?» <verse eid="MAT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadi: «Yikuzimbwadiku ni yi kuna mbala tsambwadi, kaasi yi kuna mbala makumi tsambwadi yi tsambwadi. <verse eid="MAT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>Ihana ni, Kipfumu kya mazilu kifwanakani yi kyamvu mosi wázola kutala mambu ma pfuka zandi kwena basadi bandi. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Amana buna káyandika mu kusalabwa, bisa munatina mosi wáfwana kufuta mafunda yi mafunda ma mbongu. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Bwosu kakalaku yi kima kya kufuta, pfumu wandi wáhana muswa ndangu bamutekisa yandi yi mukhetu wandi yi bana bandi yi bima byosu bina kákala byawu, ndangu bafuta pfuka yandi. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Musadi wábwa muna malu mandi amana wáfukama kuna thwala yandi mu kuzonza: "Sipha mbundu pfumu, kikuma kya meni, yikufuta pfuka yosu!" <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>Kiwayi kyámukwata pfumu wa musadi wuna, wámusula kenda amana wámuyambwadilaya pfuka. <verse eid="MAT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>Mu kulubuka, musadi wuna bátundakana yi mosi wa banduku ba kisalu wuna wafwana kumufuta mbongu za khunda. Musadi wámukwata, amana wáyandika mu kumukama hana dinga mu kuzimbula: "Futa pfuka yama!" <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>Hanga nduku wa kisalu wubwi muna malu mandi, kakala mubokwadila: "Sipha mbundu kikuma kya meni, yikufuta!" <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Kaasi yandi kázolaku; wenda mutimbula mu boloku, yi kuna kafútila pfuka yina. <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>Mu kumona mana mabwa, banduku bandi ba kisalu kyadi kyábakwata lawu; hanga bendi menika kwena pfumu wa bawu mosu mana máluta. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>Hanga pfumu wumutedisi amana wumuzimbwadi: "Musadi wa mbi! Yikuyambwadidiki pfuka yaku kikuma wumbokwadidiki; <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>wulungikiku, ngeyi phi kuyukila nduku waku wa kisalu kiwayi, bwosu yikuyukidiki phi ngeyi kiwayi?" <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Amana pfumu wandi, mu khabu, wámulambula mu boloku tii yi kuna kafútila byosu bina káfwana mu kufuta.»<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>«Yi bwabuna phi Tata wama wenina ku zilu kalúhanga yukani mosi-mosi wa benu kaloludiku kwena phangi wandi yi mbundu yandi yosu.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi kufwa kwa longu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mlk 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Tangwa kámanisa Yesu ndinga zazi, wákatuka ku Ngadidi amana wenda ku milambu mya Yuteya, kuna sambwa dikwawu dya Yolutani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Milumba-lumba mya batu lawu bámulanda, amana kwakuna, wábuka bambefu. <verse eid="MAT 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Amana ndambu ya Bafwadisi bábwesuka kwena yandi, mu kumuleya yi kumuhyula: «Yakala kenina yi muswa wa kuyambula mukhetu wandi mu kosu kikuma?» <verse eid="MAT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Amana yandi mu kuvutula, wuzimbudi: «Lwátangaku ni, "ku luyanduku, kábahanga mukhetu yi yakala", <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>amana kázimbula: "Ihana ni, yakala kasísa tata wandi yi ngudi wandi, amana kakhúndakana yi mukhetu wandi, amana bakítuka, bawu bodi, musuni wumosi". <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Ndangu bakálaku hika bodi, kaasi mutu mosi. Disongidila, kina kakasi Nzambi, mutu kahambulaku.» <verse eid="MAT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Bafwadisi bamuzimbwadini: «Kikuma kya biki Moyize káhanina muswa ni bahana, kwena mukhetu, mukanda wa kufwa kwa longu amana bamukula?» <verse eid="MAT 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Yandi wubazimbwadi: «Moyize, kikuma kya mbundu ya tadi yina lwenina yawu, káluhekila muswa wa kukula bakhetu benu; ku luyandiku, bwákalaku buna. <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Kaasi, yiluzimbwadibwa: wuna wayámbula mukhetu wandi, katula kusala kindumba, amana kakwela wa hika, mbongi katini.»<verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Balonguki bandi bámuzimbwala: «Yuka ni yi bwana dyenina dyambu dya yakala yi mukhetu, bulungi kakwelaku kwandi.» <verse eid="MAT 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Amana yandi wábazimbwala: «Boosu bafwaniyoku kutambwasa ndinga yayi, kaasi kwena bawu bana lwesi bahekaya! <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Mukuma henina yi bayakala bafwaniku kukwela kikuma bwabuna bábutuka, henina yi bakwawu bátyelabwa kwena batu, amana henina yi bakwawu bábwisa kukwela, kikuma kya Kipfumu kya mazilu. Wuna wufwani kutambwasa, katambwasa!»<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi bana bakhunda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mlk 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Hanga bamunatini bana, ndangu kabathetika moku amana kalombila kikuma kya bawu, kaasi balonguki bakala bakaya. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Amana Yesu wázimbula: «Yambulenu bana, lubakandisaku mu kukwisa kwena meni, mukuma Kipfumu kya mazilu kyenina kikuma kya bana benina hanga bawu.» <verse eid="MAT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Amana wábathetika moku, wákatuka hana.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi ngunza wa mvwama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mlk 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Hanga mutu mosi wisa bwesuka kwena yandi, wuzimbudi: «Mulongi, biki bya bukheti pfwani kuhanga mu kutambula luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula?» <verse eid="MAT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Amana yandi wumuzimbwadi: «Kikuma kya biki wungyufwadi mu mambu ma bukheti? Mosi lwesi wenina wa bukheti. Amana yuka ni wazola kukota mu luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula, lunda mitsiku.» <verse eid="MAT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Wumuhyudi: «Khi myawu?» Amana Yesu wuzimbudi: «Wahóndaku mvumbi wa khengu; watáku mbongi; wayíbaku; wahúnaku musamu; <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>zitisa tata waku yi ngudi waku; amana wazóla mukwenu khunda hanga ngeyi meni.» <verse eid="MAT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Ngunza wumuzimbwadi: «Mambu mana moosu, yisima zitisa, biki hika bikhondi?» <verse eid="MAT 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadi: «Yukani wuzodi wakala walungila, ndawenda, tekisa bima byaku, amana wahana mbongu kwena batsukami, amana wátambula kuvwa kumosi mu mazilu, kunima, nzawisa amana wandanda.» <verse eid="MAT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Amana mu kayuka, ngunza, ndinga yina, wenda yi kiwayi mukuma kimvwama kya lawu kakala kyawu.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Yesu wázimbula kwena balonguki bandi: «Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi: phasi bwenina kwena mvwama mosi mu kukota mu Kipfumu kya mazilu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Amana yiluzimbwadi hika: bweku phasi kwena kamela mu kulobuka ha hundu dya ndongu, kuluta mvwama mu kukota mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi.» <verse eid="MAT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Amana mu kuyuka bwabuna, balonguki báyituka lawu, bakala zimbula: «Nati si wufwani kuhuluka?» <verse eid="MAT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Amana Yesu buna kabatala, wubazimbwadi: «Mana misiku lendakana kwena batu, misi lendakana kwena Nzambi.» <verse eid="MAT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Hanga Phetelu wumuzimbwadi: «Tala betu, tusisi bima byetu byosu amana tulandi ngeyi. Abweti dyakála kikuma kya betu?» <verse eid="MAT 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Amana Yesu wábazimbwala: «Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadi: kwena benu lwisa ndanda: mu tsi ya pha, tangwa kazákala Mwana wa mutu hana kiti kyandi kya luyalu lwa khembu, benu phi lwakála bazakala muna biti kumi yi byodi bya luyalu mu kufundisa bikanda kumi yi byodi bya Kiseledi. <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Amana kosu mutu wuna wásisa nzu holo baphangi ba bayakala holo baphangi ba bakhetu, holo tata holo ngudi holo bana holo mafu kikuma kya khumbu ya meni, katámbula mbala khama kuluta amana kavwa luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Lawu bakála batheti, basúkinina amana lawu bakála batsuka, batékila.»<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya basadi mu kilanga kya vinu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>«Mukuma, Kipfumu kya mazilu kifwanakani hanga: mutu mosi, pfumu wa kilanga wálubuka muna suka-suka kusanda basadi kikuma kya kilanga kyandi kya vinu. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>Amana wáyukana yi basadi mu fwalanga dimosi muna kilumbu amana wábatuma mu kilanga kyandi kya vinu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>Wálubuka hika mu tangwa dya vwa dya suka, wumoni bahika bakala kuna zandu bakonda kisalu. <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>Kwena batu bana wuzimbudi: "Alwenda benu phi muna kilanga kya vinu, amana yiluheka lufutu luna lufwani." <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Bawu benda kwakuna. Wálubuka hika mu tangwa dya tsinzi, yi mu tangwa dya tatu dya masikidika, wusadi phila mosi. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Amana mu tangwa dya tanu dya masikidika, buna kálubuka, wáwana hika bakwawu bakala batelama hana, amana wubazimbwadi: "Kikuma kya biki luwheniki kilumbu kya muthu konda kisalu?" <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Bamuzimbwadini: "Kikuma heku mutu wutubongi mu kisalu." Yandi wubazimbwadi: "Ndenu lwenda benu phi mu kilanga kya vinu."<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>«Kuma buna kwáyila, pfumu wa kilanga kya vinu wuzimbudi kwena kaphita kandi: "Tela basadi amana wabafuta lufutu lwa bawu. Wayándikila kwena bana batsuka yi kuna kwa bana batheti." <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Amana buna bisa bana báyandika mu tangwa dya tanu dya masikidika, bátambula kosu mutu fwalanga dimosi. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Amana buna bisa bana batheti, bakala banza ni batámbula kuluta, kaasi batambudi, bawu phi, fwalanga dimosi kosu mutu. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Buna bátambula, báyandika mu kubokuta kikuma kya pfumu wa kilanga <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>yi kuzonzaka: "Baba bisiki batsuka, tangwa dimosi lwesi basadini, amana wubafuti kitesu kimosi yi betu tuhyombidi kilumbu kyosu yi mwini wutuwhidi!" <verse eid="MAT 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>Kaasi yandi mu kuvutula kwena mosi wa bawu, wuzimbudi: "Mukwetu, yikuhangiku mbi; tuyukanikiku yi meni kikuma kya fwalanga dimosi? <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Tambula kina kyenina kya ngeyi amana ndawenda. Yukani nzodi yihana, kwena wuna wenina watsuka, kitesu kimosi yi ngeyi, mana matadi meni-meni. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Yeku yi hamu dya kusadila mbongu zama bwosu nzodini? Kondilo kikudi-kudi wungyukidi kikuma kya buna yenina mutu wa mboti?" <verse eid="MAT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>Ihana ni, bátekila bakála batsuka amana batsuka bakála batheti.»<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuni hika mbala ya tatu lufwa yi lufutumuku lwandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mlk 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Bwosu kakala tombuka ku Yelusalemi, Yesu wábanata ku phungamu balonguki kumi yi bodi amana muna nzila, wubazimbwadi: <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>«Talenu, ku Yelusalemi tubati tombuka; Mwana wa mutu bamúlambula kwena mbuta wa banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku. Ndola ya lufwa bamúzengila <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>amana bamúlambula kwena baphani, ndangu bamuseya, bamuzyatula, bamukhoka hana kitakani. Amana mu kilumbu kya tatu, kafútumuka.»<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulomba kwa ngudi wa Zyaki yi Yowani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mlk 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Hanga ngudi wa bana ba Zebeteya wábwesuka kwena Yesu yi bana bandi ba bayakala amana wáfukama ndangu kamulomba kima kimosi. <verse eid="MAT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Amana yandi wumuzimbwadi: «Biki wuzodini?» Mukhetu wámuzimbwala: «Zonza ni bana bama baba bodi bazakala mosi kuna kitata kyaku, amana mosi ku kimama kyaku muna Kipfumu kyaku.» <verse eid="MAT 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Amana Yesu mu kuvutula, wuzimbudi: «Lwisiku zaya mambu mana lwisi lomba. Lwalénda kunwa mbungu yina yinwa meni?» Bawu bamuzimbwadini: «Twalenda.» <verse eid="MAT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Yandi wubazimbwadi: «Mbungu yama lwanwáya. Kaasi kuzakala ku kitata kyama yi ku kimama kyama, ka meni ku yihana muswa; kaasi bizika byenina kikuma kya babana kayidikilabya Tata wama.»<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Bakwawu bana kumi, ha báyuka bwabuna, hanga babayukidi khabu baphangi bana bawu bodi. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Amana Yesu wábatela boosu wubazimbwadi: «Luzayi ni malemba ma makanda bisi yala hana thandu ya batu hanga bapfumu, amana bambuta bisi songila kwena bakwawu hamu dya bawu. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Bwakálaku buna ha kati dya benu, kaasi wuna wazóla, ha kati dya benu, kukituka mbuta, kakála musadi wenu, <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>amana wuna wazóla kukala watheti mu kati dya benu kakala muhika wenu: <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Bwosu Mwana wa mutu, yandi kísaku ndangu bamusadila, kaasi kikuma kya kusadila yi kulambula luzingu lwandi mu phila ya kukatula batu balawu mu kihika.»<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubeludi baphofu bodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mlk 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Buna bálubuka mu Yediko, mulumba-lumba wa batu wámulanda. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Amana baphofu bodi bazakala kuna kabeta ka nzila, buna báyuka ni Yesu kakala luta, bákalunga mu kuzonza: «Tuyukila kyadi, Pfumu, Mwana wa Tavidi!» <verse eid="MAT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Amana mulumba-lumba wa batu wáyandika kubakandikisa ndangu badibata, kaasi bawu bákalunga hika ngolu: «Tuyukila kyadi, Pfumu, Mwana wa Tavidi!» <verse eid="MAT 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Amana Yesu buna kátelama, wábatela amana wábahyula: «Biki luzodi ni yilusadila?» <verse eid="MAT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Bamuzimbwadini: «Pfumu, mesu metu matemuka!» <verse eid="MAT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Amana yi kyadi kya lawu, Yesu wábasimba muna mesu; muna mbala mosi, báyandika kumona hika, amana bámulanda.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukoti mu Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Ywn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Tangwa bátula bela-bela yi Yelusalemi, amana bátula ku hata dya Betifasi, bela-bela yi mongu wa Olive, hanga Yesu wátuma balonguki bodi, <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>mu kubazimbwala: «Alwenda kuna hata dina dyenina ku thwala ya benu, amana lwawána ane wa kibuti wakuzitika yi mwana wa ane<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna bikalulu bya bikanda byahika, mbisi wuna ane bakala musadila hanga mbisi wuna wisi tikula mazitu. Kenina wakhunda kuluta baphunda bana bakodini. Bisi muzayila muna matu mandi ma kaleyi. Ane kenina kidimbu kya kudikulumuna kwa Masiya.</char></note> hakimosi yi yandi; bakutumunenu, amana bandatinenu. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Amana yuka ni mutu kaluzimbwala kima, zimbulenu: "Pfumu mupfunu kabavwini." Amana, muna mbala mosi, kabásula.»<verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Amana mambu mana mábwa ndangu dyalungila dyambu dina dyázonzama kwena mbikudi:<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>«Zimbulenu kwena mwana wa mukhetu wa Siyoni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Tala kyamvu waku wisi kwena ngeyi, wabasa yi ngemba, wazanza hana thandu ya ane wa kibuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">yi hana thandu ya mwana wa ane, mwana wa mbisi mosi.»<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Buna benda balonguki, báhanga phi bwosu kábalongila Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Bisa munata ane wa kibuti yi mwana wandi, amana hana tandu ya bawu, báthetika miledi mya bawu; amana Yesu wázakala hana thandu. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Amana mulumba-lumba wa batu bakala yala miledi mya bawu muna nzila; bahika bakala hawula mihandi ku miti yi kuyalakamya muna nzila. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Milumba-lumba mya batu bakala kwenda kuna thwala ya yandi amana bana bakala landa yi kukalungaka mu kuzimbula: «Ozana kwena Mwana wa Tavidi! Kasambuka wuna wisi kwisa mu khumbu ya Pfumu! Ozana kwena Nzambi muna bisoka!»<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Amana buna kakala kota mu Yelusalemi, mbanza yosu yánikana mu kuzimbula: «Nati kenina yandu?» <verse eid="MAT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Amana milumba-lumba mya batu bakala vutula: «Yandu kenina mbikudi Yesu, mwisi Nazaleti dya Ngadidi.»<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu muna nzu ya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mlk 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Ywn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Yesu wákota kuna nzu ya Nzambi, wákukwasa boosu bana bakala tekisa yi bana bakala sumba kuna nzu ya Nzambi, amana wámwanga mesa ma bakwa tsyenzya yi biti bya bateki ba baphombu. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>Amana wubazimbwadini: «Tala mana másonama: "Nzu yama batédikiya nzu ya bisambu." Kaasi benu, lukitudiya saka dya bandwandwa!»<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Baphofu yi bifwa malu bábwesuka kwena yandi muna nzu ya Nzambi. Amana wábabuka. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Kaasi bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku buna bámona mambu ma khumbwa mana kahanga, yi bana bakhunda buna bakala kalunga mu nzu ya Nzambi: «Ozana kwena Mwana wa Tavidi!» Hanga báfunga khabu <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>amana bamuzimbwadini: «Wubati yuka mana babati zonza bana baba?» Yesu wubazimbwadi: «Eeh. Lwátangaku kedi ndinga zazi: "Muna munwa mya bana bakhunda yi bana ba lubutu wádiyidikila lukumu?"» <verse eid="MAT 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Amana buna kábasisa, wálubuka mu mbanza, ndangu kenda ku hata dya Betaniya, wanimba kwakuna.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusingi miti wa fiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mlk 11:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Muna suka, mu kuvutuka ku mbanza, wáyuka nzala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Amana buna kámona miti wa fiki wumosi muna nzila, wábwesuka kwakuna; kaasi wuwani lwesi khaya; amana wázimbula kwena miti wa fiki: «Ka kibundu kimosi ku hika kyabútuka mwena ngeyi, mu kimakulu!» Amana muna tangwa meni dina, mufiki wáyumuka. <verse eid="MAT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Buna bámona bwabuna, balonguki báyituka lawu: Abweti miti wa fiki wawu wuyumukini mu mbala mosi? <verse eid="MAT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Amana mu kuvutula, Yesu wubazimbwadi: «Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi, honi lwakala yi lukwikilu, lwisiku banga phi, lwasalaku lwesi mana masalami ku miti wa fiki, kaasi lufwani phi kuzimbula kwena mongu wawu: "Kinduka hana, amana dilosa mu yanga dya mbuta", bwana bwahángama." <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Kyosu kina lwalómba mu lombilu yi lukwikilu, lwatámbulakya.»<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akweti disi tuka hamu dya Yesu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mlk 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Buna kákota mu nzu ya Nzambi, tangwa kakala longa, bapfumu ba banganga Nzambi yi bambuta ba Bayuta bisa muhyula: «Mu hamu dya nati wubati hangila mambu mana? Amana nati wákuheka hamu meni dina?» <verse eid="MAT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Amana mu kuvutula, Yesu wuzimbudi kwena bawu: «Meni phi yiluhyula kyufu kimosi lwesi; yukani lwamvútwala, yilúzimbwala keti mu hamu dya nati yisi sadila mambu mana. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Mbotika yina ya Yowani, ku zilu yátuka ho kwena batu?» Kaasi bawu bakala diwinina bawu yi bawu, yi kudizimbwalaka: «Yuka twazimbula: "Ya ku zilu", katúzimbwala: "Amana kikuma kya biki lwakonda sila lukwikilu mwena yandi?" <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Amana yuka twazimbula: "Kwena batu", tufwani kubanga mulumba-lumba wa batu, mukuma boosu bisi kwikila ni Yowani mbikudi kákala.» <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Amana mu kuvutula kwena Yesu, bazimbudi: «Tuzayiku.» Yandi phi wubavutwadi: «Meni phi yiluzimbwalaku keti mu hamu dya nati yisi sadila mambu mana.»<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya bana ba bayakala bodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>«Abweti lubanzi? Mutu mosi wákala yi bana ba bayakala bodi; hanga wubwesuki kwena wuna wa tsomi wuzimbudi: "Mwana awenda, lelu, wasala mu kilanga kya vinu." <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Amana yandi, mu kuvutula, wuzimbudi: "Nzodiku;" kaasi kunima wázosulula, wenda ku kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Amana buna kábwesuka kwena mukwawu, wuzimbudi phila mosi. Amana yandi mu kuvutula wuzimbudi: "Eeh, yikwenda, tata" kaasi kendaku ku kilanga. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Nati mu kati dya bawu boodi wásala luzolu lwa tata?» Bavutudi: «Watheti», Yesu wubazimbwadi: «Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi, bakalaki ka phaku yi bandumba balutekididi mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Mukuma Yowani kisa kwena benu mu kulusongila nzila ya masonga, amana benu lwámukwikilaku. Kaasi bakalaki ka phaku yi bandumba bámukwikila, amana keti buna nana lwámona mambu mana, lwázosululaku kwenu ndangu lwamukwikila.»<verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya basadi bambi ba kilanga kya vinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mlk 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>«Yukenu kingana kya hika: Mutu mosi wákala pfumu wa nzu wákuna kilanga kya vinu. Wukakikya mu luphangu, wáyidika kinyongi kya vinu muna kati, wátunga kinongi kikuma kya kutadikina vinu, kunima wáluwisakya kwena basadi ba vinu, amana wenda mu kitambu. <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Amana ha dyálungila tangwa dya bibundu, wátuma basadi bandi kwena basadi bana bákala mu kilanga kya vinu ndangu bamubongila ndambu yandi ya bibundu. <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Kaasi buna bábakwata basadi bandi kwena basadi bana bakala sala mu kilanga kya vinu; mosi bámubeta, mosi hika bámuhonda, amana mukwawu hika bámuzukwamina matadi. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Wáhitika hika basadi bakwawu kuluta thalu ya bana batheti, amana bábahanga hika phila mosi. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Amana ku tsuka, wábahitika mwana wandi wa yakala, yi kubanzaka: "Bamuzitisa mwana wama." <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Kaasi tangwa bámumona basadi bana bákala mu kilanga kya vinu, badizimbwadi bawu yi bawu: "Yandi kenina swana! Alwisenu, twamuhonda ndangu twabonga kuvwa kwandi!" <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Hanga bamukwati, bámutimbula ku phenza ya kilanga kya vinu amana bámuhonda.<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>«Amana tangwa kakwísa mukwa kilanga kya vinu, abweti kabáhanga basadi bana?» <verse eid="MAT 21:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Bamuvutwadini: «Batu bana bambi, kabáhonda konda kubayukila kyadi, amana kilanga kya vinu kalúwisakya kwena batu bahika, bana bamúheka bibundu muna tangwa dyandi.»<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Yesu wubazimbwadi: «Khaku kedi lutanga muna Masonuku:»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">"Tadi bálosa bana bakala tunga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">dyadyadi dikituki kisina kya mupfundila;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Dyambu dina dyátuka kwena Pfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">dyena dyambu dya kuyituka ku mesu ma betu!"<verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>«Ihana ni, yiluzimbwadi: Kipfumu kya Nzambi bálukatulakya amana báhanakya kwena kanda dya hika dina dyábutilakya bibundu. [ <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>Amana wosu wuna wabwa ha tadi dina katóluka; ha thandu ya wuna dyabwíla, dyamúnikumuna.]»<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Amana buna báyuka bwabuna mbuta wa banganga Nzambi yi bafwadisi bingana byandi, bábakisa ni kikuma kya bawu kakala zonzila. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Bakala sanda phila ya kumukwatisila, báyuka bweya bwa milumba-lumba mya batu, kikuma bakala mubongila hanga mbikudi.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mukinzi wa longu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Yesu wázonzila hika mu bingana; wuzimbudi: <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>«Kipfumu kya mazilu kifwanakani yi kyamvu mosi wáta mukinzi wa longu lwa mwana wandi wa yakala. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>Amana wátuma basadi bandi benda tela batu bana kátedisa ku mukinzi wa longu; kaasi bázolaku kukwisa. <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>Wátuma hika basadi bakwawu, mu kuzimbula: "Zimbulenu kwena bana thedisiki: Tala, ngidiki kedi madya mama, miluma mya bangombi yi bambisi bahika ba senga babahondi, byosu byayilama; alwisenu ku mukinzi wa longu!" <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Kaasi bawu bálewula, benda kwabawu, mosi wenda ku kilanga kyandi, mukwawu wenda ku kikhita kyandi; <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>amana bakwawu, bábakwata basadi bandi, bábatukwana, amana bábahonda. <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>Kyamvu wáyuka khabu: amana buna kátuma baphumbulu bandi, wáhondisa bandwandwa bana yi mbanza ya bawu phi wáyokisaya. <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Hanga wuzimbudi kwena basadi bandi: "Mukinzi wa longu wuyilami, kaasi batu babana bátedisa bákalaku kwatakani kikuma kya wawu. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Hangenu lwenda muna phambu za nzila, amana tedisenu, ku mukinzi wa longu, boosu bana lwawána." <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Buna bálubuka basadi bana mu nzila, bákutikisa batu boosu bana báwana, ba mbi yi ba mboti; nzu ya mukinzi yábasa yi batu. <verse eid="MAT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>Amana buna kákota kyamvu mu kutala batu bana kátedisa, wámona mwamuna mutu mosi wakonda vwata muledi wa mukinzi wa longu. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>Amana wumuzimbwadi: "Mukwetu, abweti wukotidi mwamu konda muledi wa mukinzi wa longu?" Kaasi yandi kámonaku kima kya kuvutula. <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>Hanga kyamvu wuzimbudi kwena basadi: "Mukasenu moku yi malu, amana mulosenu ku nzila kwena phipha; kwakuna kwakála bidilu yi makwenzi." <verse eid="MAT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>Mukuma balawu bátela, kaasi bakhunda básolama.»<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phaku ya Khayisala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mlk 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Hanga bafwadisi bendi kasa kifwandu, bamuleya ndangu bamukwatila mu ndinga. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Amana batumini balonguki ba bawu kwena yandi ha kimosi yi ndambu ya batu bana bakala landa Helodi, mu kuzimbula: «Mulongi, tuzayi ni kyedika wisi zonza ngeyi amana wisi longa nzila ya Nzambi mu masonga. Weku yi bweya bwa mambu mana bisi banza batu mukuma wisiku tala mbunzu za batu. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Tuzimbwaleti si buna wisi banza ngeyi: bulombi mu kufuta phaku ya Khayisala<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku kisina, Khayisala yákala khumbu ya mutu, kaasi ku manima báyandika kusadilaya hanga khumbu ya «mwata-yamvu», bwosu bazonzidiya haka: «mwata-yamvu wa Loma»</char></note> ho loni?» <verse eid="MAT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Kaasi Yesu, bwosu kázaya mabanza ma bawu ma mbi; wuzimbudi: «Kikuma kya biki lubati ndeyila, bakavungalosi? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Tsongilenu mbongu zina bisi futa phaku.» Bawu bámusongila fwalanga dimosi, <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>amana wábahyula: «Mbunzu yi khumbu yayi básonika haka, bya nati?» <verse eid="MAT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Bamuzimbwadini: «Bya Khayisala». Hanga wubazimbwadi: «Disongidila, hanenu mambu ma Khayisala kwena Khayisala, amana mambu ma Nzambi kwena Nzambi.» <verse eid="MAT 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Buna báyuka bwabuna, báyituka, amana bámusisa, benda kwa bawu.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyufu kimosi kikuma kya lufutumuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mlk 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Muna kilumbu meni kina, ndambu ya Basadise, bana bisi zimbula ni kweku lufutumuku, bábwesuka kwena yandi, amana bámuhyula <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>mu kuzimbula: «Mulongi, Moyize kázimbula: "Yuka ni mutu mosi kafwa konda kubuta mwana, myaki wandi kafweti kwela mufwidi ndangu katombula kikanda kya phangi wandi." <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Kinga, kwákala kwena betu, yi baphangi ba bayakala tsambwadi; amana watheti wákwela, wáfwa; amana konda kusisa dibuta, wásisa mufwidi wandi kwena myaki wandi. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Busalami phila mosi kwena wuna wazodi, yi watatu, yi kuna kwa wuna watsambwadi. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Amana kunima dya bawu boosu, mukhetu wáfwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Mu kilumbu kya lufutumuku, mukhetu wa nani kakala, ha kati dya bawu tsambwadi? Mukuma boosu bámukwela!» <verse eid="MAT 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Amana mu kuvutula, Yesu wubazimbwadi: «Luditotisi kikuma lwisiku bakisa keti Masonuku keti ngolu za Nzambi. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Mukuma, ku lufutumuku lwa bafwa kwakálaku yi bayakala keti bakhetu bakwélana, kaasi bakala hanga banzyo mu zilu. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Amana kikuma kya lufutumuku lwa bafwa, lwátangaku mana báluzimbwala kwena Nzambi: <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>"Meni yena Nzambi wa Bulahami yi Nzambi wa Yizaki yi Nzambi wa Yakobi"? Keku Nzambi wa bafwa kaasi wa bana ba moya.» <verse eid="MAT 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Amana buna báyuka bwana, milumba-lumba mya batu báyituka lawu ku malongi mandi.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutsiku wuluti mupfunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mlk 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Buna báyuka Bafwadisi ni Yesu wábatsukisa Basadise, bákutakana. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Amana mosi hana kati dya bawu, mulongi wa mitsiku, kakala muleya mu kumuhyula: <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>«Mulongi, khi wawu mutsiku wa mbuta mu mitsiku?»<verse eid="MAT 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Yandi wumuvutwadi: «"Watónda Pfumu Nzambi waku yi mbundu yaku yosu, yi moya waku wosu yi ngangu zaku zoosu." <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Wawu wenina mutsiku wa mbuta yi watheti. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Amana mutsiku wa zodi, phila mosi yi wuna wa theti: "Tonda khunda waku hanga ngeyi meni." <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Mitsiku myami myodi mivungi mitsiku yi Bambikudi.»<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kidisitu yi Tavidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mlk 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Bwosu bákutakana Bafwadisi, Yesu wábahyula <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>mu kuzimbula: «Biki lwisi banza kikuma kya Kidisitu? Mwana wa nati kenina?» Bamuvutwadini: «Wa Tavidi.» <verse eid="MAT 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Yandi wubazimbwadi: «Abweti si Tavidi, mu Kitembu kisi mutela ni Pfumu, tangwa kisi zimbula:»<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>"Pfumu kázimbula kwena Pfumu wama":</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Sikuka ku kitata kyama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">yi kuna yibásila bambeni baku ku sina dya bitambi byaku."<verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>«Disonga yuka ni Tavidi kisi mutela "Pfumu", abweti kakadila mwana wandi?» <verse eid="MAT 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Amana ka mutu ku walenda kumuvutwala ndinga mosi. Tuka kilumbu meni kina, ka mutu ku wámeka hika kumuhyula kyufu.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubalukisi kikuma kya balongi ba mitsiku yi Bafwadisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mlk 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luk 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Hanga Yesu wázonza kwena milumba-lumba mya batu yi kwena balonguki bandi <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>mu kuzimbula: «Balongi ba mitsiku yi Bafwadisi badizakadisi ha kiti kya Moyize.<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malongi mana ma bayuta makalaku ma kusonika mu mikanda, makala samuna: «Moyize katambula mitsiku mya Sinayi amana wahanamya kwena Yoswa, Yoswa wahanamya kwena bambuta, bambuta bahanamya kwena bambikudi; amana bambikudi bahanamya kwena batu ba nzu ya kimvuka ya bayuta.» </char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Disongidila ni, mambu moosu mana balúzimbwala, salenu, swekenu phi, kaasi benu luhangaku mihangu mya bawu. Mukuma bisi zonza kaasi bisiku sadila. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Amana bisi wongika miteti mya zitu, myena yi phasi mu kunata, mu mahembu ma batu; kaasi bawu meni bisiku zola kuningisa keti ku mulembu. <verse eid="MAT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>Amana bisalu bya bawu byosu, bisi sala, ndangu badimonikisaka kwena batu. Ihana ni, bisi nata biphakala bya mbuta bya mavwelesi hana mbunzu yi muna moku ma bawu yi miledi mya mbuta amana baleyisi yi misinga. <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Amana bazodi kuzakala mu bifulu bya theti mu mikinzi yi bifulu bya theti mu nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta; <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>yi mboti mu mazandu, yi kubatelaka kwena batu ni "Mulongi." <verse eid="MAT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>Kaasi benu, luzolaku ni balutela "Mulongi", mukuma mosi lwesi wena mulongi wenu, amana benu, benu boosu lwena baphangi. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Lutelaku mutu, ha tsi haha, ni "Tata", mukuma mosi lwesi wena tata wenu, Tata wa ku zilu. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>Luzolukaku ni balutela "Mutwadisi", mukuma mosi lwesi wena Mutwadisi wenu Kidisitu. <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Amana mbuta mu kati dya benu kakala musadi wenu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Wuna wadítombula yandi meni, bamúkulumuna amana wuna wadíkulumuna yandi meni, bamútombula.»<verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutunguludi bukavungalosi bwa balongi ba mitsiku yi bwa Bafwadisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mlk 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-52">Luk 11:39-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>«Amana khi kyadi kwena benu, balongi ba mitsiku yi Bafwadisi, bakavungalosi! Kikuma lwisi yafikila kyafulu kya Kipfumu kya mazilu ku thwala ya batu; amana lwisimwoku kota benu-benu, lwisiku bayambula phi mu kukota babana bazola kukota.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 23:13">[<verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>«Khi kyadi kwena benu, balongi ba mitsiku yi Bafwadisi, bakavungalosi! Mukuma lwisi botula kwena bafwidi bima bya bawu amana, mu kudihunikisa, lwisi sala malombilu ma kaleyi; kikuma kya bwabuna, lwatámbula pfundusu mosi yiluti kitesu.]<verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>«Khi kyadi kwena benu, balongi ba mitsiku yi Bafwadisi, bakavungalosi! Kikuma lwisi kangala muna yanga dya mbuta yi muna tsi ndangu lwakotisa muphakanu mosi ku dingumba dyenu, amana buna lwamúnunga, lumukitudi mutu mosi wa bilungi mbala zodi kuluta benu.<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>«Khi kyadi kwena benu bathwadisi baphofu, lwisi zimbula: "Honi mutu kadya ndefi mu khumbu ya nzu ya Nzambi, ka kima ku; kaasi yuka ni mutu kadya ndefi mu wolu dina dyenina mu nzu ya Nzambi, kafweti lungisa ndefi yandi." <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Bilawu yi baphofu! Biki biluti mupfunu, wolu ho nzu ya Nzambi yina yisi sakumuna wolu? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Amana lwisi zimbula hika: "Honi mutu kadya ndefi mu khumbu ya mesa ma kimenga, ka kima ku; kaasi yuka ni mutu mosi kadya ndefi mu khumbu ya kabu dina dyenina ha mesa ma kimenga, kafweti lungisa ndefi yandi." <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Baphofu! Amana biki biluti mupfunu, kabu ho mesa ma kimenga mana misi sakumuna kabu? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Disongidila, wuna wisi dya ndefi mu khumbu ya mesa ma kimenga kisiya dya mu khumbu ya mesa ma kimenga yi mu khumbu ya bima byosu byenina hana thandu; <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>amana wuna wisi dya ndefi mu khumbu ya nzu ya Nzambi, kisiya dya mu khumbu ya nzu ya Nzambi yi mu khumbu ya wuna wisimwa kala. <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>Amana wuna wisi dya ndefi mu khumbu ya zilu, kisiya dya mu khumbu ya kiti kya luyalu kya Nzambi yi mu khumbu ya wuna wenina hana wazakala.<verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>«Khi kyadi kwena benu, balongi ba mitsiku yi bafwadisi, bakavungalosi! Kikuma lwisi hana kimosi kya kumi<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lwisi hana kwena Nzambi kimosi kya kumi kya khaya za bilumbwadi bina byisi yidika bisaka. Bilumbwadi bina lwisi kuna, «katsangwa, malumba-lumba, mamvumbi-mvumbi, kikaya-kaya.» </char></note> kya khaya za tsudi ya kitoku yi bithundu yi miti mya kitoku, kaasi lusisi bima bya mupfunu mu mitsiku: kusungama, khenda yi lukwikilu; byabina biluti mboti mu kusala, konda kusisa bina bisadi. <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Bathwadisi baphofu, lwisi kenza malafu mu kukatula biyingayinga kaasi lwisi mina Kamela wa muthu!<verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>«Khi kyadi kwena benu, balongi ba mitsiku yi bafwadisi, bakavungalosi! Kikuma lwisi semisa phenza ya kopha yi dilonga, amana mu kati bya kabasi yi bima bina lwisi yiba yi kukonda kwa kusipha kwa mbundu. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Mufwadisi phofu! Semisa theti kati dya kopha ndangu phenza yandi phi yasema.<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>«Khi kyadi kwena benu, balongi ba mitsiku yi Bafwadisi, bakavungalosi! Kikuma lufwanani yi mazyamu basiti phemba mabati monika kitoku ku phenza, kaasi mu kati mabasa yi mifufwa mya bamvumbi yi bima byosu bya mvindu. <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Phila mosi phi yi benu, lwisi monika batu ba masonga kwena batu, kaasi mu kati lwabasa yi mvunga yi mambu mambi.<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>«Khi kyadi kwena benu, balongi ba mitsiku yi Bafwadisi, bakavungalosi! Lwisi tunga mazyamu ma bambikudi, yi kunenga mazyamu ma batu ba masonga, <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>amana lwisi zimbula: "Wadi betu phi twazingila mu tangwa dya batata betu, wadi twakanaku kala mu kithwadi kya mbi yi bawu kikuma kya kunokisa menga ma bambikudi." <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Abwabuna lwisi ta kimbangi kwena benu-benu ni lwenina bana ba batu bana báhonda bambikudi. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Amana benu, landenu, manisenu mana báyandika batata benu! <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>Banyoka, mbandu ya masawa! Abweti lubati banza kutina kyana pfundusu ya bilungi? <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Ihana ni tala meni phitiki kwena benu bambikudi yi batu ba nduka yi balongi ba mitsiku. Muna kati dya bawu, bahika, lwabáhonda amana lwabákhoka ha kitakani, bakwawu hika, lwabázyatula muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta zenu amana bakwawu hika phi, lwabányokuniki mbanza muna mbanza; <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>ndangu yalubwila mbesi ya menga moosu ma batu ba masonga mana mátyakana ha tsi tukidila ku menga ma Abelu mutu wa masonga yi kuna menga ma Zakadiya, mwana wa yakala wa Balakiya, wuna lwáhonda ha kati dya nzu ya Nzambi yi mesa ma kimenga. <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadi: mambu mana moosu mabwíla kwena batu ba mbandu yayi.»<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>«Yelusalemi, Yesulusalemi, ngeyi wisi honda bambikudi yi kubatimbwala matadi bana bisi kutumina! Mbala kwa nzodi kedi kukutikisa bana baku bwosu kisi kutikisa, ngudi wa khoku, bana bandi ku tsi ya mahela mandi, kaasi lwázolabwoku. <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Tala buthwena, balúyambwadidiya nzu yenu, yakítuka zumbu! <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Mukuma, yiluzimbwadi, mu kyedika: Tuka lelu dyadi lwambónaku hika tii yi kuna lwazímbwala: "Kasakumuka wuna wukwisila mu khumbu ya Pfumu!"»<verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuni kubulumuka kwa nzu ya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mlk 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Mu kulubuka kwa Yesu mu nzu ya Nzambi, balonguki bandi bábwesuka ndangu bamusongila thungidi ya nzu ya Nzambi. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Amana yandi mu kubavutwala, wuzimbudi: «Lwisibyoku tala bima byabi byosu? Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi, hasálaku keti tadi dimosi ha thandu ya tadi dikwawu dyakonda wulumuka.»<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phasi yi minyanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mlk 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Amana buna kázakala yandi hana mongu wuna bisi tela ni mongu wa Olive, balonguki bábwesuka kwena yandi, mu kingenga bazimbudi: «Tuzimbwala khi tangwa makála mambu mana amana khi kidimbu kyasóngila ngisilu yaku yi tsuka ya tsi?» <verse eid="MAT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Amana mu kubavutwala, Yesu wuzimbudi: «Kebenu, ka mutu ku kalutotisa! <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Kikuma lawu bakwísa mu khumbu ya meni, mu kuzimbula: "Meni yenina Kidisitu" amana lawu babátotisa. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Amana lwayúka kuzonzila mvita yi pfweta-pfweta za mvita: talenu, lukalaku mu bidilu; mukuma mboti mambu mana masalama, kaasi yakálaku kedi tsuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Mukuma tsi yimosi yanwánisa tsi yikwawu, amana kipfumu kimosi kyanwánisa kipfumu kikwawu; amana nzala yi kunikana kwa mafu byakála muma mwahika. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Amana mambu mana moosu makála hanga misongu mya theti. <verse eid="MAT 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>Hanga balulambudi ku kiwayi amana balúhonda amana balúmenga muna makanda moosu kikuma kya khumbu ya meni. <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, kyakála kisinza kikuma kya batu balawu, amana bamosi badílambula bawu yi bawu, amana bahika badímenga bawu yi bawu. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Amana bambikudi ba bukamvi lawu batélama, bahukumuna batu balawu. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Kikuma kya mambu mambi mana ma lawu; lungongu lwa batu balawu lwakúlumuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>Kaasi wuna wakwámina tii yi kuna tsuka, yandi kahúluka. <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>Musamu wa Bukheti wawu wa Kipfumu kya mazilu basámunawa muna tsi yosu yina bisi zingila, kyakála kimbangi kikuma kya makanda moosu, hanga tsuka yisi.»<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiwayi kya lawu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mlk 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>«Tangwa lwamóna muzangi wanzanzi wakutelamisa muna kizika kyahedila, bwosu kázonza mbikudi Tanyela, mutu wuna wubati tanga kabakula! <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>Hanga bana bakala mu kinzunga kya Yuteya batini muna myongu; <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>wuna wakála ha thandu ya mudilu, katulukaku kikuma kya kulubula bima mu nzu yandi; <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>amana wuna wakala mu kilanga kavutukaku kikuma kya kubonga muledi wandi. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Khi kyadi kwena mukhetu wuna wakala ku vumu yi kwena wuna wakala yemika muna bilumbu meni bina! <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Lombilenu ndangu lutinaku mu tangwa dya kyosi kya lawu, keti mu kilumbu kya sabata! <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Mukuma, kiwayi kya lawu kyakála, hanga kina kyakonda kedi kala tuka ku luyandiku lwa tsi yi buthwena bwabu, amana zakálaku hika. <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Wadi ni bilumbu bina byákalaku bya khufi, wadi keti mutu káhulukaku, kaasi kikuma kya bana básolama bákhufikisilabya bilumbu bina. <verse eid="MAT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>Yuka ni mutu kaluzimbwala: "Kidisitu haha kenina!" Holo: "Kuna kenina!" Lukwikilaku. <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Mukuma bamasiya<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bamasiya ba bukamvi babati zonzila batu bana bisi zimbula ni bawu benina Kidisitu kaasi benina bwoku. </char></note> ba bukamvi yi bambikudi ba bukamvi balúbuka; basóngila biphadi yi mambu ma kuyituka mukuma, yuka bwalendakana, bahúkumuna keti bana kásola Nzambi. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Tala buna thekidi luzimbwala.<verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>«Disongidila yuka ni baluzimbwala: "Talenu, mu nganga kenina, lulubukaku; holo, talenu ku suku kenina, lukwikilaku. <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Kikuma bwosu wisi lubuka mutsyenzya tuka ku malubwakidi amana wukenzudi yi kuna mazyokidi, bwabuna kwakála kukwisa kwa Mwana wa mutu. <verse eid="MAT 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>Kuna kwakála kivundisila, kwakuna bakútakanina bangandwanganga.»<verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwisa kwa Mwana wa mutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mlk 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>«Hanga kunima dya bilumbu bina bya kiwayi, tangwa kaphínda, ngondi kaséngulaku myesi myandi, bathetimbwa babwa tukidila ku zilu, amana ngolu za mazilu zaníkana. <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>Hanga kidimbu kya Mwana wa mutu kimoniki muna zilu; amana bikanda byosu bya tsi mu khondu byakála, bamóna Mwana wa mutu buna kakwísa hana matuti ma zilu yi ngolu yi khembu ya lawu. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>Katúma banzyo bandi yi phungi ya mbuta, amana bakútikisa batu ba tselu ya bana kásola tukidila tselu ya tsi yi tselu ya zilu.»<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mufiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mlk 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>«Mbandu ya kingana kya mufiki yaluheka dilongi: tangwa lwamóna ni miti wusawakidini, zayenu ni tsungi ya pha yibwesukini. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Phila mosi yi kwena benu, tangwa lwamóna bima bina byosu, zayenu ni Mwana wa mutu wekina mu kukwisa. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi: mbandu yayi, yahítaku kedi yi kuna masálamina mambu mana moosu. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Zilu yi tsi byatóta, kaasi ndinga zama zalendaku tota.»<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzambi lwesi wuzayi tangwa dya tsuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mlk 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:26-30">Luk 21:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:34-36">21:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>«Kikuma kya kilumbu meni kina yi tangwa, ka mutu ku wuzayibya, keti banzyo muna mazilu, keti Mwana; kaasi Tata yandi hika. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>Mukuma bwosu bwákala mu tangwa dya Nowa, yibwana phi bwakála mu kukwisa kwa Mwana wa mutu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Amana bwosu bwákala muna bilumbu meni bina byátekila kithombu, batu bakala dya yi kunwa, bakala kwelana yi kukwedisa, tii yi kuna kilumbu kina kákota Nowa mu nzasa; <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>amana bakalaku bakula kima tii yi kuna kyisila kithombu amana kinati byosu, yibwabuna phi bwakála mu kukwisa kwa Mwana wa mutu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>Hanga batu bodi bakála muna kilanga: mosi batámbula amana mosi bamúsisa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Bakhetu bodi bakala toka muna yanda, mosi bamúnata, mukwawu bamúsisa. <verse eid="MAT 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>Disongidila kalenu batemuna, mukuma luzayiku keti khi kilumbu kakwísa Pfumu wenu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Amana zayenu bwabu: Wadi mukwa nzu kazayaka tangwa dina kakwisa mwifi, kakhanaku nimba amana kakhanaku yambwadila ni kalungula nzu yandi. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Yihana ni, kalenu bayilama, benu phi, mukuma Mwana wa mutu kakwísa muna tangwa dina lukondi yindula benu.»<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya musadi wa kwikama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>«Nati si musadi wakwikama yi wa ngangu? Wuna káheka mukwa nzu kiyeka kya basadi bahika ndangu kabahekaka kudya muna tangwa dina difwani? <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>Kyesi kwena musadi wuna, buna kakwísa mukwa nzu, kamuwana bwabuna mu kisalu! <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadibwa: kamúheka kiyeka kya bima byandi byosu. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Kaasi yuka ni yandina kakala musadi wa mbi amana kadibanzila muna mbundu yandi: "Pfumu wama kalengaku kwisa," <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>kayandika kubabeta banduku ba kisalu, amana kadyaka, kanwaka phi kumosi yi babana bisi zela malafu, <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>kyedika mukwa nzu wuna katúla muna kilumbu kimosi kina kakalaku wayilama musadi wuna yi mu tangwa dina kakondiku zaya; <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>kamúheka ndola ya mbuta amana kámusya mu ndonga ya bakavungalosi, kuna kwakala bidilu yi makwenzi.»<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya bana ba bandumba kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>«Kinga Kipfumu kya mazilu kifwanani yi bana ba bandumba kumi bábonga mwinda mya bawu, benda tundakana yi yakala dya longu. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Batanu, hana kati dya bawu, báyilamaku amana batanu bahika báyilama. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Bana bakonda yilama, buna bábonga mwinda mya bawu, bánataku masi ma bawu. <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>Kaasi batanu bana bayilama bánata masi muna bilekwa yi mwinda mya bawu. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Bwosu kázingidila yakala mu kukwisa, boosu bahanga balembwi kwabawu amana bánimba. <verse eid="MAT 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>Amana mu kisuku kya phipha, kindanda kiditi: "Talenu yandu yakala, lubukenu, lwenda mutundakana!" <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>Hanga bandumba bana boosu batokami, amana báyidika mwinda mya bawu. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Hanga bana bakonda yilama bazimbudi kwena bana báyilama: "Tuhekenu masi menu, kikuma mwinda mya betu mizimi." <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Bana ba mayedi bavutudi: "Loni, meku mafwana kikuma kya betu yi benu; mboti lwenda kwena bana bisima tekisa ndangu lwasumba kikuma kya benu." <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Bwabuna benda bawu mu kusumba, yakala wátula. Amana bana bakala bayilama bakota yi yandi muna nzu ya mukinzi wa longu, hanga bayafikidi mwelu. <verse eid="MAT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>Amana kunima dya tangwa, bisa bandumba bana bakwawu, mu kuzimbula: "Tata, Tata, tuyafwadila!" <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>Kaasi yandi mu kuvutula, wuzimbudi: "Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi: Yiluzayiku." <verse eid="MAT 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>Disongidila, kalakenu bayilama, kikuma luzayiku keti kilumbu keti tangwa.»<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya basadi batatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>«Kipfumu kya mazilu kifwanakani hanga mutu mosi, mu kukwenda mu kitambu: watéla basadi bandi amana wábaheka bima byandi. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>Kwena mosi, mikuta mitanu mya wolu, kwena mukwawu, mikuta myodi mya wolu, amana kwena wuna wa tatu mukuta wumosi, kwena kosu mutu muna ngolu zandi, amana kunima, wenda kwandi mu kitambu. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Buna kenda, musadi wuna wábonga mikuta mitanu, wásadilamya amana wálumbula mitanu myahika. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Phila mosi yi wuna wábonga mikuta myodi, wálumbula myodi myahika. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Kaasi wuna wátambula mukuta wumosi wenda wawu, wásima muna mafu amana wázikawa mukuta wa wolu wa pfumu wandi.<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>«Amana kunima dya tangwa dya lawu, pfumu wa basadi bana wisa, hanga wubatedi ndangu kazaya mutindu wuna básadiladya wolu. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Amana buna kábwesuka wuna wátambula mikuta mitanu, wusongidi hika mitanu mikwawu mu kuzimbula: "Pfumu, mikuta mitanu wápheka, tala mitanu mikwawu ndumbudi." <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>Pfumu wandi wumuzimbwadi: "Bwa bukheti! Ngeyi wenina musadi wa bukheti yi wa bulemvu. Muna bima bya khunda wukadiki mulemvu, yikúyadika ha thandu ya bima bya lawu, kota mu kyesi kya pfumu waku." <verse eid="MAT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>Buna kábwesuka wuna wátambula mikuta myodi wuzimbudi: "Pfumu, mikuta myodi wápheka, tala, mikwawu myodi mina ndumbudi!" <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>Pfumu wandi wumuzimbwadi: "Bwa bukheti! Musadi wa bukheti yi wa bulemvu, mu bima bya khunda, wisi dikadila wa bulemvu, yikúyadika ha thandu ya bima bya lawu; kota mu kyesi kya pfumu waku. <verse eid="MAT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>Amana buna kábwesuka wuna wátambula mukuta wumosi, wuzimbudi: "Tata, bwosu yikuzaya ni ngeyi mukwa mathata, wisi hela muna wakonda kunina, amana wisi wongika hana wakonda mwanga; <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>amana mu kubanga, yihanga, tswekiwa mukuta waku mu mafu; tala wawu mukuta waku." <verse eid="MAT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>Amana pfumu wandi wumuvutwadini: "Musadi wambi, mubolu! Wázayabwa ni yisi hela muna yikonda kunina, yisi wongika muna yikonda mwanga? <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Wadi wakala kwenda sikula mukuta wa wolu dyama kwena bana bisi sala ku banki, amana mu kuvutuka kwama, khadi tambula bina byenina bya meni yi muluta. <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Disongidila ni mutambulenu mukuta wuna wa wolu amana hanenu kwena wuna wenina myawu kumi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Mukuma bahána kwena wuna wenina kyawu, ndangu kakala yi bima bya lawu, kaasi kwena wuna wukondi kima, bamútambula keti kina kenina kyawu. <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Amana musadi wuna wakonda mupfunu, mulosenu ku phenza, muna phipha ya ku phenza; kwakuna kwakala bidilu yi makwenzi."»<verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pfundusu ya tsuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>«Tangwa kakwísa Mwana wa mutu mu khembu yandi yi banzyo boosu ha kimosi yi yandi, hanga wuzakadi hana kiti kyandi kya khembu. <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>Makanda moosu makhúndakana kuna thwala ya yandi, amana kabáhambula bamosi yi bakwawu, bwosu kisi hambula kalema mikoku yi bakhombu: <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>hanga wulongiki mikoku kuna koku dyandi dya kitata, amana bakhombu kuna koku dyandi dya kimama. <verse eid="MAT 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>Hanga kyamvu wuzimbudi kwena bana bakála ku koku dyandi dya kitata: "Alwisa, benu kásambula Tata wama, tambulenu Kipfumu kya mazilu kina báluyidikila tukila buna káhanga tsi. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Mukuma, yíkala yi nzala, benu lwápheka bya kudya; yíkala yi kihwinya, benu lwápheka bya kunwa; yíkala munzenza amana benu lwángyamba; <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>yíkala khonga, benu lwámvwatisa; yikala bela, benu lwátsadisa; yíkala mu boloku, amana lwisa thala." <verse eid="MAT 25:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>Amana batu ba masonga bamúvutwala mu kuzimbula: "Pfumu, khi tangwa twákumona ngeyi wákala yi nzala, amana twákuheka bya kudya, holo wákala yi kihwinya, twákuheka bya kunwa? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Khi tangwa twákumona, wákala munzenza amana twákuyamba, holo wákala khonga amana twákuvwatisa? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Amana khi tangwa twákumona wakala bela holo mu boloku, amana thwisa kutala?" <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Kyamvu kabávutwala: "Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadi: mbala zoosu zina lwásalabwa kwena mosi wa baphangi bama baba benina bakhunda, kwena meni lwásalabwa!"<verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>«Hanga wuzimbudi hika kwena bana bakala ku koku dyandi dya kimama: "Katukenu haha, batu basingama! Alwenda kuna mbawu ya mvula yi mvula yina báyidika kikuma kya kiphidi-mutu yi banzyo bandi. <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Mukuma, yíkala yi nzala kaasi lwáphekaku bya kudya, yíkala yi kihwinya kaasi lwáphekaku bya kunwa; <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>yíkala munzenza kaasi lwángyambaku; yíkala khonga kaasi lwámvwatisaku; yíkala wabela yi mu boloku kaasi lwáthalaku." <verse eid="MAT 25:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>Hanga bawu phi bavutudi mu kuzimbula: "Pfumu, khi tangwa si twákumona ngeyi wákala yi nzala holo wákala yi kihwinya, holo munzenza, holo kikhonga, holo wabela, holo mu boloku amana twakonda kusadisa?" <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Hanga wubavutwadi mu kuzonza: "Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadibwa, mbala zoosu zina lwásadilabwoku kwena mosi wa baleki baba, lwásalabwoku phi kwena meni." <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>Amana baba bákwenda ku ndola ya mvula yi mvula, kaasi batu ba masonga, mu luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula.»<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamukasidi kifwandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Ywn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Tangwa kámanisa Yesu ndinga zazi zoosu, wuzimbudi kwena balonguki bandi: <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>«Luzayi ni kunima bilumbu byodi mukinzi wa phaki wakála: amana Mwana wa mutu bamúlambula ndangu bamukhoka ha kitakani.»<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Hanga bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi bambuta ba Bayuta bakutakani muna kyanzala kya mbuta wa banganga Nzambi, wuna bakala tela ni Khayifu; <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>Bakasi kifwandu kya kumukwatisa Yesu mu kitsweki yi kumuhondisa. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Bakala zimbula: «Heku ni mu tangwa dya mukinzi, ndangu mvwalangani yikalaku ha kati dya batu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamusiti mananasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mlk 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Ywn 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Yesu ku Betaniya kákala, muna nzu ya Simoni mukwa bwasi, <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>mukhetu mosi wisa bwesuka kwena Yesu, kákala yi mulangi wa mananasi ma thalu ya lawu amana wázunzilama hana mutwa wa yandi bwabuna kákala kuna mesa. <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Amana balonguki buna bámona bwabuna, bámonaku kyesi, hanga bazimbudini: «Kikuma kya biki kuzanga kwa bwabu? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Bufwaniki basumbisama mu thalu ya lawu, amana mbongu bahanaza kwena batsukami!»<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Kaasi Yesu buna kábakulabwa, wubazimbwadi: «Kikuma kya biki lubati muhekila phasi mukhetu yandu? Mukuma dyambu dya kitoku kasadi kwena meni; <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>mukuma batsukami lwakádiki bawu kosu tangwa, kaasi meni twakádikiku yenu kosu tangwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Yandi kanzunzidi mananasi mama mu lutu, ndangu katekila yidika kuzika kwama. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadi: kuna basámuna Musamu wa Bukheti wawu, mu tsi yosu, baménikiki phi mambu mama kasadi yandu, kikuma kya kumubambuka yandi.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yutasi wumulambudi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mlk 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Hanga mosi wa bawu kumi yi bodi, wuna bakala tela ni Yutasi Sikadyoti, wendi kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>wuzimbudi: «Biki luzodi kupheka, amana meni yilulambwala yandi?» Hanga bawu bamufuti makuta makumatatu. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Amana tuka tangwa meni dina, kakala sanda tangwa dya mboti ndangu kamulambula Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudini mukinzi wa Phaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mlk 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22:7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Ywn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Mu kilumbu kya theti kya mukinzi wa mapha makonda kisi dya muvimbu, balonguki bábwesuka kwena Yesu mu kuzimbula: «Ku biki wuzodi ni twakuyidikila madya ma mukinzi wa Phaki?» <verse eid="MAT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Hanga yandi wuzimbudini: «Alwenda muna mbanza kwena mutu mosi, amana muzimbwalenu: "Mulongi kazimbudini: Tangwa dyama dibwesukini; ku nzu ya ngeyi yidila madya ma Phaki yi balonguki bama."» <verse eid="MAT 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Balonguki báhanga bwosu kabalongikila Yesu, amana báyidika madya ma Phaki.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Masikidika ha mábwa, ku mesa kákala yi bawu kumi yi bodi. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Amana buna bákala mu kudya, yandi wuzimbudi: «Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadi: mosi mu kati dya benu kandámbula.» <verse eid="MAT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Hanga báyuki kiwayi kya lawu, báyandika kumuhyula mosi kunima mukwawu: «Ka meni ku, Pfumu, kabwaku?» <verse eid="MAT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Yandi, mu kuvutula, wuzimbudi: «Wuna wuvundiki koku ha longa dimosi yi meni, yandi wuna wandámbula. <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Mwana wa mutu kabati kwenda, tala mana másonama kikuma kya yandi; kaasi khi kyadi kwena mutu wuna wulambudi Mwana wa mutu! Bwálunga ni mutu wuna kabutukaku kwandi!» <verse eid="MAT 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Amana mu kuvutula, Yutasi, wuna wámulambula wuzimbudi: «Ka meni ku, Mulongi, kabwaku?» Yesu wumuvutwadi: «Ngeyi meni wuzimbudibwa.»<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mesa ma Pfumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mlk 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Buna bakala dya, Yesu wábonga dipha, wásambuladya amana wábukunadya, wáhanadya kwena balonguki, amana wuzimbudi: «Bongenu, dyenu, lwalu lwena lutu lwa meni.» <verse eid="MAT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Amana wábonga mbungu mosi, kunima dya kuvutula matondu, wábahekaya mu kuzonza: «Nwenuya benu boosu, <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>mukuma mama menina menga ma meni, ma bulunda bwa Nzambi, mana matyakani kikuma kya batu lawu mu kuloluka kwa masumu. <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Amana yiluzimbwadi, mukyedika: tuka buthwena, yinwáku hika vinu dina, tii yi kuna kilumbu kina yinwádya ha kimosi yi benu muna Kipfumu kya Tata wama.» <verse eid="MAT 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Amana buna báyimbila mikunga mya mukinzi, bálubuka, benda ku mongu wa Olive.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuni ni Phetelu kamutuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Ywn 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Hanga Yesu wubazimbwadi: «Benu boosu lwathína muna phipha yayi, mukuma tala mana másonama: "Yimúhonda kalema, amana kibuka kya mikoku kyamwángalakana." <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Kaasi kunima kufutumuka kwama, yilútekidila kuna Ngadidi.» <verse eid="MAT 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Amana mu kuvutula, Phetelu wumuzimbwadi: «Yuka ni boosu bakútina, meni, ketibwe, yikútinaku.» <verse eid="MAT 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Mu kyedika yikuzimbwadi: mu phipha yayi, khoku kakókulaku kedi, wáthuna mbala tatu.» <verse eid="MAT 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Phetelu wumuzimbwadi: «Keti kufwa, yifwa kumosi yi ngeyi, yikútunaku.» Balonguki boosu bazimbudi phi phila mosi.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusambidi kuna Ngetisemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mlk 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Hanga Yesu wísa yi bawu, homa hamosi bisi tela ni Ngetisemani, amana wuzimbudi kwena balonguki bandi: «Zakalenu hahaha, kithama kina yikwenda lombila meni kuna.» <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Wánata Phetelu yi bana ba Zebeteya bawu bodi, wáyandika kuyuka kyadi yi kiwayi. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Hanga wubazimbwadi: «Mbundu yama mu kiwayi yenina yi kuna lufwa; salenu haha, amana kalenu batokama kumosi yi meni.» <verse eid="MAT 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Wáhaluka koma, wáfukama, mbunzu mu mafu, mu kulombila yi kuzimbula: «Tata wama, yuka ni bwalendakana, khatwala bungu dyadi; salaku bwosu buna nzodi meni, kaasi bwosu wuzodi ngeyi.» <verse eid="MAT 26:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Tangwa kisa vutuka kwena balonguki, kábawana baleka; amana wuzimbudi kwena Phetelu: disongidila lulendiku kutokama keti tangwa dimosi kumosi yi meni? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Tokamenu, lombilenu phi, ndangu lubwaku mu kimeka. Kitembu kyazyama kyenina kaasi lutu lwalembwa lwenina.<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Wáhaluka hika mbala ya zodi mu kulombila bwabu: «Tata wama, bufwaniku ni mbungu yayi ndwayoku, mbatanana buna, yambula luzolu lwaku lwasalama!» <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Amana wisa vutuka hika, wubawani baleka, mukuma mesu ma bawu zitu mákala. <verse eid="MAT 26:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Yesu wábasisa, wáhaluka hika, wulombidi mbala ya tatu mu kulandulula ndinga meni zimosi. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Hanga wisi vutuka kwena balonguki amana wubazimbwadi: «Lunimbi hika, lulembwi kwenu! Talenu, tangwa dibwesuki, amana Mwana wa mutu bamulambudi ku moku ma basumuki. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Telamenu, thwendenu! Tala, wekina bela-bela wuna ndambudiki!»<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamukwati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Ywn 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Muna tangwa meni dina kakala zonza Yesu, Yutasi, mosi wa bawu kumi yi bodi wátula hakana, hakimosi yi mulumba-lumba wa batu bakala yi mbedi za vita yi khindi muna moku. Bwosu bábatuma kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi bambuta ba bayuta. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Amana wuna wámulambula, wábasongila kidimbu kimosi mu kuzimbula: «Wuna yibúmbakana, yandi wuna, mukwatenu.» <verse eid="MAT 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Amana buna kábwesuka kwena Yesu, wuzimbudini: «Mboti, Labuni!» Amana wámubumbakana. <verse eid="MAT 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Amana Yesu wumuzimbwadi: «Mukwetu, kikuma kya dyambu dina wisidi, saladya.» Hanga buna bábwesuka, bamusimbi Yesu amana bamukwati. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Amana mosi wa bana bákala yi Yesu, wálubula mbedi ya phoku yandi, hanga wuhuti kutu dya musadi wa mbuta wa banganga Nzambi. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Hanga Yesu wumuzimbwadi: «Vutula mbedi yaku ya phoku muna kilalu kyandi, mukuma boosu bana banwánina ku mbedi, ku mbedi phi bafwíla. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Kondilo wubanzi ni pfwaniku yimubokwadila Tata wama, amana kaphitika bibuka bya banzyo kuluta kumi yi bodi? <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Abweti si malúngila Masonuku? Mana mabati zonza ni bulungi ni masalama bwabuna.» <verse eid="MAT 26:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, Yesu wuzimbudi kwena milumba-lumba mya batu: «Lwisi khwata yi mbedi yi khindi, hanga wuna yenina ndwandwa? Kinga yikala zakala bilumbu byosu mu nzu ya Nzambi mu kulonga, amana lwákhwataku. <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Kaasi mana moosu mabwini ndangu malungila Masonuku ma bambikudi.» Hanga balonguki boosu bamusisi, batini phi.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ku thwala ya kimvuka kya mbuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mlk 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Ywn 18:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Bana buna bámukwata Yesu, bámunata ku nzu ya Khayifu, mbuta wa banganga Nzambi, kuna bákutakanina balongi ba mitsiku yi bambuta ba Bayuta. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Amana Phetelu, yandi, kakala landa muna kyana, yi kuna kyanzala kya mbuta kya mbuta wa banganga Nzambi. Amana buna kákota muna kati, wuzakadi yi batsinzidi ndangu kazaya buna mamánisina. <verse eid="MAT 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Amana bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku yi kimvuka kyambuta<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mth 5:22</char></note> bakala sanda kimbangi kya mbi kikuma kya Yesu, ndangu bamuzengila mukanu wa lufwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>Kaasi bámonaku, mbatanana lawu dya bambangi ba luvunu bisa funda, kaasi ku tsuka, bisa bwesuka bodi, <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>bazimbudi: «Yandu-yandu kakala zimbula: Pfwani yiwulumuna nzu ya Nzambi yayi, amana thunguludiya mu bilumbu bitatu."» <verse eid="MAT 26:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Amana mbuta wa banganga Nzambi buna kátelama, wázimbula kwena yandi: «Keti kima wubatiku vutula? Biki wuzonzi kikuma kya bimbangi byabi babati kufundila baba?» <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Kaasi Yesu wádibata. Amana mbuta wa banganga Nzambi wumuzimbwadi: «Mu khumbu ya Nzambi wa moya mbati zenga, wátuzimbwala yuka ni ngeyi, wenina Kidisitu, Mwana wa Nzambi?» <verse eid="MAT 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadi: «Ngeyi meni wuzimbudibwa. Kaasi yiluzimbwadi hika: tuka buthwena, lwamúmona Mwana wa mutu wazakala kuna koku dya kitata dya Mukwa Ngolu zoosu yi mu kukwisa hana thandu ya matuti ma zilu.» <verse eid="MAT 26:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Hanga mbuta wa banganga Nzambi wuyati miledi myandi, amana wuzimbudi: «Nzambi kabati tukwana! Kikuma kya biki twasósila hika bambangi? Talenu buthwena luyuki benu-benu ngusi; <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Abweti lubanzi benu?» Amana boosu mu kuvutula, bazimbudi: «Bulombi kafwa.» <verse eid="MAT 26:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Hanga bamuhumi metya kuna mbunzu yandi amana bamuti makufi bahika phi bamuti mbata, <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>mu kuzonza: «Bikuleti, kamba ngeyi Kidisitu wenina, keti nati wukubeti!»<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phetelu wumutuni Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mlk 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Ywn 18:15-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Phetelu kákala wazakala kuna phenza, hana kyanzala. Amana musadi wa mukhetu mosi wábwesuka kwena yandi mu kuzimbula: «Ngeyi phi, wákala yi Yesu, mwisi Ngadidi.» <verse eid="MAT 26:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Kaasi yandi wátuna ku thwala ya batu boosu, mu kuzimbula: «Nzayimoku mana wubati zimbula.» <verse eid="MAT 26:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Buna kakala kwenda kuna mwelu wa kyanzala, wumoni hika musadi wahika wa mukhetu amana yandu-yandu wuzimbudi kwena bakwawu: «Yandu phi kákadikini yi Yesu mwisi Nazaleti.» <verse eid="MAT 26:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Amana wutuni hika yi ndefi: «Yimuzayiku mutu yandu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Kunima dya mwana tangwa, bábwesuka batu bákala hana, bazimbudi kwena Phetelu: «Mu kyedika, ngeyi wenina phi mosi hana kati dya bawu; mukuma nzonzidi yaku yibatibwa songila mboti-mboti.» <verse eid="MAT 26:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Hanga Phetelu wuyandiki kudya ndefi: «Yukani meni yimuzayi mutu yandu, Nzambi kapheka ndola!» Amana muna tangwa meni dina, khoku mosi wákokula, <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Amana Phetelu wáyubuka ndinga yina ya Yesu: «Ku thwala ya kukokula kwa khoku, mbala tatu wathúna meni.» Amana wálubuka, wádila phi lawu.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamunati ku nganda ya Philatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mlk 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Ywn 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Kuma buna kwakhya, lukutakanu lwásalama, bambuta ba banganga Nzambi boosu yi bambuta Bayuta bákasa fwongu kikuma kya Yesu ndangu bamuhondisa. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Amana buna bámukasa, bámunata, bámulambula kwena Philatu,<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Philatu kakala kilolu mwisi Loma mu kinzunga kya Yuteya tukila mvula 26-36 ku nima lubutuku lwa Yesu Kidisitu. Philatu kakala yi mikanu mya lawu kwena Bayuta muna tangwa dina kakala kilolu kya mbanza. Mbala za lawu, kakala tonda kulungisa luzolu lwa Bayuta kikuma kya mikanu. Kakhana totisa kifulu kyandi kya kilolu mu mbanza wadi ni kakalaka yi mikanu. </char></note> kilolu mwisi Loma.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lwa Yutasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Mhb 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Hanga buna kámona Yutasi, wuna wámulambula, ni bamuzengidi lufwa, wázosuluka, wávutula makuta makumatatu kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi bambuta ba Bayuta. <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>Wubazimbwadi: «Tsumuki mu kulambula menga ma mutu wakonda sala mbi.» Bawu bazimbudi: «Khi mambu ngeyi yi betu! Makutadi ngeyi meni!» <verse eid="MAT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Amana buna kálosa makuta meni mana muna nzu ya Nzambi, wenda, amana wádikudika. <verse eid="MAT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Bambuta ba banganga Nzambi buna bátonguna makuta meni mana, bazimbudi: «Bulombiku kutimbulama mu sanduku dya nzu ya Nzambi, kikuma thalu ya menga.» <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Lukutakanu buna lwásalama, makuta mana básumbilama kilanga kya mutu wuna wakala bumba nzungu za tuma, kikuma kya mazyamu ma banzenza. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Ihana bátedilakya, «Kilanga kya menga» yi lelu dyadi. <verse eid="MAT 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Hanga malungidi mana mázonzama mu nzila ya mbikudi Yelemiya: «Bábonga makuta makumatatu, yena thalu yina bázenga bana ba Kiseledi kikuma kya yandi; <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>Hanga bahanima kikuma kya kilanga kya wuna wisi bumba nzungu, bwosu kátsilabwa yandi meni Pfumu.»<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ku thwala ya Philatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mlk 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Ywn 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Yesu buna kákala ku thwala ya Philatu, hanga wumuhyudi: «Ngeyi, kyamvu wa Bayuta wena?» Amana Yesu wuvutudi: «Ngeyi meni wuzimbudibwa.» <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Kaasi mu tangwa dina bakala mufunda kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi bambuta ba Bayuta, Yesu kávutulaku kima. <verse eid="MAT 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Hanga Philatu wumuzimbwadi: «Wubatiku yuka mambu moosu mana babati zonza kikuma kya ngeyi?» <verse eid="MAT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Kaasi kávutulaku ndinga keti mu dyambu dimosi, hanga Philatu yituki lawu.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamuzengidi lufwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mlk 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-40">Ywn 18:39-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:1-16">19:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Bwosu bwákala mu mukinzi wosu, Philatu kakala yambwadila mutu wa boloku mosi kikuma kya mulumba-lumba wa batu, wosu wuna bakala lomba. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Kinga, muna tangwa dina, kwákala yi mutu wa boloku mosi watoma zayakana, khumbu yandi [Yesu] Balabasi. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Bwosu bákala bakutakana, hanga Philatu wubahyudi: «Nati luzodi yiluyambwadila, [Yesu] Balabasi ho Yesu yandi bisi tela Kidisitu?» <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Mukuma wázaya kwandi ni kikuma kya kiphala bámulambwala. <verse eid="MAT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Amana buna kázakala ha kiti kya nganda, mukhetu wandi wumutumini ndinga: «Wukotaku mambu ma mutu wa masonga wuna, mukuma lelu, phasi lawu mboni mu ndosi, kikuma kya yandi.»<verse eid="MAT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi bambuta ba Bayuta bálwengisa milumba-lumba mya batu ndangu balomba Balabasi, amana bámuhondisa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Amana mu kuvutula, Philatu wubahyudi: «Nati, mu kati dya bawu bodi luzodi ni yiluyambwadila?» Bawu bavutudi: «Balabasi!» <verse eid="MAT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Philatu wábazimbwala: «Abweti si yimúhanga Yesu yandi bisi tela Kidisitu?» Boosu bavutudi: «Mukhoka ha kitakani!» <verse eid="MAT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Yandi wávutwakila: «Kikuma kya khi mbi kasadi?» Kaasi bawu báyandika kukalunga ngolu mu kuzimbula: «Bamukhoka ha kitakani.» <verse eid="MAT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Amana Philatu buna kámona ni heku kima kahanga, kaasi bwosu yálutakana mvwalangani, hanga wubongi mamba, wásukula moku kuna thwala ya mulumba-lumba wa batu, mu kuzonza: «Nzayiku dyambu ditadidi menga mama; benu, malutadi benu-benu!» <verse eid="MAT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Amana mu kuvutula, batu boosu bázimbula: «Menga mandi makala hana thandu ya betu yi bana betu!» <verse eid="MAT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Hanga wubalubwadi Balabasi; amana Yesu buna kamubetisa fimbu, wumulambudi ndangu bamukhoka ha kitakani.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baphumbulu bamuseyi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mlk 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Ywn 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Hanga baphumbulu ba Philatu bamubulumuni Yesu yi muna nganda ya yandi Philatu, amana bákhokika kibuka kya baphumbulu. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Bámuwomuna miledi, bámuvwatisa muzaka wumosi wa kabengi. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Bátunga mukhonzi wumosi wa tsaku, bámuvwatisaya kuna mutwa yi muswangina kuna koku dya kitata, amana, bwosu báfukama ku thwala ya yandi, bakala museya mu kuzimbula: «Mboti, kyamvu wa Bayuta!» <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Bakala muhuma metya bábonga muswangina amana beka muzyatula muna mutwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Kunima dya kumuseya, bámukatulawa muzaka wuna, bámuvwatisa hika miledi myandi, amana bámunata ndangu benda mukhoka ha kitakani.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamukhoki ha kitakani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Ywn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Mu kulubuka, bátundakana mutu mosi, mwisi Sileni, khumbu yandi Simoni; hanga bamulundiki ndangu kanata kitakani kya Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Bátula homa hana bisi tela ni Ngolungota, disongidila: «Kizika kya Kibelengenzi kya mutwa.» <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>Bamuheki kunwa vinu dya kubundikisa yi kisi dya khadi; buna káyedika, kázolaku kunwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Kunima dya kumukhoka ha kitakani, baphumbulu bákabana miledi myandi mu kubetilamya zeki. <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Kunima, bázakala hahana mu kumutanikina. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Amana báthetika hana thandu ya mutwa wandi bisona bina byákala tendula kikuma kya lufwa lwandi: «Yandu kenina Yesu, kyamvu wa Bayuta.» <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Hanga bakhokini hana kitakani bandwandwa bodi ha kimosi yi yandi, mosi ku koku dya kitata, mukwawu ku koku dya kimama.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Bana bákala mu kuluta, bákala mutukwana yi kunikisaka mutwa mya bawu; <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>amana bazimbudi: «Ngeyi wakala zimbula ni wawúlumuna nzu ya Nzambi amana mu bilumbu bitatu watúngululaya, dihulula ngeyi meni, yuka ni Mwana wa Nzambi wenina, amana tuluka ha kitakani!» <verse eid="MAT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Phila mosi phi bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku yi bambuta ba Bayuta bakala museya yi kuzonzaka: <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>«Batu bahika kakala hulula, kafwaniku kudihulula yandi meni! Kyamvu wa Kiseledi kenina: katuluka buthwena bwabu ha kitakani amana twakwikila mwena yandi. <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Kakala dihana kwena Nzambi, buthwena, kamuhulula yuka ni kisi muzola; mukuma kakala zimbula: "Mwana wa Nzambi yenina"!» <verse eid="MAT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Amana phila mosi yi bandwandwa bana bámukhoka bawu ha kitakani bákala mutukwana.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Ywn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Tuka tangwa dya tsinzi, phipha yábwa mu tsi yina yosu tii yi kuna tangwa dya tatu dya masikidika. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Amana bela-bela yi tangwa tatu dya masikidika, Yesu wákalunga mu ndinga ya ngolu: «Diya, Diya, lema sabakatani?» Disongidila: «Nzambi wama, Nzambi wama, kikuma kya biki wungyambwadidi?» <verse eid="MAT 27:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Amana bahika, mu kati dya bana bákala hakana, buna báyuka, bazimbudi: «Diya, kabati tela yandu.» <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Mosi muna kati dya bawu, wenda thinu, wábonga kitini kya dinyuka, wávundikikya muna vinu dya ngani, amana wákasadya ku miti, kamuheka yandi ndangu kanwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Kaasi bahika bakala zimbula: «Yambulenu, twatala kamba Diya kakwisa muhulula hahana!»<verse eid="MAT 27:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Amana Yesu wákalunga hika mu ndinga ya ngolu, wátabula moya. <verse eid="MAT 27:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Kutala muledi wa zitu wuna wakala kabisa kizika kyahedila yi kina kyákala kyahedila lawu mu nzu ya Nzambi wuyatukini mu byati byodi tuka ku londi yi kuna banda. Amana mafu mánikana, matadi phi máyatuka<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzu ya Nzambi yakala yi miledi myodi. Watheti wakala mu mwelu wa kizika kyahedila. Kizika kyahedila kyakala mbasi ya theti muna nzu ya Nzambi. Muledi wa zodi wakala ha kati dya kizika kyahedila yi kina kyahedila kuluta. Mbuta wa banganga-Nzambi lwesi wakala kota muna kizika kina kyahedila kuluta, mbala mosi muna mvula. Nzila yayi yibati zonzila muledi wa zodi. (Khaphu ya 26:3; Heb 9:3) </char></note>, <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>mazyamu másabuka, bamvumbi ba lawu ba batu ba Nzambi báfutumuka. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Bálubuka mu mazyamu, kunima dya lufutumuku lwa Yesu, bákota mu Yelusalemi, mbanza yatoma amana bádimonikisa kwena batu ba lawu. <verse eid="MAT 27:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Satudiyoni yi bana bakala kengila bawu Yesu, buna bámona ni mafu manikani yi mambu mana máluta; báyuka bweya bwa lawu, bazimbudi: «Mu kyedika, yandu Mwana wa Nzambi kákadi!» <verse eid="MAT 27:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Amana hákala hakana bakhetu balawu, babana bámusindikila Yesu tukidila ku Ngadidi mu kumusadila, bakala tala kuna kyana. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Ha kati dya bawu, hákala Madiya mwisi Makatala yi Madiya ngudi wa Zyaki yi Yozefu yi ngudi wa bana ba Zebeteya.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamuziki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Ywn 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Masikidika ha mábwa, wisa tula mvwama mosi, mwisi Adimate, khumbu yandi Yozefu, wuna wákala phi mulonguki wa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Wenda kwena Philatu, wálomba lutu lwa Yesu. Hanga Philatu wáhana muswa ni bamuhekalwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Amana Yozefu wábonga lutu lwa Yesu, wávungalwa ha muledi wa pha<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna tsadidi ya Bayuta, bakala vuya mananasi ma mutindu yi mutindu amana basitima kuna muledi wa kuvungila mvumbi kikuma kya kumufundika (Ywn 19:39-40). </char></note>, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>wásikulalwa muna mazyamu mandi ma pha mana kásima muna ditadi, amana buna kábundumuna kalunga tadi ku mwelu wa mazyamu, wenda kwandi. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Madiya mwisi Makatala yi Madiya wuna mukwawu, hana bákala, bazakala kuna thwala ya mazyamu.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Batshinzidi ba mazyamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Kilumbu kyalanda kifwani. Kyákala ku manima ma kilumbu kina bakala yidikila sabata, bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi Bafwadisi bákutakana kuna nzu ya Philatu <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>mu kuzimbula: «Mbuta-mutu, tubati bambuka ni mukwa bukamvi wuna, buna kákala wa moya, kázimbula: "Kunima bilumbu bitatu, yifútumuka." <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Disongidila ni senda bakengidila mboti-mboti mazyamu yi kuna kilumbu kya tatu, kondi lo, balonguki bandi bisa muyiba nana. Hanga bahuna kwena batu: "Wufutumuki ku bafwa." Holoni, bukamvi bwabu bwa tsuka bwalúta buna bwa theti.» <verse eid="MAT 27:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Philatu wubazimbwadi: «Talenu baba baphumbulu; ba kitshinzidi. Alwendenu, kengidilenu mboti-mboti mazyamu bwosu luzodidi.» <verse eid="MAT 27:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Hanga bendi, mu kukengila mboti-mboti, basya kidimbu kuna tadi dina dyákala fidinga mazyamu amana básisa batsinzidi.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Lufutumuku lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mlk 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Ywn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Kunima dya sabata, muna suka-suka dya kilumbu kya theti kya phosa, Madiya mwisi Makatala yi Madiya wuna mukwawu benda tala mazyamu. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Kutala mafu manikani ngolu; mukuma wanzyo mosi wa Pfumu wákulumuka ku zilu, wisa bundumuna tadi amana kákala wazakala hana thandu ya dyawu. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Kifwani kyandi kyakala kedyamina hanga mitsyenzya, miledi myandi myákala mya phembi ya lawu. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Kikuma kya bwabuna, batsinzidi báyuka bweya bwa lawu. Bakala tekita amana bákituka hanga batu bafwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Mu kutambula ndinga, wanzyo wázimbula kwena bakhetu: «Lukalaku yi bweya, benu, mukuma nzayi ni Yesu wuna bákhoka ha kitakani lubati sanda; <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>keku haha, wufutumukini bwosu kázimbula. Alwisa, talenu homa hana kakadikini walandalala. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Alwenda tswatsu, zimbulenu kwena balonguki bandi: "Wufutumuki ha kati dya bafwa, amana tala wulutekididi kedi mu Ngadidi; kwakuna lwámumona." Tala, mana khádiki mawu mu kuluzimbwala.» <verse eid="MAT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Amana bákatuka tswatsu ku mazyamu, bákala bazakama yi kitswi yi kyesi kya lawu amana bakhetu benda thinu kusamuna kwena balonguki bandi. <verse eid="MAT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Kutala, Yesu wisi batundakana mu kuzimbula: «Kimboti kyenu!» Bawu bábwesuka, bámubumbakana muna malu mu kumufukamina. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Hanga Yesu wubazimbwadi: «Lukalaku yi bweya. Alwenda, samunenu kwena baphangi bama ni benda kuna Ngadidi: amana bangwána kwakuna.»<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Meni dya batsinzidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Tangwa bakala mu nzila, ndambu ya batshinzidi ba mazyamu, bisa mu mbanza, basamuni kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi moosu mosu mana máluta. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Buna bákutakana yi bambuta ba Bayuta, lukutakanu lwásalama: bábonga lukanu, amana bahana mbongu za lawu kwena baphumbulu <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>mu kuzimbula: «Zimbulenu: "Balonguki bandi bisi muyibaka muna phipha, bwosu tukadiki betu banimba." <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Amana yuka ni kilolu mwisi Loma kayukabwa, betu twamúlembika, ndangu benu baluyangisaku.» <verse eid="MAT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Batsinzidi bátambula mbongu, báhanga bwosu bábazimbwala. Amana ndinga yayi yámwangana kwena Bayuta tii yi kuna lelu dyadi.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kituma kya Yesu kwena balonguki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Ywn 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mhb 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Balonguki kumi yi mosi benda ku Ngadidi, kuna mongu wuna kábazimbwala Yesu ni benda<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala muna nzila ya 26:32.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Tangwa bámumona, báfukama, kaasi bahika bákala yi keti-keti. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Yesu wábwesuka, wuzimbudi kwena bawu: «Kipfumu kyosu báphekakya muna zilu yi ha tsi. <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Disongidila alwendenu, kitulenu batu ba makanda moosu balonguki bama; babotikenu mu khumbu ya Tata yi ya Mwana yi Kitembu Kyatoma; <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>balongenu mu kusadila moosu mana yilulongikidi. zayenubwoku, meni yenina yi benu bilumbu byosu tii yi kuna tsuka ya tsi.»<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
